<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">Kamtawngnae</book>
  <para style="h">Kamtawngnae</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kamtawngnae</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kamtawngnae</para>
  <para style="mt">Kamtawngnae</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Apuengcue vah, Cathut ni kalvan hoi talai a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Talai teh meilam tawn hoeh. Ahrawng lah doeh ao. Hmonae ni kadung poung e hmuen a ramuk. Cathut e Muitha teh tui van a kâroe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cathut ni angnae awm seh ati teh angnae teh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Angnae teh Cathut ni a khet navah ahawi ati teh, Cathut ni angnae teh hmonae dawk hoi a kapek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cathut ni angnae hah khodai telah a phung, hmonae hah karum telah a phung. Hottelah, tangmin hoi amom teh apasuek hnin lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hahoi Cathut ni, tui lungui lathueng awmseh, tui hoi tui kâkapek seh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hottelah Cathut ni lathueng a sak teh, lathueng lah kaawm e tui hoi lathueng rahim lah kaawm e tui hah a kapek teh hottelah ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cathut ni lathueng teh kalvan telah a phung. Hottelah tangmin hoi amom teh apâhni hnin lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hahoi Cathut ni kalvan rahim kaawm e tui hmuen buet touh koe awm seh. Kaphui e talai kamnuek seh ati e patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cathut ni kaphui e talai hah talai telah ati teh, tuikamuemnae teh tuipui telah a phung. Cathut ni a khet navah ahawi telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hahoi Cathut ni hettelah ati, talai ni pho, cati ka tâcawt sak e cakung, a paw ka paw e thingkung, amamouh a coung e patetlah atimu katâcawtkhai e naw hah paw naseh ati e patetlah ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Talai ni pho, cati ka tâcawt sak e cakung, ati ka tawn ni teh a paw ka paw e thingkungnaw a pâw sak. Hotnaw hah Cathut ni a khet navah ahawi telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hottelah tangmin hoi amom teh apâthum hnin lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hahoi Cathut ni karum dawk hoi khodai kapek nahanelah, kalvan e lathueng dawk angnae awm seh, mitnoutnae tue, hnin hoi kumnaw awmseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kalvan e lathueng dawk, talai angnae ka poe hanelah, angnae awmseh telah ati e patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hahoi Cathut ni angnae kalen kahni touh a sak teh, khodai ka uk hanelah kalen e buet touh, karum ka uk hanelah kathoenge buet touh hoi âsinaw a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cathut ni talai dawk ang sak hanelah thoseh, khodai hoi karum ka uk hanelah thoseh, hmonae dawk hoi angnae kapek hanelah thoseh, kalvan e lathueng dawk a hruek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hote hah Cathut ni a khet navah, ahawi telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hottelah tangmin hoi amom teh apali hnin lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hahoi, Cathut ni kahring ni teh kâroe e saring, tui ni pungdaw sak naseh. Tavanaw hai kalvan e lathueng dawk kamleng naseh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hahoi, Cathut ni tuipui dawk e saring kalenpoungnaw, kahring ni teh kâroe e saringnaw tui ni amamouh coungnae patetlah lengkaleng a pungdaw sak teh, rathei ka tawn e tavanaw hai amamouh coungnae patetlah lengkaleng a sak. Hote hah Cathut ni a khet navah ahawi telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cathut ni hote saringnaw hah yawhawi a poe teh, moikapap pungdaw awh nateh, tuipui tuinaw dawk kawi sak awh. Tavanaw hai talai dawk pungdaw awh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hottelah tangmin hoi amom teh apanga hnin lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hahoi Cathut ni saring hoi moithangnaw, vonpui hoi kâva e moithangnaw talî ni pungdaw sak seh telah ati e patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hottelah Cathut ni moithangnaw, saringnaw, vonpui hoi kâva e moithang pueng teh a sak. Hote hah Cathut ni a khet navah ahawi telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hahoi Cathut ni, mamae mei hoi kâvan lah, meikalat lah tami sak awh sei. Ahni ni tuipui dawk e tanganaw, kalvan e tavanaw, talai dawk e saring pueng hoi, vonpui hoi kâva e saring pueng e lathueng kâ tawn seh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hottelah Cathut ni amae mei hoi kâvan lah, amae meikalat lah tongpa hoi napui hah a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hahoi ahnimouh roi hah Cathut ni yawhawinae a poe teh, Cathut ni ahnimouh roi koe, canaw moikapap khe nateh pungdaw awh. Talai dawk kawi awh nateh, tâ awh loe. Tuipui dawk e tanganaw, kalvan e tavanaw, talai dawk vonpui hoi kâva e moithang pueng koe kâ tawn awh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hahoi Cathut ni khenhaw! talai dawk cati ka tâcawt sak e cakung aphunphun, a paw dawk a mu kaawm e thingkung pueng, na ca awh hanelah kai ni na poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hahoi, talai e moithang, kalvan e tava, hoi kahring niteh, talai dawk vonpui hoi kâva e moithang pueng ni a ca hanelah, pho kahring aphunphun ka poe telah ati e patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hahoi, Cathut ni a sak e pueng a khet navah, ahawipoung telah ati. Hottelah tangmin hoi amom teh ataruk hnin lah ao.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hottelah kalvan hoi talai, a thung kaawm e pueng teh koung a cum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hahoi, a cum e thaw hah asari hnin dawk Cathut ni a pâpout. Hahoi, thaw pueng a cum dawkvah, asari hnin a kâhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hottelah, Cathut ni asari hnin hah yawhawi a poe teh a thoungsak. Bangkongtetpawiteh, a sak e hnopueng koung a cum toung dawkvah, hote hnin dawk a kâhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hetenaw teh kalvan hoi talai a saknae hnin navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />talai dawk phokung pâw hoehnahlan, law dawk patue e hai a pâw hoehnahlan, BAWIPA Cathut ni talai van khorak sak hoeh rah. Talai dawk ka tawk hane tami hai awm hoeh rah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hatei, talai dawk hoi tui kahû a tâco sak teh, talai pueng a duk sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hahoi, BAWIPA Cathut ni talai dawk e vaiphu hoi tami a sak teh, hringnae kâha a hnawng dawk hoi a poe hnukkhu tami teh kahring e tami lah a kangcoung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hahoi BAWIPA Cathut ni kanîtholah, Eden hmuen dawkvah, takha buet touh a sak teh, a sak e tami hah hawvah a hruek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hote talai dawk a meikahawi niteh, cakawi thingkung aphunphun a pâw sak. Takha lungui vah, hringnae thingkung hoi thoe hoi hawi panuenae thingkung hai a pâw sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Takha kaduksak hanelah, Eden hoi tui buet touh a lawng teh, takha lawilah hoi pali touh lah a kampek teh tuisei pali touh lah a coung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Apasueke tui min teh Pishon. Sui onae Havilah ram pueng, kâkalup lah a lawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hote ram dawk e sui teh, ahawi. Hote hmuen koe Dellium hoi Onyx talung aphu kaawm e hai ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Apâhni e tui min teh Gihon. Kush ram kâkalup lah a lawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hahoi apâthum e tui min teh Khiddekel. Assiria ram kanîtholah a lawng teh, apali e tui min teh Euphrates.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut ni tami a la teh, Eden takha dawk thaw tawk hane hoi khetyawt hanelah a hruek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hahoi, BAWIPA Cathut ni tami koe kâ a poe e teh, thoe hoi hawi panuenae thingkung hloilah, hote takha dawk kaawm e thingpaw pueng teh, na ca thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hatei, thoe hoi hawi panuenae thingpaw teh na cat mahoeh. Na cat pawiteh, na ca hnin na due roeroe han atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hahoi, BAWIPA Cathut ni tongpa teh amadueng ao e hawihoeh a titeh, kabawmkung kahawi ka sak pouh han ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut ni talai a la teh, talai van e saring pueng hoi kalvan e tava pueng a sak hnukkhu, min phung hanelah, Adam koe a thokhai. Adam ni hai a thokhai e saring pueng min a phung e patetlah min lengkaleng a tawn awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hottelah, saringpueng, kalvan e tava pueng, moithang pueng Adam ni min a phung. Hatei, Adam kabawmkung kahawi awm hoeh rah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, BAWIPA Cathut ni Adam mat a i sak teh, a i lahun nah a nâhru buet touh a rayu pouh teh, a tak hoi bout a pâbing pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hahoi, BAWIPA Cathut ni tongpa dawk hoi a rayu e a nâhru hoi napui a sak teh, tongpa koe a thokhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hahoi, Adam ni hethateh, ka hru thung e ka hru, ka tak thung e ka tak doeh. Tongpa thung e rayu e lah ao dawkvah, napui telah phung hanelah ao ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, tongpa ni manu hoi na pa a ceitakhai han. Hathnukkhu, a yu hoi a kâpahlawm vaiteh, takthai buet touh lah a coung han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tongpa hoi a yu teh, caici lah ao roi eiteh, kayanae tawn roi hoeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />BAWIPA ni a sak e moithang pueng hlak tahrun teh huenghai kaawm poung e lah ao dawkvah, napui koe nangmouh roi ni takha dawk e thingpaw pueng cat hanh telah Cathut ni ati katang maw telah a pacei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Napui ni tahrun koevah, takha dawk kaawm e thingpawnaw teh na ca thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hatei, takha lungui kaawm e thingpaw teh na cat mahoeh. Tek hai na tek mahoeh. Hoehpawiteh, na due han telah Cathut ni ati telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tahrun ni napui koe, khoeroe na dout mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, a paw na ca hnin vah, na mit ang roi vaiteh, thoe hoi hawi na panue roi han. Cathut boiboe lah na o roi han tie ama Cathut ni a panue dawk doeh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hote thingkung teh cakawi kahawi e lah, mitkhet kantang e lah, tami lungkaangsakkung a paw lah a hmu dawkvah, a la teh a ca. Hahoi ateng kaawm e a vâ hai a poe teh a ca.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, ahnimouh roi teh, a mit ang roi toung dawkvah, caici lah ao roi e hah a kâpanue roi. Hatdawkvah, thai hna a khui roi teh, a khohna roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hot hnin tangmin lah, takha dawk BAWIPA Cathut a tho e pawlawk ahnimouh roi yuvâ ni a thai navah, BAWIPA Cathut e hmaitung hoi hlout nahanelah takha thung e thingkung rahak a kâhro roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hatei, BAWIPA Cathut ni Adam a kaw teh, nâmaw na o atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tongpa ni, takha thung na lawk ka thai teh, caici lah ka o dawk ka taki teh ka kâhro telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />BAWIPA ni, apinimaw nang caici lah na o e hah a dei. Cat hanh ka tie thingpaw hah na ca toung maw telah a pacei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tongpa ni nang ni na poe e napui ni thingpaw na poe teh ka ca atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut ni, napui koevah, hete hno heh bangkong maw na sak telah a pacei navah, napui ni, tahrun ni na dum teh ka ca telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut ni tahrun koevah, hete hno na sak dawkvah, saring hoi moithang pueng hlakvah, thoebo lah na o han. Na vonpui hoi na thawn vaiteh, na hring nathung vaiphu na ca han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang hoi napui rahak, nang e catoun hoi napui e catoun rahak kai ni kâtarannae ka hruek han. Ahni ni na lû a phawm vaiteh, nang ni ahnie a khokpaimai na phawm pouh han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Napui koevah, camo na vawn navah patawnae ka pung sak vaiteh, na khe nah patawnae na khang han. Na ngainae teh na vâ hanelah ao vaiteh, na vâ ni na uk han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Adam koevah, na yu e lawk na tarawi teh, cat hanh telah kai ni kâ na poe e thingpaw na ca dawkvah, talai teh nang kecu dawk thoebo lah ao. Tha pataw laihoi na hringyung thung na tawk vaiteh, na ca han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pâkhingnaw hoi pâkhingkungnaw ka pâw sak vaiteh, law dawk hoi ka tâcawt e apawhik na ca han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na tâconae talai lah bout na ban hoehroukrak, na minhmai dawk hoi lahuntui tâco laihoi na ca han. Bangkongtetpawiteh, nang teh vaiphu e lah na o dawkvah, vaiphu lah bout na ban han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hahoi, Adam ni amae yu hah Evi telah min a phung. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahni teh kahring pueng e a manu lah ao dawk doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />BAWIPA Cathut ni Adam hoi a yu hanlah phaivuen angkidung a sak pouh teh, a khohna sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hahoi, BAWIPA Cathut ni tami teh, maimouh thung dawk e buetbuet touh hoi a kâvan toung dawkvah, thoe hoi hawi a panue toe. Atuteh, yungyoe hringnae coe hanelah a kut a kâyap vaiteh hringnae thingpaw khi vaiteh, a cakawi nahoeh toe telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, BAWIPA Cathut ni tami teh ama a tâconae talai dawk thaw tawk hanelah Eden takha thung hoi a pâlei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hottelah, tami hah a pâlei hnukkhu, avoivang kamrit thai e tahloi hoi Cherubim hah, hringnae thingkung lamthung ka ring hanelah, Eden takha kanîtholah a hruek.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Adam ni a yu Evi a panue teh, camo a vawn. Capa a khe teh, BAWIPA ni na kabawp dawk ca tongpa ka khe ati teh, Kain telah min a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hahoi, a nawngha Abel bout a khe. Abel teh tu kakhoumkung lah ao teh, Kain teh law kasakkung lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Atueng akuep torei teh, Kain ni amae law thung e a pawhiknaw hah BAWIPA koe a sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abel ni hai tu pasuek ka khe e hoi, kathâwnaw a sin. Hatdawkvah, BAWIPA ni Abel hoi a sin e hno teh a dâw pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hatei Kain hoi a sin e hno teh dâw pouh hoeh. Hatdawkvah, Kain teh a lung puenghoi a khuek dawkvah minhmai a mathoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />BAWIPA ni Kain koevah, Bangkongmaw na lungkhuek teh minhmai a mathoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kahawicalah na sak pawiteh ka dâw mahoeh maw. Kahawicalah na sak hoehpawiteh yon thuengnae sathei teh longkha koe a tabo. Ahnie a ngainae teh nange doeh. Hatei nang ni ahni na uk telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kain ni a nawngha Abel koevah law lah cet sei atipouh. Law a pha roi torei teh Kain ni a nawngha a taran teh a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, BAWIPA ni Kain koe, na maw na nawngha Abel te, telah a pacei navah, ahni ni ka panuek hoeh, ka nawngha ka khoum e nahoeh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hahoi, BAWIPA ni bangmaw na sak na nawngha e thi ni talai dawk hoi kai koe a hram toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na kut hoi na palawng e na nawngha thi, dâw hanelah apâhni ka ang e talai dawk hoi nang teh atu thoebo lah na o toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Talai dawk thaw na tawk navah a thaonae nang koe tâcawt mahoeh toe. Nang teh talai vah, ka yawng e tami hoi ka kâva a e tami lah na o han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kain ni BAWIPA koevah, reknae ka hmu e heh ka phu thai e hlak a lenhnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sahnin teh talai hoi na pâlei toe ti ka panue. Na hmaitung hoi hro lah ka o toe. Talai van vah ka yawng e hoi yuengyoe kâva e tami lah kaawm vaiteh, ka hmawt e pueng ni na thei han doeh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hatei, BAWIPA ni Kain koe nang ka thet e pueng teh let sari touh hoi a moi ka pathung han atipouh. Hahoi, BAWIPA ni Kain ka hmawt e tami, buet touh ni hai a thei hoeh nahanlah ahni dawk noutnae a ta pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, Kain teh BAWIPA e hmaitung hoi a tâco teh, Eden kanîtholah, Nod ram dawk kho a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kain ni a yu a panue teh, camo a vawn teh Enok a khe. Kho a thawng teh a capa min lah Enok kho telah min a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hahoi Enok ni Irad a khe. Irad ni Mehujael a khe. Mehujael ni Methushael a khe. Methushael ni Lamek a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, Lamek ni a yu kahni touh a la teh, apasueke min teh Adah, apâhni e min teh Zillah doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Adah ni Jabal a khe. Ahni teh rimnaw dawk kho ka sak e lah ao teh saringnaw kapacakung e na pa lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A nawngha e min teh Jubal. Ahni teh ratoung hoi vovitnaw ka pâtu e na pa lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zillah ni hai Tubal-kain a khe. Ahni teh rahum hoi sum ka dei pueng e na pa lah ao. Naamah teh Tubal-kain e tawncanu lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hahoi, Lamek ni a yu roi Adah hoi Zillah koevah, ka lawk thai roi haw, patawnae na poe dawkvah tongpa buet touh ka thei. Na pacekpahlek dawkvah, thoundoun buet touh ka thei toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kain ni let sari touh e moipathungnae khang pawiteh, Lamek ni teh a let 70 touh hoi a khang han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hahoi, Adam ni a yu bout a panue teh, ca tongpa a khe. Seth telah min a phung. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Kain ni Abel a thei dawkvah Cathut ni alouke cati bout na poe telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Seth ni hai capa a khe teh Enosh telah min a phung. Hahoi tami ni Jehovah min kaw han a kamtawng awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Adam catounnaw cauk teh a rahim lae patetlah doeh. Cathut ni tami a sak navah amae meikalat lah a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tongpa hoi napui a sak teh yawhawinae a poe. A sak hnin ahnimouh roi teh tami telah min a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Adam teh kum 130 touh a pha navah, ama hoi kâlat e ama hoi mei kâvan e ca tongpa a khe teh Seth telah min a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Seth a khe hnukkhu, Adam teh kum 800 touh a hring teh ca tongpanaw hoi napuinaw hai bout a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Adam teh kum 930 touh akuep navah a due.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Seth teh kum 105 touh a pha navah Enosh a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Enosh a khe hnukkhu Seth teh kum 807 touh a hring teh ca tongpanaw hoi napuinaw bout a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Seth teh a kum 912 touh akuep navah a due.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Enosh teh kum 90 touh a pha navah Kenan a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kenan a khe hnukkhu, Enosh teh kum 815 touh a hring teh ca tongpanaw hoi napuinaw khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Enosh teh kum 905 touh a hring teh a due.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kenan teh kum 70 touh a pha navah Mahalalel a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mahalalel a khe hnukkhu, Kenan teh kum 840 touh a hring teh ca tongpanaw hoi napuinaw bout a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kenan teh kum 910 touh a hring teh a due.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mahalalel teh kum 65 touh a pha navah Jared a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jared a khe hnukkhu, Mahalalel teh kum 830 touh a hring teh ca tongpanaw hoi napuinaw bout a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mahalalel teh kum 895 touh a hring teh a due.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jared teh kum 162 touh a pha navah Enok a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Enok a khe hnukkhu Jared teh kum 800 touh a hring teh ca tongpanaw hoi napuinaw bout a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jared teh kum 962 touh a hring teh a due.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Enok teh kum 65 touh a pha navah Methuselah a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Methuselah a khe hnukkhu Enok teh kum 300 touh thung Cathut hoi rei a ceio teh, ca tongpanaw hoi napuinaw bout a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Enok teh kum 365 touh a hring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Enok teh Cathut hoi cungtalah a ceio teh bout awmhoeh toe. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Cathut ni a la toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Methuselah teh kum 187 touh a pha nah Lamek a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lamek a khe hnukkhu Methuselah teh kum 782 touh a hring teh ca tongpanaw hoi napuinaw bout a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Methuselah teh kum 969 touh a hring teh a due.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lamek teh kum 182 touh a pha navah ca tongpa a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />BAWIPA ni thoebonae talai dawk kut hoi thaw tawk awh teh, patang khangnae dawk hoi lung na pahawi han ati teh, Noah telah min a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Noah a khe hnukkhu Lamek teh kum 595 touh a hring teh ca tongpanaw hoi napuinaw bout a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lamek teh kum 777 touh a hring teh a due.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Noah teh kum 500 touh a pha nah Shem, Ham hoi Japheth a khe.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Talai vah tami pungdaw a kamtawng navah, canunaw a khe awh teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cathut e capanaw ni tami e canunaw a meihawi e a hmu navah a ngai e patetlah a rawi awh teh, a paluen awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hat torei teh, BAWIPA ni ka muitha teh taminaw koe yungyoe kaawm sak mahoeh toe. Bangkongtetpawiteh, tami teh tak lah ao dawkvah, atu hoi teh tami e a hringnae teh kum 120 touh han toe telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hatnae tueng dawk Nephilimnaw teh talai van ao awh. Hathnukkhu, Cathut e capanaw ni tami e canunaw a yonkhai awh teh, ahnimouh hanelah canaw a khe awh. Hote taminaw teh ayan e tueng dawk Athakasaipounge hoi min kamthang e naw lah ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />BAWIPA ni talai van dawk tami e thoenae a len e hoi lungpouk pueng pou a payon toe tie a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hahoi BAWIPA ni talai van tami a sak e hah a lungmathoe teh a lung caca a pataw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, BAWIPA ni ka sak e tami teh talai dawk hoi ka takhoe han toe. Tami hai, saring hai, vonpui hoi kâvanaw hoi kalvannaw dawk e tavanaw hai, ahnimanaw ka sak e dawk ka lung caca a pataw telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hatei Noah teh BAWIPA lungyouk e tami lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hethateh, Noah e catounnaw doeh. Noah teh tamikalan, a miphun dawk toun han kaawm hoeh e tami lah ao. Cathut hoi cungtalah a ceio.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Noah ni Shem, Ham, hoi Japheth, ca tongpa kathum touh a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hat navah, talai teh Cathut hmalah karawk e lah ao. Talai teh yonnae hoi akawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cathut ni talai a khet navah, karawk e lah ao e hah a hmu. Bangkongtetpawiteh, talai van e tami pueng e takthai lamthung teh koung a ro toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Cathut ni Noah koevah takthai pueng e a poutnae teh ka hmaitung a kamnue toe. Ahnimouh kecu dawk talai teh yonnae hoi akawi toe. Talai hoi cungtalah ahnimanaw teh ka raphoe katang han toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gopher thing hoi nama hanelah, long sak leih. Athung haiyah rakhannaw sak nateh, athung, avan petkâkalup lah thingtapi hoi kanan sin haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hote long teh asaw e dong 300, akaw e dong 50, a rasang dong 30 touh a pha han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Long lemphu na sak vaiteh, a lathueng lahoi dong touh kakaw lah hlalangaw na sak vaiteh, tapang koe lah tho na sak han. Apasuekpoung, apâhni hoi apâthum telah coung thum touh lah na sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kahring e saring pueng, kalvan rahim hoi ka raphoe hanelah, talai van tuikamuem ka tho sak vaiteh, talai van kaawm pueng koung a due awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang koe ka lawkkam ka caksak han. Nama hoi capanaw na yu hoi langanaw teh long thung na kâen awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hahoi ka hring e saring pueng thung e anapui hoi anatongpa kahni touh hring sak hanelah, nang hoi cungtalah long thung na kâen sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tava dawk hai amae aphun lah, saring dawk hai amae aphun lah, vonpui hoi kâva e dawk hai amae aphun lah, aphun tangkuem dawk e kahni touh hring sak hanelah nang koe a tho awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hahoi nama ni na ca hane hoi saringnaw ni a ca hanelah, cakawi rawca aphunphun na la vaiteh, na pâkhueng han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cathut ni kâ a poe e patetlah Noah ni koung a sak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hathnukkhu vah, BAWIPA ni Noah koe bout a dei pouh e teh, atu e taminaw thung dawk nang teh ka hmalah tamikalan lah na o e ka panue dawkvah, na imthungkhu abuemlahoi long thung kâen awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kathounge saring dawk e anatongpa hoi anapui phun sari, kathounghoehe saring dawk e anatongpa hoi anapui phun hni touh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />kalvan e tava thung dawk e hai anatongpa hoi anapui phun sari touh telah lengkaleng talai van dawk hoi hlout sak hanelah, nama koe na thokhai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, atu hoi kamtawng vaiteh hnin sari touh akuep navah, hnin 40 touh hoi a rum 40 touh thung kho ka rak sak vaiteh, ka sak e kahring e pueng koung ka raphoe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />BAWIPA ni kâ a poe e patetlah Noah ni a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Talai van dawk tuikamuem a tho navah, Noah teh kum 600 touh a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuikamuem kecu dawk, Noah hoi a capanaw, a yu hoi a langanaw teh a hlout nahanelah long thung a kâen awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cathut ni Noah koe kâ a poe e patetlah kathounge saringnaw hoi kathounghoehe saringnaw tavanaw hoi vonpui hoi kâva e saringnaw dawk e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a napui hoi a na tongpanaw teh Noah hoi cungtalah long thung a kâen awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hnin sari touh akuep hnukkhu hoi tuikamuem teh talai van a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Noah a kum 600 nae kum, thapa ayung pahni, hnin 17 nah, kadung poung e tuikhu pueng a kamawng teh kalvannaw dawk e hlalangaw pueng hai a kamawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, hnin 40 touh hoi rum 40 touh talai van vah kho a rak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hote hnin dawk Noah hoi a capanaw, Shem, Ham, hoi Japheth, Noah e a yu hoi a langanaw teh long thung a kâen awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahnimouh hoi saring phun, sarang phun, talai dawk kâva e pueng dawk e phun, kamleng e tava phun, rathei ka tawn e pueng dawk e phun, a yuvâ lahoi long thung a kâen awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hringnae kâha ka tawn e pueng a yuvâ lahoi long thung Noah koe a kâen awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hottelah Cathut ni lawk a thui e patetlah saring thung dawk e anatongpa hoi anapui a kâen sak teh, BAWIPA ni Noah teh athung vah tho a khan sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuikamuem teh talai van hnin 40 touh thung a kamuem. Tui hoehoe a len teh talai dawk hoi long teh a kâtakhoe teh a tawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Talai van tui hoehoe a len teh, long teh tui van lah hoehoe a kâtawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hahoi, tui teh talai van dawk a tha hoehoe ao teh, kalvan rahim kaawm e mon ka rasang pueng koung a muem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tui ni a muem e monnaw e a lathueng tui teh dong 15 touh arasang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, talai van ka kâroe e tava, sarang, saring, talai dawk ka kâva e saring pueng hoi tami pueng teh koung a due awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A oung lah kaawm e pueng hai koung a due.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hottelah talai van kaawm ni teh hringnae ka tawn e pueng, tami hoi saring, a von hoi ka kâvanaw hoi kalvan e tavanaw koung a thei. Noah hoi cungtalah long thung kaawmnaw dueng doeh kahlout.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hnin 150 touh thung tui teh talai van a kamuem.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hateiteh, Cathut ni Noah hoi cungtalah long thung kaawm e kahring e pueng hoi saring pueng teh pahnim hoeh. Hahoi Cathut ni kahlî a tho sak teh tui a kum sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka dungpoung koe e tui kâkhunaw hoi kalvan e hlalangawnaw hai a khan teh khorak e a dep sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Talai van e tui hah, pout laipalah a kum sak teh, hnin 150 touh aloum hnukkhu tui teh a hak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hottelah long teh thapa yung sarinae hnin 17 nah Ararat mon dawk a kâhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahranae thapa totouh tui teh pout laipalah, a kum cathuk. Thapa yung hra, apasuek hnin dawk monsomnaw teh a kamnue .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hahoi, hnin 40 touh abaw hnukkhu, Noah ni long dawk e hlalangaw a sak e a paawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vonga buet touh a patoun teh, talai van tui a hak hoehroukrak a voivang lah yuengyoe a kamleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hahoi talai van e tui a hak toung maw tie panue thai nahanlah âbakhu hah ama koehoi a patoun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hateiteh âbakhu ni a kâhat nahan a hmu hoeh dawkvah, long thung ama koe bout a ban. Bangkongtetpawiteh, tui teh talai van koung a kamuem rah. Noah ni a kut a dâw teh âbakhu a la hnukkhu, long thung ama koe bout a pakhum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hnin sari touh bout ao hnukkhu hote âbakhu hah long thung hoi bout a patoun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tangmin lah âbakhu teh Noah koe bout a ban teh, a pahni hoi ka hringsuep e Olive hna a thokhai teh, Noah ni talai van tui a hak toe tie a panue .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hnin sari touh bout aloum hnukkhu hote âbakhu, bout a patoun teh ama koe bout ban hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kum 601, apasueke thapa apasuek hnin navah, talai van e tui pueng teh koung a hak. Hatdawkvah, Noah ni long ramuknae a hawng teh a khet navah talai van remke e hah a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Apâhni e thapa, hnin 17 nah, talai teh remphui toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hottelah Cathut ni Noah koevah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nama hoi na yu, na capanaw hoi na langanaw, long thung hoi tâcawt awh leih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang koe kaawm e moithang, saring pueng, tava pueng, vonpui hoi kâva e pueng, talai van ca a khe vaiteh, pungdaw thai nahanelah, tâcawtkhai leih, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Noah teh ama koe kaawm e a capanaw hoi a yu, a capanaw hoi a yunaw hoi a tâco awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Moithang, saring pueng, a von hoi kâva e pueng, tava phunkuep hoi talai van kâroe e pueng long thung hoi a tâco awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hahoi, Noah ni BAWIPA hanelah khoungroe a sak teh, khoungroe dawk hmaisawi thuengnae a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />BAWIPA ni hai hmuitui hmui a thai teh, kai ni taminaw hanelah, talai teh thoe bout ka bo mahoeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, taminaw teh a nawca hoi lungthin pouknae a mathoe. Kai ni atu ka sak e patetlah kahring e pueng ka raphoe mahoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Talai tueng ao nathung, cati patuenae tueng hoi anae tueng, pâdingnae hoi abetnae, kompawi tue hoi kasik tue, khodai karum nâtuek hai ka pout sak mahoeh telah ati.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hottelah Cathut ni Noah hoi a canaw yawhawinae a poe teh, ahnimouh koe, ca moi khe awh, pungdaw awh nateh, talai van kawi awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Talai van moithang, saring phunkuep, kalvan e tava phunkuep, talai van a von hoi kâva e pueng, hoi tui thung e tanga pueng ni nangmouh na taki vaiteh a pâyaw awh han. Hote moithang pueng teh nangmae kut dawk na poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kahring ni teh kâroe e pueng nangmouh han rawca lah ao han. Hnopai pueng, anhla kahring pueng totouh na poe awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hottelah a moi hah a hringnae a thi hoi hmai na cat awh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hahoi, nangmae hringnae thi phu teh ka hei han. Tami saring pueng koe ka hei han. Tami tangkuem e hmaunawnghanaw koe, tami e hringnae phu teh ka hei roeroe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Apipatethai tami e thi ka palawng e tami teh tami ni thi palawng lah ao van han. Bangkongtetpawiteh, tami teh Cathut ni amae meikalat lah a sak e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hateiteh, nangmouh teh ca khe awh nateh pungdaw awh. Talai van vah canaw moi khe awh nateh pungdaw awh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cathut ni Noah hoi a capanaw koe bout a dei pouh e teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangmouh hoi thoseh, nangmae catoun hoi thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangmouh koe kaawm e kahring e moithang pueng, tava pueng, saring pueng, long thung hoi tâcokhai e saring pueng koe lawkkam ka caksak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangmouh koe lawkkam ka caksak e teh, tuikamuem lahoi nâtuek hai moithang pueng ka raphoe mahoeh toe. Talai teh tui hoi ka raphoe mahoeh toe telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cathut ni kai hoi nang rahak, nang koe kaawm e kâroe ni teh kahring e pueng hoi na catounnaw rahak vah ka sak e lawkkam mitnoutnae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kaie salumpa hah tâmai dawk ka hruek vaiteh, kai hoi talai rahak lawkkam mitnoutnae lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kai ni tâmai ka tabo sak navah, tâmai dawk salumpa a kamnue han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kai hoi nang rahak, kahring ni teh kâroe e pueng koe, ka lawkkam e pou ka pouk vaiteh, saring moithang pueng tuikamuem hoi ka raphoe mahoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tâmai dawk salumpa a paham e ka khet vaiteh, Cathut hoi talai van kaawm e kahring e saring moithang pueng rahak vah, yungyoe e lawkkam ka pouk han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hahoi Cathut ni Noah koe, hete teh kai hoi talai van kaawm e moithang saring pueng rahak vah, ka caksak e lawkkam mitnoutnae doeh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Long thung hoi a tâco navah Noah e a capanaw teh Shem, Ham, Japheth. Ham teh Kanaan e a na pa lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahnimanaw kathum touh teh Noah e a capanaw lah ao teh, ahnimanaw koehoi talai van taminaw a pungdaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Noah ni law sak a kamtawng teh, misur takha a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Misurtui hai a nei dawkvah a parui teh tawngtai lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kanaan e na pa Ham ni a na pa caici lah ao e a hmu teh alawilah kaawm e a hmaunawngha kahni touh koe a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hatei Shem hoi Japheth ni teh hni a la roi teh a loung dawk a thueng roi teh, kâhnawn laihoi a na pa e caicinae teh a ramuk pouh roi. Ahnimouh roi teh alawilah a kangvawi roi dawkvah, a na pa caici lah ao e hah hmawt roi hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Noah ni misur parui e a thangcuem torei teh a capa cahnoung e ni a sak e a panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Kanaan teh thoebo lah awm seh. A hmau roi koe san thung dawk e san lah awm seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hahoi, Shem e BAWIPA Cathut teh yawhawinae awm seh. Kanaan teh ahni koe san lah awm seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cathut ni Japheth teh len nateh roung seh. Shem e lukkareiim dawk awm seh. Kanaan teh ahni koe san lah awm seh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Noah teh tuikamuem a tho hnukkhu kum 350 a hring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Noah e a hringnae teh kum 950 touh a pha teh a due.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuikamuem a tho hnukkhu, Noah capa Shem, Ham hoi Japheth koehoi patuen a khe e casaknaw teh a rahim lae patetlah doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Japheth e capanaw teh Gomer, Magog, Madai, Javan, Tubal, Meshek hoi Tiras.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gomer e capanaw teh, Ashkenaz, Riphath hoi Togarmah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Javan e capanaw teh, Elishah, Tarshish, Kittim hoi Dodarim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahnimanaw teh miphun tangkuem, ram louk hmuennaw hah amamae ram, amamae lawk, amamae imthung lahoi amamae ram dawk lengkaleng kâkapek awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hahoi, Ham e capanaw teh Kush, Izip, Put hoi Kanaan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kush e capanaw teh Seba, Havilah, Sabtah, Raamah hoi hmaloe pasuek a thakasaipoung e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hahoi Kush ni Nimrod a khe teh, ahni teh talai van dawk hmaloe pasuek a thakasaipoung e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahni teh BAWIPA hmalah thakasaipounge lah ao. Hatdawkvah, BAWIPA hmalah thaonae hoi moikathaipounge Nimrod patetlah ouk ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A uknaeram a kamtawngnae teh, Babilon, Erek, Akkad hoi Shinar ram e Kalneh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hote ram koehoi Assiria ram lah a cei teh Nineveh, Rehobothir aka lahoi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nineveh hoi Kalah rahak kaawm e Resen khopui kalenpounge kho hmuen hai a thawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Izip e capanaw teh Ludim, Anamim, Lehabim, Naphtuhim,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathrusim (philistin hoi Kaphtorimnaw a tâconae) hoi Kapthorim,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kanaan e a camin teh Sidon, hahoi Heth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />hahoi Jebusit tami Amor tami, Girgashite tami,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hiv tami, Arkit tami, Sin tami,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Arvad tami, Zemarit tami hoi Hamath taminaw hah a khe. Hathnukkhu, Kanaan e ca catounnaw teh a kampek awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kanaannaw e a ramri Sidon hoi Gerar koelae Gaza totouh. Hahoi Sodom, Gomorrah, Admah, hoi Zeboiim kho a tapoung teh Lasha kho totouh a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hete miphunnaw teh Ham e ca catounnaw doeh. Ahnimanaw teh amamae imthung lahoi, lawk lahoi, kho hmuen lahoi, amamae ram thung kho lengkaleng a sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Japheth e nawngha, Hebru miphunnaw e a na pa Shem haiyah canaw a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Shem e capanaw teh Elam, Assyria, Arphaxad, Lud hoi Aram.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aram e capanaw teh Uz, Hul, Gether hoi Mash.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Arphaxad e capa teh Shelah, Shelah e capa teh Eber,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Eber ni capa kahni touh a khe. Buet touh e min teh Peleg. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahnie a se navah talai a kârei awh. A nawngha e min teh Joktan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Joktan e a capanaw teh, Almodad, Sheleph, Hazarmaveth, Jerah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hadoram, Uzal, Diklah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Obal, Abimael, Sheba,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ophir, Havilah, hoi Jobab,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kho a saknae hmuen teh Mesha kho koehoi kanîtholah Sephar mon totouh a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hete taminaw teh Shem e capanaw lah ao teh, amamae imthung lahoi, lawk, kho ram tangkuem dawk kho a sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A lathueng lae khenae hoi miphunnaw teh, Noah e imthung hoi a capanaw ni patuen a khe e catounnaw e kong doeh. Ahnimanaw teh tuikamuem a tho hnukkhu kho ram alouklah a kampek awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hatnavah lawk phun touh hoi lawk pan e buet touh dueng doeh kaawm .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kanîtholah hoi kahlawng a cei awh teh, Shinar ram dawk tanghling a hmu awh teh, haw vah kho hmuen a thawng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hat torei teh, buet touh hoi buet touh, tho awh amhru sak awh vaiteh kahawicalah pâeng awh sei telah a kâti awh. Hottelah talung e yueng lah amhru a hno awh teh pato nahanelah ailai a hno awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hahoi, tho awh mamouh hanelah khopui thawng awh vaiteh kalvan kadeng lah imrasang sak awh sei. Mamouh hanelah min kamsawng sak awh sei, telah hoehpawiteh talai van tangkuem koe kâkahei payon han doeh telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hatei taminaw e capanaw ni a thawng awh e khopui hoi imrasang khet hanlah BAWIPA teh a kum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />BAWIPA ni khenhaw! taminaw teh miphun buet touh lah ao awh teh lawk buet touh dueng a hno awh dawkvah, hete hno hmaloe pasuek a kamtawng awh. Sak han a ngai awh e kangangkung awm laipalah a sak awh han doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, tho awh, kum awh sei. Ahnimanaw buet touh hoi buet touh lawk kâthai awh hoeh nahanelah, lawk alouklouk lah sak awh sei telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hottelah BAWIPA ni ahnimanaw teh talai van a kampek sak awh teh khopui kangdout sak thai awh hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Babel telah min a poe. Bangkongtetpawiteh, hote hmuen koehoi BAWIPA ni lawk alouklouk lah a pan sak teh talai van koung a kampek sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hetnaw teh Shem e ca catounnaw doeh. Shem teh kum 100 touh a pha nah, tuikamuem a tho hnukkhu kum 2 touh aloum nah capa Arphaxad a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Arphaxad a khe hnukkhu, Shem teh kum 500 touh a hring teh ca tongpanaw hoi napuinaw bout a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Arphaxad teh kum 35 touh a pha nah capa Shelah a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Shelah a khe hnukkhu Arphaxad teh kum 403 touh a hring teh ca tongpanaw hoi napuinaw bout a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Shelah teh kum 30 touh a pha nah Eber a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eber a khe hnukkhu Shelah teh kum 403 touh a hring teh ca tongpanaw hoi napuinaw bout a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Eber teh kum 34 touh a pha nah capa Peleg a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Peleg a khe hnukkhu Eber teh kum 430 touh a hring teh ca tongpanaw hoi napuinaw bout a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Peleg teh kum 30 touh a pha navah Reu a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Reu a khe hnukkhu Peleg teh kum 209 touh a hring teh ca tongpanaw hoi napuinaw bout a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Reu teh kum 32 touh a pha navah Serug a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Serug a khe hnukkhu Reu teh kum 207 touh a hring teh ca tongpanaw hoi napuinaw bout a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Serug teh kum 30 touh a pha nah Nahor a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nahor a khe hnukkhu Serug teh kum 200 touh a hring teh ca tongpanaw hoi napuinaw bout a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nahor teh kum 29 touh a pha navah Terah a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Terah a khe hnukkhu Nahor teh kum 119 touh a hring teh ca tongpanaw hoi napuinaw bout a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Terah teh kum 70 touh a pha nah Abram, Nahor, hoi Haran a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Terah e casaknaw teh, Terah ni Abram, Nahor hoi Haran a sak. Haran ni Lot a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Haran teh a na pa Terah hmaitung, a khenae hmuen Khaldean taminaw a onae Ur kho dawk a due.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hahoi, Abram hoi Nahor ni a yu a la roi. Abram e a yu min teh Sarai, Nahor e a yu min teh Haran e a canu Mikah. Haran teh Milkah hoi Iskah e a na pa lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hatei Sarai teh carôe dawkvah ca tawn hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Terah ni a capa Abram hoi a capa Haran capa Lot, a langa lah kaawm a capa Abraham e yu Sarai, a kaw teh Kanaan ram lah cei hanelah Khaldean taminaw a onae Ur kho hoi a tâcokhai, Hatei Haran kho a pha awh navah haw vah kho a sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Terah teh kum 205 touh a pha navah, Terah teh Haran kho dawk a due.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />BAWIPA ni Abram koevah, Na ram, na imthung hoi na pa im cettakhai nateh kai ni na patue e ram koe lah cet leih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kai ni miphun kalen lah na sak vaiteh, yawhawinae na poe han. Na min kamsawng sak vaiteh yawhawinae ka coe e tami lah na o han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang yawhawinae ka poe e tami teh yawkahawi sak vaiteh, thoe na ka bo e tami teh thoe ka bo van han. Nang lahoi tami pueng ni yawhawinae a coe awh han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />BAWIPA ni a dei pouh e patetlah Abram ni a kamthaw teh, Lot hai a kâbang van. Haran kho hoi a tâco navah Abram teh kum 75 touh a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Abraham ni a yu Sarai, a hmau e capa Lot hoi hnopai pueng thoseh, Haran kho dawk a hmu e taminaw hai thoseh, a ceikhai teh Kanaan ram pha hanelah a tâco. Hottelah hoi Kanaan ram a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Abram ni hote ram dawk yuengyoe a kâhlai teh, Shekhem hmuen Moreh e kathen kung koe a pha. Han navah Kanaan taminaw hote ram dawk yo la o awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />BAWIPA teh Abram koe a kamnue teh hote ram teh na ca catounnaw na poe han atipouh. Hote ka kamnuek e BAWIPA hanelah khoungroe a sak pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hote hmuen koehoi Bethel kho Kanîtholae mon dawk a kampuen teh kanîloumlah Bethel hoi kanîtholah Ai kho rahak rim a sak. Hote hmuen koe BAWIPA hanelah khoungroe a sak teh BAWIPA e min a kaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hottelah Abram teh akalah kampuen hanlah a cei teh, Negev totouh a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hathnukkhu Kanaan ram takang a tho dawkvah, Abram teh Izip ram lah a cei. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ram thung puenghoi takang a tho dawk doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Izip ram a pha tawmlei navah a yu Sarai koe nang teh meikahawi e napui lah na o tie ka panue .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Izip taminaw ni nang na hmu awh navah, hete napui teh a yu doeh tet awh vaiteh kai na thei awh han, hatei nang teh na hlout sak awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, a tawncanu doeh na ti pouh han. Hottelah na dei pouh pawiteh nang dawk hoi kai hawinae ka hmu vaiteh ka hringnae hai a hlout han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Abram teh Izip ram a kâen navah Izip taminaw ni a yu a hmu navah a meihawi ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Faro e ukkungnaw ni a hmu navah, Faro hanelah a oup awh teh Faro im vah a ceikhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Faro siangpahrang ni napui kecu dawk Abram teh a khetyawt. Tu, Maito, La apui atan, sannu sanpa hoi kalauknaw a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hatei BAWIPA ni Abram e yu Sarai kecu dawk Faro hoi a imthungnaw pueng hoi runae a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Faro ni Abram a kaw teh, kai dawk na sak e hno Bangtelamaw, bangkongmaw na yu nahlangva, na dei hoeh vaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bangkongmaw ka tawncanu na ti teh yu lah na la sak. Hatdawkvah, na yu heh atu hrawi nateh cet leih telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hottelah Faro ni a taminaw kâ a poe teh a yu hoi a tawn e naw pueng hoi a cei sak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hathnukkhu Izip ram hoi Abram a tâco teh akalae ram Negev lah vah a yu, a tawn e hnopai pueng hoi a kamthaw teh a hnuk vah Lot hai a kâbang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abram teh saringnaw, suinaw, ngunnaw hoi lutlut a bawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Negev ram lahoi bout a kamthaw teh ahmaloe pasuek e rim ao na koe lah a cei. Hote im teh Bethel hoi Ai kho rahak vah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hmaloe pasuek e khoungroe a saknae hmuen koe bout a pha navah, Abram ni BAWIPA min a kaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Abram koe kâbang e Lot hai tunaw, maitonaw hoi rimnaw a tawn van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahnimouh roi teh cungtalah kho rei a sak roi hanelah, hote ram ni khout hoeh. Hnopai a tawn roi e ekvoi apap dawkvah cungtalah kho sak thai roi hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Abram e saring kakhoumnaw hoi Lot e saring kakhoumnaw kâpohoehnae ao. Hat nae tueng dawk Kanaan tami hoi Periznaw hote ram dawk ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hahoi, Abram ni Lot koevah, maimouh roi teh, hmaunawngha roi doeh. Hatdawkvah, nang hoi kai rahak thoseh, nange saring kakhoumnaw hoi kaie saring kakhoumnaw rahak thoseh kâpohoehnae awm hanh naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na hmalah ram moi ao nahoehmaw. Kai koehoi cet leih. Nang avoilah na cet pawiteh kai aranglah ka cei han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lot ni a radoung navah, Jordan yawn pueng teh tui ka duk niteh, Jehovah e takha patetlah Sodom hoi Gomorrah kho BAWIPA ni a raphoe hoehnahlan, Zoar lah ceinae Izip ram patetlah a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hottelah Lot ni Jordan yawn pueng a rawi. Hatdawkvah, Lot teh kanîtholah a cei teh buet touh hoi buet touh a kamphei roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Abram teh Kanaan ram dawk kho a sak. Lot teh thingyei yawn dawk e khopuinaw koe kho a sak teh, Sodom kho teng rim a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hatei Sodom kho taminaw teh tamikathout lah ao awh teh, BAWIPA koevah tamikayon poung lah ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lot hoi a kamphei hnukkhu BAWIPA ni Abram a kaw teh na onae hmuen koehoi atung, aka, kanîtho, kanîloumlah radoung haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na hmu e ram pueng nama hoi na ca catounnaw na poe vaiteh a yungyoe e ram lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na ca catounnaw vaiphu patetlah ka pungdaw sak han. Tami ni vaiphu touk thai pawiteh na ca catounnaw hai a touk thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thaw nateh ayung lahoi thoseh, adangka lahoi thoseh cet haw, kai ni na poe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Abram ni rim a puen teh Hebron kho Mamre kathenkungnaw koe kho a sak teh, BAWIPA hanelah khoungroe a sak pouh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hatnae tueng dawk Shinar siangpahrang Amraphel, Ellasar siangpahrang Ariyawk, Elam siangpahrang Kedorlaomer hoi Goiim siangpahrang Tidal ti naw hoi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sodom siangpahrang Bera, Gomorrah siangpahrang Birsha, Admah siangpahrang Shinab, Zebiim siangpahrang Shemeber, Zoar siangpahrang Bela tinaw taran a kâtuk awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahnimanaw pueng teh palawi tui tie Siddim yawn dawk a kamkhueng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kum 12 touh thung Kedorlaomer koe san lah ao awh teh, kum 13 nae dawk teh a tuk awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kum 14 nae dawk teh Kedorlaomer ni ama koe lah kambawng e siangpahrangnaw hoi a tho awh teh, Ashterothkarnaim kho dawk Rephaim taminaw, Ham kho dawk Zuzim taminaw, Kiriathaim koe Emim taminaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Seir mon dawk Khori taminaw hoi thingyei yawn teng kaawm e Elparan kho totouh a thei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hahoi bout a ban awh teh Kadesh ram Enmishpat kho dawk a pha awh navah, Amalek ram dawk kaawm e tami pueng, Hazezontamar kho dawk kaawm e Amor taminaw hai koung a thei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hathnukkhu Sodom siangpahrang, Gomorrah siangpahrang, Admah siangpahrang, Zeboiim siangpahrang hoi Bela siangpahrang, tinaw a cei awh teh, Siddim yawn dawk a kâtuk awh hanelah a kamkhueng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hottelah, Elam siangpahrang Kedorlaomer, Goiim siangpahrang Tidal, Shinar siangpahrang Amraphel, Ellasar siangpahrang Aryawk, ahnimanaw pali touh ni siangpahrang panga touh a tuk awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siddim yawn teh tuithaw dui ka cawt e tangkawmnaw ao dawkvah, Sodom hoi Gomorrah siangpahrang teh a yawng roi, a tangawn te tangkom dawk a bo teh alouknaw teh mon lah a yawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Sodom hoi Gomorrah kho dawk kaawm e hnopai pueng, canei kawi kaawm pueng a la awh teh a ban awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sodom kho dawk kaawm e Abram e a hmau e capa Lot hoi a hnopai pueng hai koung a la awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hote runae dawk hoi ka hlout e tami buet touh a tho teh, Hebru tami Abram koe a dei pouh. Ahni teh Amor tami Mamre e kathenkungnaw teng ao. Mamre teh Eskol hoi Aner e hmau doeh. Ahnimanaw teh Abram hoi cungtalah kambawng awh e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Abram ni a hmau e capa hah san hanelah a man awh toe tie a thai navah, ama im ka khe ni teh a cangkhai e tami 318 touh a hrawi teh, Dan kho totouh a pâlei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khohmo navah, a hrawi e taminaw a kapek teh a tuk sak Damaskas atunglah kaawm e Hobah kho totouh a pâlei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ceikhai e hnopai pueng, a hmau e capa Lot hoi a hnopai pueng napuinaw hoi a taminaw bout a bankhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khedorlaomer hoi ama koe kaawm e siangpahrangnaw koung a thei hnukkhu a ban navah, Sodom siangpahrang teh Shaveh yawn dawk Abram dawn hanelah a tho. (Shaveh yawn teh siangpahrang yawn doeh).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Salem siangpahrang Melkhizedek ni vaiyei hoi misurtui a sin. (Ahni teh ka rasang poung e Cathut e vaihma doeh).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hahoi, Abram yawhawinae a poe teh, kalvan hoi talai katawnkung ka rasang poung e Abram Cathut teh yawhawinae awm seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na tarannaw na kut dawk na kapoekung ka rasang poung e Cathut teh yawhawinae awm seh telah ati. Abram ni hai hnopai a tawn e pueng dawk hoi pung hra pung touh a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sodom siangpahrang ni Abram koevah taminaw teh kai na poe, hatei hnopainaw teh lat yawkaw telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hatei Abram ni Sodom siangpahrang koe ralui buet touh hoi khokkhawm rui buet touh boehai nang koe ka lat mahoeh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />telah kalvan hoi talai katawnkung Jehovah, ka rasang poung e Cathut koe ka kut ka dâw toe. Telah hoehpawiteh Abram teh kai ni ka bawi sak e doeh na tet payon vaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thoundounnaw ni a canei e hoi ka hrawi e ka taminaw ni a coe hane hloilah teh banghai ka lat mahoeh. Aner, Eshkol hoi Mamre ni a coe awh e teh ama ni lat awh naseh, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, Abram koe BAWIPA e lawk vision lahoi ka tho e teh, Abram, taket hanh kai teh nange bahling lah ka o, na tawkphu hmu hane a len poung telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hatei Abram ni, Oe Bawipa Jehovah, ca tawn laipalah ka o e na hmu nahlangva, bangmaw na poe han. Im e râw kacoekung teh Damaskas tami Eliezer doeh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hahoi Abram ni khenhaw! kai ca na poe hoeh. Ka im kaawm e ni doeh râw a coe toe telah bout atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />BAWIPA e lawk Abram koe ka tho e teh, hete tami kaawm e ni nange râw coe mahoeh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hahoi Abram hah alawilah a hrawi teh, kalvan lah khenhaw! âsi na touk thai pawiteh touk haw, hot patetlah na catoun ka pungdaw sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Abram ni BAWIPA a yuem dawkvah, ahnie a yuemnae hah a lannae lah a khoe pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hahoi kai ni hete ram poe hane hoi coe sak hane ka ngai dawk doeh Khaldean taminaw a onae Ur kho hoi nang kahrawikung kai teh BAWIPA doeh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hatei ahni ni Bawipa Jehovah, hete bangtelah hoi maw ka coe han tie ka panue han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />BAWIPA ni Abram koe a dei pouh e teh, kum thum touh e maito, kum thum touh e hmaela, kum thum touh e tutan buet touh âbakhuca hoi bakhuca buet touh thokhai loe atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hote hnonaw pueng ahni koe a thokhai pouh teh a lungui hoi a sei teh avoivang lah a hruek. Hatei tava teh sei hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hote moinaw koevah langtanaw a tho navah Abram ni a pâlei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hatei kanî a khup toteh, Abram teh mat a i. Hahoi khenhaw! puenghoi hmonae ni a tho sin teh roumkalue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hathnukkhu BAWIPA ni Abram koe, na ca catounnaw ni ayânaw e ram dawk imyin lah ao awh vaiteh, kum 400 touh thung rektapnae hoi san lah ao awh han tie kamcengcalah panuek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hatei ahnimanaw san lah ka hno e taminaw kai ni lawk ka ceng han. Hathnukkhu hnopai moikapap hoi a tâco awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang teh mintoenaw koe karoumcalah na cei vaiteh matawng lahoi na pakawp awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hateiteh a se palinae dawk hete ram dawk bout a ban awh han. Bangkongtetpawiteh Amornaw ni thoesaknae kuep sak lah awm hoeh rah, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kanî a khup teh kho bout a hmo torei teh hmaikhu tâconae hlaam hoi hmai paangnae hmaiim teh moi tâtueng e rahak yuengyoe a kâhlai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hote hnin dawk BAWIPA ni Abram hoi lawkkamnae a sak teh Izip palang koehoi palang kalenpounge Euphrates totouh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ken tami, Kene tami, Kadmon tami,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hit tami, Periz tami, Rephaim tami,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amor tami, Kanaan tami, Girgashite taminaw hoi Jebusit taminaw e ram, na ca catounnaw ka poe toe, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abram e yu Sarai ni ahni hanelah ca khe pouh hoeh. Hatei ahni ni vah a sannu Izip tami buet touh a tawn. A min teh Hagar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Sarai ni Abram koevah khenhaw! BAWIPA ni ca khe hanelah kâ na poe hoeh. Ka sannu koe mah cet leih ahni koehoi ca khe thai yawkaw han doeh telah atipouh. Sarai e lawk Abram ni a tarawi pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hottelah Abram teh Kanaan ram kum 10 touh ao hnukkhu Abram e yu Sarai ni a sannu Izip tami Hagar hah a hrawi teh a vâ Abram koe a yu hanelah a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahni ni Hagar a ikhai teh camo a vawn. Camo vawn tie a kâpanue torei teh a bawinu hah a hnephnap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hat torei teh Sarai ni Abram koevah, kai dawk thoenae a sak e heh nang lathueng phat seh. Kai ni ka sannu na poe ei camo vawn tie a panue torei teh a mit hoi kai na hnephnap. BAWIPA ni nang hoi kai rahak lawkceng lawiseh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hatei Abram ni Sarai koevah, na sannu teh na kut dawk doeh ao. Sarai ni puenghoi a yue teh ahni koehoi oun a yawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />BAWIPA e kalvantami ni Shur kho lah ceinae kahrawngum lam teng tuiphuek teng vah a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sarai e sannu Hagar, nâ lahoi maw na tho teh nâ lah maw na cei han telah a pacei. Hat torei teh ahni ni ka bawinu Sarai koehoi ka yawng e doeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />BAWIPA e kalvantaminaw, na bawinu koe bout ban nateh a kut rahim awm pouh loe telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />BAWIPA e kalvantami ni, na canaw moikapap ka pungdaw sak vaiteh na touklek thai mahoeh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hahoi, BAWIPA e kalvantami ni thaihaw, camo na vawn vaiteh ca tongpa na khe han, Ishmael telah min na phung han. Bangkongtetpawiteh nange na reithainae BAWIPA ni a thai toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hatei na capa teh la ka matheng e lah ao han. Tami pueng a taran vaiteh tami pueng ni hai a taran van han. A hmaunawngha pueng hai a taran vaiteh kho a sak han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hottelah ahni koe lawk ka dei e BAWIPA min a kaw teh, Nang teh kai kahmawtkung Cathut doeh. Bangtelamaw hivah kai kahmawtkung teh kai ni hai ka hmu toe telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, tuikhu teh Beerlahairoi telah a phung. Hote teh Kadesh hoi Bered kho rahak vah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, Hagar ni Abram hane ca tongpa a khe pouh. Hagar ni a khe e a capa teh Abram ni Ishmael telah min a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hagar ni Abram hanelah Ishmael a khe pouh navah Abram teh kum 86 touh a pha.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, Abram teh kum 99 a pha navah, BAWIPA ni Abram koe a kamnue teh, kai teh Athakasaipounge Cathut doeh ka hmalah toun hane kawi kaawm hoeh lah awm haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kaie lawkkamnae nang hoi ka sak vaiteh moikapap na pungdaw sak han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Abram ni a tabo teh Cathut ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thai haw kaie lawkkamnae teh nang koe ao. Nang teh miphun moikapap e a na pa lah na o han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nange na min hai Abram telah na kaw mahoeh toe. Abraham telah na kaw han toe, bangkongtetpawiteh nang teh miphun moikapap e na pa lah na coung han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kai ni moikapap na pungdaw sak han. Nang lahoi miphunnaw ka pung sak vaiteh, nang dawk hoi siangpahrang a tâco han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka lawkkamnae ka caksak vaiteh nang hoi kai rahak, na canaw hoi patuen e na catoun rahak vah a yungyoe e lawkkam lah ao han. Kai teh nang hoi na ca catounnaw e Cathut lah ka o han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Atu imyin lah na onae ram, Kanaan ram pueng nang hoi na ca catounnaw koe a yungyoe e râw lah na poe han. Kai teh ahnimae Cathut lah ka o han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, Cathut ni Abraham koevah nang hoi na ca catounnaw pueng ni ka lawkkam heh na tarawi awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hete teh kai hoi nange na ca catounnaw ni a tarawi hane lawkkam doeh. Tongpa pueng vuensoma pouh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, vuensom na a e tak teh kai hoi nang rahak mitnoutnae lawkkam lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangmouh dawkvah, na ca catounnaw totouh, ca tongpa pueng. Im dawk ka khe e thoseh, mae miphun nahoeh eiteh, alouke miphunnaw koe tangka hoi ran e hai thoseh, hnin 8 nah vuensom na a pouh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na im dawk ka khe e hoi tangka hoi ran e tami ni vuensoma roeroe vaiteh ka lawkkam teh tak dawk yungyoe ka cak e lawkkam lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hatei vuensom ka a hoeh e tongpa a tak dawk e vuengsom ka a hoeh e tami teh ka miphun dawk hoi takhoe lah ao han telah atipouh. Ahni teh kaie lawkkam a raphoe toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cathut ni Abraham koevah Na yu Sarai hah, Sarai telah na kaw mahoeh, Sarah telah na kaw han toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahni hah yawhawinae ka poe vaiteh ahni lahoi nang hai ca tongpa na poe han. Yawhawinae ka poe vaiteh miphun moikapap e manu lah ao han. Athung hoi miphunnaw hane siangpahrang a tâco han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hat torei teh, Abraham ni a minhmai hoi a tabo teh a panui. Kum 100 touh e ni ca khe han namaw. Kum 90 touh e Sarah ni ca a khe han rah maw telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Abraham ni Cathut koe, na hmalah Ishmael mah hring yawkaw seh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hatei Cathut ni telah nahoeh, na yu Sarah ni capa na khe pouh vaiteh, Isak telah a min na phung han. Ka lawkkam ka cak e lawkkam lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ishmael e kong dawk teh kai ni ka thai toe. Ahni yawhawinae ka poe toe. A ca catoun ka pungdaw sak vaiteh moikapap sak han. Ahni teh khobawi 12 touh e a na pa lah ao han. Miphun kalen poung lah ka sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hateiteh palawng atu e tueng navah, Sarah ni na khe pouh hane Isak dawk ka lawkkam ka caksak han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hottelah Abraham hoi lawk a kâpato hnukkhu Cathut teh a luen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Abraham ni a capa Ishmael hoi a im dawk ka khe e pueng, tangka hoi a ran e pueng Abraham imthung dawk e tongpa pueng a ceikhai teh Cathut ni ahni koe a dei pouh tangcoung e patetlah hnin touh dawkvah vuensom koung a a pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amae vuensom a a nah Abraham teh kum 99 touh a pha toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Capa Ishmael, vuensom a a nah kum 13 touh a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hnin touh dawk, Abraham hoi a capa Ishmael teh vuensom rei rei a a roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amae im dawk kaawm e tongpa pueng a im dawk ka khe e, miphun alouke koe tangka hoi a ran e tongpa pueng teh, ama hoi cungtalah vuensom a a awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abraham teh kanîthun khumbei a thoe lahun nah, rim takhang koe a tahung navah BAWIPA teh Mamre kathenkungnaw koehoi ahni koe a kamnue .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A khet teh a hmalah tami kathum touh a kangdue e a hmu navah, rim takhang koehoi ahnimanaw kâhmo hanelah a yawng teh talai dawk a tabo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hahoi, ka bawipa na hmalah minhmai kahawi ka hmawt pawiteh na san heh na cettakhai hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tui youn touh ka sin vaiteh na khok pâsu awh nateh, thingkung rahim kâhat awh ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na tha tawn e roum nahanelah vaiyei youn touh ka sin hnukkhu, na cettakhai awh. Hottelah e coe hanelah na san onae koe na pha toe telah atipouh. Ahnimanaw ni hai na dei patetlah sak lawih atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Abraham teh rim thung kaawm e Sarah koe karanglah a yawng teh tavai sum thum touh hane coungkacoe lat nateh karanglah kanawk nateh thawng leih atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hahoi Abraham ni maitohu koe a yawng teh, maitoca a tak kathâw e a la teh, a san thoundoun koe a poe teh karanglah a rakueng sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, sanutui hoi maitoca moi ahnimae hmalah a pâtoum pouh teh a ca awh. Ahnimanaw ni a ca awh lahun nah, ama teh thingkung rahim a kangdue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahnimanaw ni na maw Sarah ao telah a pacei navah rim thung ao telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hahoi ahnimanaw ni palawng het tuektue nah nang koe bout ka tho vaiteh na yu Sarah ni ca tongpa a khe han atipouh. Hatnavah Sarah teh ahnimae a hnukkhu lae rim takhang koe ao teh a thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Abraham hoi Sarah teh a matawng ni teh a kumcue roi poung toe. Sarah teh camo o thainae a pout toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Sarah ni lunghawinae kai ni ka tawn han rah maw ati teh duem a panui. Ka bawipa hai a matawng poung toe telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />BAWIPA ni Abraham koevah, bangkongmaw Sarah ni ka matawng toung dawkvah camo ka khe thai han rah maw ti teh a panui vaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />BAWIPA hanelah hno ka ru ao maw. A tueng khoe e patetlah palawng vah Sarah camo a khe han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hatei Sarah ni ka panui hoeh titeh a kâpapha. Bangkongtetpawiteh, a lungpuen dawk doeh. Ahni ni nahoeh na panui atipouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hahoi, taminaw hote hmuen koehoi a thaw awh teh Sodom kho a radoung awh. Abraham hai ahnimanaw a thak hanelah a kâbang van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hatei BAWIPA ni ka sak hane hno Abraham koe ka pâpha pouh han maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Abraham teh tami kalen hoi Athakasaipounge miphun lah a coung han. Talaivan e tami pueng ni ahni lahoi yawhawi a coe awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh ahni ni hmalah ka tho hane a canaw hoi imthungnaw ni BAWIPA e lamthung a dawn awh vaiteh, lannae hoi hnokahawi sak hanelah, ka dei tangcoung e patetlah BAWIPA ni Abraham koe kakuep sak hanelah ahni teh ka panue e doeh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hahoi BAWIPA ni Sodom hoi Gomorrah kho dawk e hramnae lawk hoi a yonnae teh puenghoi a len toung dawkvah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Atu ka cei vaiteh kai koe ka phat e a hram awh patetlah ahnimanaw ni a sak katang maw. Sak katang hoeh maw tie atu ka khet han. Sak hoehpawiteh a sak hoeh e ka panue han telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hote taminaw teh hote hmuen koehoi a kamlang awh teh Sodom kho lah a cei awh. Abraham ma teh BAWIPA hmalah paroup a kangdue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hahoi Abraham ni a hnai teh, tamikalannaw hai tamikathoutnaw hoi mek na raphoe han maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hote kho dawk tamikalan 50 touh awm pawiteh, a thung e tamikalan 50 touh ao kecu dawk hote hmuen teh na raphoe han maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tamikalannaw hah tamikathoutnaw patetlah khang sak hane teh nang hoi kâhlat naseh. Talaivan pueng lawkcengkung ni kalan lah lawkceng mahoeh maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hottelah BAWIPA ni Sodom kho thung vah, tamikalan 50 touh ka hmawt pawiteh, ahnimouh kecu dawk hote hmuen pueng teh ka pasai han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Abraham ni kai teh vaiphu hoi hraba lah ka o ei, BAWIPA nang koe lawk na pacei hanelah tha bout ka kâla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tamikalan 50 touh dawk panga touh kuep hoehpawiteh, hote panga touh akuep hoeh dawk, hote khopui teh na raphoe han maw, telah a pacei. Ahni ni hawvah 45 touh ka hmu nakunghai ka raphoe mahoeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hahoi 40 touh ka hmu yawkaw han doeh bout atipouh navah, 40 touh hai ka raphoe mahoeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hahoi Oe BAWIPA na lungphuen hanh, bout na pacei ei nei, 30 touh ka hmu yawkaw han doeh bout atipouh navah, 30 touh hane dawk hai ka raphoe mahoeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahni ni thai haw, BAWIPA koe lawk bout ka pacei ei nei, hawvah 20 touh ka hmu yawkaw han doeh bout atipouh navah, 20 touh hane dawk hai ka raphoe mahoeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hahoi, Oe BAWIPA na lungkhuek hanh yawkaw, vai touh bout na pacei einei, hawvah 10 touh ka hmawt pawiteh atipouh navah, 10 touh hane dawk hai ka raphoe mahoeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />BAWIPA teh Abraham hoi lawk koung a kâpato roi hnukkhu a ceitakhai. Abraham haiyah a ma onae koe a ban.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kalvantami kahni touh tangmin lah Sodom kho a tho roi. Lot teh khopui thung kâennae longkha koe a tahung teh, Lot ni ahnimouh roi a hmu navah dawn hanelah a thaw teh, talai dawk a tabo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahni ni ka bawipa roi, pahren lahoi na sanpa im kâen roi nateh roe rawi ei. Na khok hai pâsu roi ei telah atipouh. Ahnimouh roi ni telah nahoeh, alawilah ka roe roi han doeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hatei, puenghoi a pasawt dawkvah, ahni koe a cei roi teh, im thung a kâen roi. Hahoi, tonphuenhoehe vaiyei a poe teh a ca roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahnimanaw a i awh hoehnahlan vah, Sodom kho e tongpa camo matawng abuemlah a tho awh teh, im khik a kalup awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lot a kaw awh teh, tapa tangmin lah na im ka tho e tami roi namaw ao. Hote tami roi ikhai hanelah ka ngai awh, alawilah tâcawt sak telah atipouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lot teh takhang koehoi alawilah ahnimouh koe a tâco teh, tho a khan hnukkhu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ka hmaunawnghanaw pahren lahoi thoenae sak awh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khenhaw! tongpa ka panuek hoeh rae ka canu kahni touh ka tawn. Na ngai patetlah na ti thai awh. Hatdawkvah, pahren lahoi ahnimouh roi nangmouh koe ka tâco sak han. Imyin roi koe teh banghai sak awh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahnimanaw ni, kâhnawnh telah atipouh awh. Hahoi nang teh imyin lah na o eiteh, lawkcengkung lah o hanelah na kâcai. Hatdawkvah, ahnimanaw koe ka sak awh e hlak nang koe hoe kathout lah ka sak awh han telah atipouh awh. Hahoi Lot hah rek a savek awh teh, tho hai peng raphoe hanelah a tho awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hatei, ahnimouh roi ni a kut hoi imthung lah Lot hah a sawn roi teh, tho khik a khan sin roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tho teng kaawm e tami kathoeng kalen abuemlahoi a mit a dawn sak teh, tho hmawt thai awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahnimouh roi ni Lot koevah, hivah nang hoi na kâkuen e tami ao rah maw. Na langa, capanaw, canunaw, hoehpawiteh, khothung kaawm e tâcawtkhai leih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, BAWIPA hmalah a hramki awh teh, a tarannae a len poung toe. Hatdawkvah, hie hmuen raphoe hanelah BAWIPA ni na patoun roi e doeh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lot a tâco teh, a canu ka lat e a cavanaw koevah, thaw awh leih. Hete hmuen heh tâcawt takhai awh leih. Bangkongtetpawiteh, BAWIPA ni khopui a raphoe han toe atipouh. Hatei, a cavanaw ni panuilai lah a pouk awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amom kho vumpava a dai navah, kalvantami roi ni, thaw leih, na yu hoi na canu roi tâcawtkhai leih, nahoeh pawiteh, hete kho reknae na khang payon vaih telah ngangngang a cangawt.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hatei, a hnanthoe dawkvah, kalvantami roi ni, ama hoi a yu, a canu roi hoi a kut dawk hoi a sawn teh, khopui alawilah a tâcokhai. Bangkongtetpawiteh, BAWIPA ni a pahren dawk doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Alawilah, a tâcokhai awh hnukkhu, na hringnae a hlout thai nahanlah yawng leih. Hnuklah kamlang laihoi khen hanh. Tanghling koe khoeroe awm hanh. Mon vah yawng leih. Nahoeh pawiteh na due han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lot ni ahnimouh roi koe, telah nahoeh, ka bawipa roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na sanpa ni na mithmu vah minhmai kahawi ka hmu toe. Ka hringnae na hlout sak teh, kai dawk lungpatawnae kalen poung na kamnue sak toe. Hatei, mon lah teh ka yawng thai mahoeh. Telah nahoeh pawiteh, runae ni na kei vaiteh, kadout han doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khenhaw! hote kho teh yawng nahane a hnaica. Kho kathoungcalah hai ao. Hote kho kathoengca koe na yawng sak haw. Ka hring han doeh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahnimouh roi ni na kâhei e patetlah lung na kuep khai toe. Na dei e kho teh ka raphoe mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Karanglah hawvah yawng leih. Hote kho dawk na pha hoehnahlan bang hno hai ka sak thai mahoeh atipouh. Hatdawkvah, hote kho teh Zoar telah min a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Zoar kho dawk Lot a kâen navah talai van kanî teh a tâconae toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hahoi BAWIPA ni BAWIPA ma koehoi e ganhmai Sodom hoi Gomorrah kho dawk kho lah a rak sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hote khopui roi hoi thingyei yawn pueng, khopui karingkungnaw abuemlah talai hoi ka paw e thingkung pueng koung a raphoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hatei, a yu teh hnuklah a kangvawi dawkvah, palawi khom lah a kangcoung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Abraham teh BAWIPA hmalah a kangduenae hmuen koe amom vah a cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sodom hoi Gomorrah thingyei yawn pueng a khet navah, takhuen koe e hmaikhu patetlah ram pueng dawk e hmaikhu kahlun lah a luen e hah a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hottelah Cathut ni thingyei yawn dawk e khopuinaw a raphoe lahunnah hoi Lot onae khopuinaw a raphoe nah Cathut ni Abraham a pahnim hoeh dawkvah, Lot teh rawknae koehoi a hlout sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hottelah Lot teh, Zoar kho hoi a luen teh mon dawk kho a sak. A canu kahni touh hai ama koe ao. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Zoar kho dawk o hane ngam hoeh. Hahoi a canu kahni touh hoi lungngoum thung ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A canu kacue e ni a nawngha koe, apa a matawng toe, talai van e phung patetlah maimouh roi na ka ipkhai hane tongpa awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thohaw, apa misurtui pânei roi sei. Apa e miphun apout hoeh nahanlah ipkhai roi sei, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hote tangmin vah, misurtui a na pa a pânei roi teh, a na pa ni a ikhai e hoi bout a thaw e hah panuek hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Atangtho amom teh, kacue e ni paduem tangmin apa hoi kai ka i roi toe. Atu tangmin vah misurtui bout pânei sei. Apa e miphun a pout hoeh nahanelah, nang louk ipkhai loe atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hote tangmin haiyah a na pa misurtui a pânei roi hnukkhu, kanaw e ni a na pa a ikhai teh, a i e hoi bout a thaw e a na pa ni panuek hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hottelah Lot e canu roi teh camo a vawn roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kacue e ni tongpa a khe teh, Moab telah a min a phung. Hote tami teh atu kaawm e Moab miphunnaw e a na pa lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kanaw e ni hai tongpa a khe teh, Benammi telah min a phung. Hote tami teh sahnin totouh kaawm e Ammon miphunnaw e a na pa doeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abraham teh hote hmuen koehoi akalah a cei teh, Kadesh kho hoi Shur kho rahak vah kho a sak teh Gerar kho dawk a roe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abraham ni a yu Sarah hanelah ka tawncanu atipouh. Hahoi Gerar Siangpahrang Abimelek ni tami a patoun teh Sarah a la sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hatei, Cathut ni tangmin vah Abimelek koe a mang lahoi a tho teh, thai haw, na lae napui kecu dawk tami kadout patetlah doeh na o toe, bangkongtetpawiteh ahni teh ayâ yu doeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hatei, Abimelek ni ipkhai hoeh rah. Hahoi ahni ni kalan e miphun hai na thei han maw
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama ni roeroe kai koevah, ka tawncanu ati nahoehmaw. A yu ni hai ka thangroi doeh ati tayaw, lungthin thoung lahoi, ka kut kathoungcalah hoi hete hno ka sak e doeh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cathut ni a mang lah vah, ahman doeh, lungthin kathoungcalah hoi hete hno na sak e doeh tie ka panue. Hatdawkvah kai ni hai kai tak dawk hnokathout sak hane ka pasoung hoeh. Hat dawk doeh ahni na tek hanelah ka pasoung hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hatdawkvah ayâ yu atu bout poe leih, bangkongtetpawiteh ahni teh profet doeh. Na ratoum pouh vaiteh na dam han. Hatei na poe hoehpawiteh, nang hoi na sannaw abuemlah, na due roeroe awh han atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hahoi Abimelek teh amom, a thaw, a sannaw pueng a kaw teh a thai e hnonaw pueng a dei pouh teh puenghoi a taki awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Abimelek ni Abraham a kaw teh, kai dawk bang hno maw na sak, nang koe bangmaw ka payon teh, kai hoi kaie uknaeram koe kahawihoehe hno na pha sak. Sak hoeh hane kawi kai dawk na sak vaw atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Abimelek ni Abraham koevah, Bang hno maw na hmu teh kai dawk hete hno na sak telah bout atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Abraham ni hie kho dawk e taminaw teh Cathut ka taket awmhoeh vaiteh, ka yu kecu dawk kai na thei awh han doeh telah ka pouk dawk doeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hothloilah ahni teh ka tawncanu katang doeh. Apa e canu doeh. Anu e canu nahoeh, hatei ka yu lahai ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cathut ni apa im hoi na ceisak hane navah, na pha nah tangkuem koe ka thangroi doeh na ti pouh han telah ati dawk doeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Abimelek ni tu hoi maitotannaw, sanpa hoi sannu naw a ceikhai teh Abraham a poe teh, a yu Sarah hai bout a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Abimelek ni, Khenhaw! ka ram teh na hmalah ao, na ngainae pueng koe awm loe atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sarah koevah, na thangroi koe tangka 1,000 touh ka poe toe. Nang hoi na huikonaw pueng hanelah minhmai sak lah ka poe e doeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hottelah Abraham ni Cathut koe a ratoum teh, Cathut ni Abimelek hoi a yu, a sannunaw a dam sak teh canaw hai bout a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Abraham e a yu Sarah kecu dawk BAWIPA ni Abimelek imthung abuemlah carôe sak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />BAWIPA ni a dei tangcoung e patetlah Sarah koe a pai teh a lawkkam pouh e patetlah Sarah hanelah a sak pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hahoi, ahni koe a dei pouh tangcoung e patetlah Cathut ni a khoe pouh e tueng navah Sarah ni camo a vawn teh, a matawng hnukkhu Abraham hanelah tongpa a khe pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Abraham ni hai a tawn e capa, Sarah ni a khe pouh e hah Isak telah min a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hottelah, Cathut ni kâ a poe tangcoung e patetlah Abraham ni a capa Isak hah ataroe hnin navah vuensom a a pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Abraham teh a capa Isak a khe navah kum 100 touh a pha toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sarah ni hai kai ka panuithainae Cathut ni na poe toe. Hete kamthang ka thai e pueng ni hai kai hoi cungtalah a panui van awh han doeh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sarah ni camo sanu a pânei han telah Abraham koe apinimaw ouk a dei pouh. A matawng torei kai ni ca tongpa ka khe pouh toe telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hottelah, camo a roung takhang teh sanu a pâphei. Sanu a pâphei nah hnin dawk Abraham ni buven pawi kalenpounge a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Izip tami Hagar capa, Abraham hanelah a khe pouh e ni a panuikhai e hah Sarah ni a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Abraham koevah, Hete sannu hoi a capa pâlei leih, bangkongtetpawiteh sannu e capa ni ka capa e râw coe thai mahoeh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A capa lah ao kecu dawk Abraham hanelah hno ka ru poung lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hatei Cathut ni Abraham koe, camo hoi na sannu kong dawk hno ka ru lah pouk hanh. Sarah ni a dei e pueng tarawi loe. Bangkongtetpawiteh Isak dawk hoi na catoun telah kaw e lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na sannu e capa dawk hai miphun ka pungdaw sak han. Bangkongtetpawiteh ahni hai na ca doeh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hottelah amom vah Abraham a thaw teh vaiyei hoi tuium a la teh Hagar e aloung dawk a patue pouh hnukkhu, camo hoi a ceisak. A cei roi teh Beersheba kahrawngum vah yuengyoe a kâva roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuium dawk e tui a baw hnukkhu camo hah buruk rahim a hruek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pala vai touh ka sittouh bang hane a cei teh, hnuklah a kangvawi laihoi a tahung hnukkhu, camo due e na hmawt sak hanh loe telah ati. Hottelah hnuklah a kangvawi laihoi a tahung teh puenghoi kacaipounglah a ka.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Camo lawk Cathut ni a thai teh Cathut kalvantami ni kalvan lahoi Hagar a kaw teh, Hagar bangmaw runae na kâhmo. Taket hanh, camo e lawk Cathut ni a thai toe atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thaw nateh camo hah na kut hoi pathaw leih, bangkongtetpawiteh miphun kalen poung lah kacoungsak han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cathut ni a mit ang sak teh tuikhu buet touh a hmu. A cei teh tuium dawk yikkawi a do hnukkhu camo a pânei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cathut teh camo koe lah a o, ahni teh a roung takhang teh, kahrawngum vah kho a sak teh moikathaipounge lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Paran kahrawngum vah kho a sak teh a manu ni a yu lah Izip tami a la pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hatnae tueng dawk Abimelek hoi ransahu kaukkung Phikhol ni Abraham koevah, na sak e hno pueng dawk Cathut ni na okhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hatdawkvah Cathut minhmai khet lahoi kai hoi ka capa catoun totouh dumyennae awm laipalah na pahren e patetlah kai hoi na onae ram heh a hawinae ka hmu nahanelah lawk na kam pouh leih telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Abraham ni hai, lawkkam han atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Abimelek e a sannaw ni tuikhu a lawp dawkvah Abraham ni Abimelek a yue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Abimelek ni, hot patet hno ka sak e teh apimaw. Ka panuek hoeh, nang ni hai na dei hoeh. Kai ni hai sahnin totouh ka panuek hoeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hottelah, Abraham ni tu hoi maitotan a hrawi teh Abimelek a poe, hahoi kahni touh hoi lawkkamnae a sak roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Abraham ni tuhu dawk e tulaca sari touh alouklah a kapek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abimelek ni Abraham koevah tulaca sari touh na ka pek e, bang hane maw atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahni ni hete tuikhu ka tai e heh kapanuekkhaikung lah tulaca sari touh e ka kut dawk e na la roeroe han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hote hmuen koe kahni touh hoi lawkkamnae a sak roi dawkvah Beersheba telah min a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hottelah Beersheba vah lawkkamnae a sak roi hnukkhu Abimelek hoi ransabawi Phikhol tinaw a thaw awh teh Filistin ram lah a ban awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Abraham ni Beersheba vah hmaicakung a ung teh haw vah BAWIPA yungyoe Cathut e min a kaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hahoi, Abimelek teh Filistin ram dawk hnin moi kasawlah a cam.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hathnukkhu hoi Cathut ni Abraham a tanouk teh Abraham telah a kaw. Ahni ni hi ka o telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahni ni, na capa, na capa tawn dueng, na lungpataw poung e, Isak roeroe hah cetkhai nateh, Moriah ram lah cet, kai ni na patue e mon dawk thuengnae na sak han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Abraham ni, amom a thaw teh, la dawk hnopainaw aphu sak hnukkhu a capa Isak hoi thoundoun kahni touh a kaw. Hmaisawi thueng nahane thing a racei hnukkhu, Cathut ni a dei e hmuen koe lah a cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Apâthum hnin nah a radoung teh ahlanae koehoi a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Abraham ni thoundoun roi koe, hivah la hoi la awm roi. Kai hoi camo teh hote hmuen koe ka cei roi vaiteh bawknae ka sak roi han. Ka cum roi hnukkhu nangmouh roi koe bout ka ban roi han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hahoi Abraham ni hmaisawi thueng nahane thing hah a capa Isak a hrawm sak teh, ama ni hmaibo hoi sarai hah a sin teh, cungtalah a cei roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hatei, Isak ni a na pa Abraham a pato teh, Apa atipouh navah, A na pa ni ka ca kai hi ka o atipouh. Ahni ni khenhaw! hmai hoi thing teh ao toe, hatei, hmaisawi thueng nahane tuca teh na maw telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abraham ni, ka capa Cathut ni ama hanelah hmaisawi thueng nahane tuca teh a rakueng han doeh atipouh. Hathnukkhu ahnimouh roi teh cungtalah a cei roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cathut ni a dei pouh e hmuen koe a pha roi. Abraham ni hote hmuen koe khoungroe a sak teh, thingnaw hah kahawicalah a hruek, a capa Isak hah a katek hnukkhu, khoungroe dawk e thing van a payan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hahoi, Abraham ni a capa thei hanelah a kut a pho teh sarai hah a la.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hatei BAWIPA kalvantami ni Abraham Abraham telah kalvan hoi a kaw. Ahni ni hai kai hi ka o atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahni ni camo e tak dawk na kut tha hanh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Cathut na taki e atu ka panue toe. Na capa, na tawn dueng e ka hei teh nang ni na kangek hoeh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hahoi Abraham ni a moung teh a khet navah, amae a hnuklah tutan buruk dawk a ki ka mang e hah a hmu. Abraham ni a cei teh hote tu hah a la hnukkhu, hmaisawi thuengnae a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Abraham ni hote hmuen teh, BAWIPA ni kho a khan han (Jehovah-Jireh) telah min a poe. BAWIPA e mon dawk BAWIPA ni na rakueng pouh telah atu totouh ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hahoi, BAWIPA e kalvantami ni apâhni lah kalvan hoi Abraham bout a kaw teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />hete hno na sak teh, na capa, na tawn dueng e na pasai hoeh dawkvah, yawhawi na poe roeroe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kalvan e âsi hoi tui teng e sadi yit touh. Na catounnaw ka pungdaw sak roeroe han. Na catounnaw ni na tarannaw e longkha a coe awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hahoi, ka lawk na ngâi kecu dawk talai van e tami pueng ni nange catounnaw lahoi yawhawinae a coe awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hathnukkhu thoundoun roi aonae koe lah Abraham, bout a ban teh, ahnimanaw hoi cungtalah a kamthaw awh teh, Beersheba lah a cei awh. Abraham teh Beersheba vah kho tawngtang a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, Abraham ni a thai e teh, nange na nawngha Nahor e a yu Milkah ni ca tongpanaw a khe toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A camin lah Uz, a nawngha Buz hoi Aram na pa Kemuel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khesed, Hazo, Pildash, Jidlap hoi Bethuel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bethuel ni Rebekah a khe. Hete taroe touh e naw teh Milkah ni Abraham e a nawngha Nahor hanelah, a khe pouh e naw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hathnukkhu Nahor e ado Reumah ni hai Tebah, Gaham, Tahash hoi Maakah bout a khe pouh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sarah teh kum 127 touh a hring. Sarah e a hringnae kum teh ama het doeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sarah teh Kanaan ram Hebron tie Kiriatharba kho dawk a due. Abraham hai Sarah kecu dawk khuika hanelah a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hahoi Abraham teh a yu e ro hmalah a kangdue teh Hit taminaw koe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kai teh nangmouh koe imyin hoi kahlong tami lah doeh ka o. Ka yu e ro ka pakawp nahanelah nangmouh koe e talai lem na poe awh haw atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hit taminaw ni Abraham koe a dei pouh e teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka bawipa kaimae lawk thai haw, nang teh kaimouh rahak vah Cathut e khobawi doeh. Hatdawkvah na ngai e hmuen rawi nateh pakawp ngoun. Na tami ro pakawp nahanelah apinihai phuen hmuen pasoung hoeh laipalah awm mahoeh, telah atipouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, Abraham teh a thaw teh, Hit taminaw hoi hote ram dawk e taminaw hmalah a tabo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hahoi, ahnimouh koe, ka tami ro pakawp nahanelah, na lungkuep awh pawiteh ka lawk thai awh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangmouh koe, phuen hmuen ka tawn thai nahanelah, Zohar capa Ephron ni, amae law apout koe lah kaawm e Makpelah talungkhu hah, aphu hoi kâki lah kai koe a yo thai nahane, ahni koe na het pouh haw loe, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hat torei teh Hit taminaw koe Ephron teh a tahung. Hit tami Ephron ni khopui longkha dawk hoi ka kâen e Hit taminaw pueng ni a thainae koe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Telah nahoeh, ka bawipa law na poe awh, law thung kaawm e talungkhu hai na poe awh. Ka miphunnaw hmaitung roeroe na poe awh, na tami ro teh pakawp leih telah Abraham koe atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Abraham teh, hote ram dawk e taminaw hmalah a tabo teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ram dawk e taminaw ni a thainae koe Ephron hanelah na lungkuep pawiteh thai haw, law hmuen phu teh na poe han. Aphu dâw leih, hote hmuen koe ka tami ro teh ka pakawp han atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ephron ni Abraham koe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka bawipa, ka lawk thai haw, ka law hmuen phu tangka (shekel) cumpali touh doeh. Nang hoi kai hanlah banghai bang nahoeh. Na tami ro teh pakawp yaw kaw telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abraham ni a lungkuepkhai teh, Hit taminaw ni a thainae koe tangka shekel cumpali touh hno kayawtnaw ni a khing e patetlah a khing teh a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hatdawkvah Mamre kho hoi kanîtholah, Makpelah hmuen koe kaawm e Ephron e law, law thung kaawm e talungkhu hoi thingkungnaw, lawri koe kaawm e thingkung pueng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hit taminaw hoi khopui longkha koe ka tho e tami pueng e hmaitung vah Abraham ni coe hanelah a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, Abraham ni Mamre kho, Hebron hoi kanîtholah, Makpelah law dawk e talungkhu dawk a yu Sarah teh a pakawp.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hatdawkvah lawhmuen hoi talungkhu teh, Abraham ni phuen hmuen lah, a tawn hanelah, Hit taminaw ni a poe.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abraham teh a kumcue teh a matawng poung toe. BAWIPA ni Abraham teh hno pueng dawk yawhawi a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abraham ni a san, a imthungkhu thung dawk kacue poung lah a tawn e naw pueng lathueng vah kâ ka tawn poung e koevah, pahren lahoi na kut hah ka phai rahak vah tat haw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />kai teh ahnimouh rahak kho ka sak ei, Kanaan tanglanaw heh ka capa hane a yu lah lat hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hateiteh, ka miphunnaw koe, ka hmaunawnghanaw e im dawk cet nateh ka capa Isak hanelah a yu na paluen pouh han telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A san ni ahni koe, Napui ni hete ram dawk tho ngai hoehpawiteh, na capa heh na thonae ram dawkvah ka ceikhai han na maw, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Abraham ni ahni koe, ka capa heh haw ceikhai hoeh nahanlah kâhruetcuet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hete ram heh na ca catounnaw ka poe han telah kai koe lawk ka kam, kalvan e BAWIPA Cathut ni apa im hoi ka tâconae ram dawk hoi na kalatkung ni na hmalah kalvantami a patoun vaiteh hote hmuen dawk e ka capa hanlah a yu na paluen pouh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hote napui ni kâbang ngai hoehpawiteh, kai koevah thoebonae dawk hoi nang teh na hlout han. Ka capa teh haw na cetkhai mahoeh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hottelah a san ni a bawipa e a tangka vah a kut a ta teh, hote kong dawk thoe a kâbo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A san ni a bawipa e kalauk thung dawk hoi hra touh a hrawi teh, a bawipa e hnokahawi phunkuep hah a sin teh a kamthaw. Hottelah a kamthaw teh Mesopotamia ram e Nahor kho lah a cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tangmin lah napuinaw tui do hanlah thonae tueng dawkvah, longkha teng e tuikhu koe a kalauknaw a kamkawn sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahni ni, Oe BAWIPA Cathut, pahren lahoi sahnin vah, ka bawipa, Abraham koevah na lungmanae kamnuek sak nateh na kuep sak haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khenhaw! tuikhu koevah ka kangdue. Khothung e a canunaw hai tui do hanlah a tho awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hettelah awm naseh, tangla koe pahren lahoi tui ka nei hanlah tuium hah patue sak haw, ka ti navah, ahni ni net leih, na kalauknaw a nei hanlah ka poe han telah ka tet e teh na san Isak hanlah na hmoun pouh e lah awm naseh. Hottelahoi ka bawipa koe lungmanae na kamnue sak tie hah ka panue thai han telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hahoi, lawk koung a dei hoehnahlan vah, Abraham e a nawngha Nahor e a yu Milkah capa Bethuel canu Rebekah teh a loung dawk tuium thueng hoi a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tangla teh a meihawipoung. Thoundoun ni a ikhai hoeh rae tanglakacuem lah ao. Tuikhu koe a cathuk teh tuium tui yikkawi a do hnukkhu, a takhang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sanpa ni ahni kâhmo hanlah a yawng teh, pahren lahoi na tuium dawk e tui youn touh na pânei haw telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Napui ni net leih ka bawipa telah atipouh. Karang poung lah a tuium teh a loung dawk hoi a patue teh tui a pânei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tui a pânei hnukkhu, na kalauknaw hanlah hai tui a boum awh hoehroukrak boutbout ka do han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Karang poung lah tui teh dokko dawk a hlun teh tui bout do hanlah tuikhu koe lah a cathuk teh kalauknaw pueng hanelah tui a do pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tongpa ni lawkkamuem hoi a khet teh, BAWIPA ni kahlawng ka ceinae a lam a kâko sak vaiteh akuep sak hoi kakuep sak hoeh hane panue hane a ngai dawk lawkkamuem lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kalauknaw ni tui koung a nei awh hnukkhu vah, hnongpacap hoi sui kuthrawt sekel hra touh ka ri e hah a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahni koevah, nang apie canu maw. Pahren lahoi na dei pouh haw. na Pa im dawk ka roe nahanlah rakhan ao han na ou, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Napui ni ahni koevah, Milkah ni Nahor hanlah a khe pouh e Bethuel canu doeh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Napui ni hothloilah, caphon hoi saring e rawca moi ka tawn awh. Roenae rakhan haiyah ka tawn awh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hat toteh, a san ni a lûsaling teh BAWIPA hah a bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahni ni, ka bawipa lathueng vah a lungmanae hoi hawinae ka pout thai hoeh e, ka bawipa Abraham e BAWIPA Cathut teh pholen lah awm naseh. Kai patenghai BAWIPA ni ka bawipa e a hmaunawnghanaw e im dawk na ceikhai tangngak telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tangla ni a yawng teh hno kaawmnaw hah a manu imthungkhu hah a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Rebekah ni a thangroi a tawn. Ahnie min teh Laban doeh. Laban a tâco teh tuikhu koelah hote tongpa koevah a yawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hahoi, hnongpacap hoi a tawncanu e a kut dawk e a buet e a hmu nah, tongpa ni hottelah na dei pouh telah a tawncanu ni a dei e a thai toteh, tongpa koevah a cei. Ahni teh tuikhu koe e kalauknaw rahak vah kangdout e hah a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Laban ni, BAWIPA ni yawhawi a poe e tho nateh, kaie im dawk luenh. Bangkongmaw alawilah na kangdue Bangkongtetpawiteh, im hoi kalauknaw hanlah hmuen teh koung ka rakueng toe telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tongpa ni imthung a kâen teh Laban ni kalauk van e hnonaw a patue pouh. Hahoi, kalauk hanlah caphon hoi rawca hah a poe teh, ama hoi a huinaw hanelah khok pâsu nahanlah tui a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ca hane rawca a hmalah a pâtoum pouh. Hateiteh, ahni ni, ka tho ngainae ka dei hoehroukrak ka cat mahoeh telah atipouh. Ahnimouh ni dei yawkaw telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahni ni kai teh Abraham e a san doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />BAWIPA ni ka bawipa teh yawhawi a poe dawk moi a tawnta. BAWIPA ni ahni koevah tunaw, maitonaw, tangka hoi sui, san napui tongpa, kalauknaw, lanaw hah a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ka bawipa e a yu Sarah ni a matawng hnukkhu, capa buet touh a khe pouh teh a tawn e naw pueng teh ahni koevah a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hahoi, ka bawipa ni ka onae Kanaan tanglanaw hah ka capa hanelah a yu lah na paluen pouh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ka im vah, ka hmaunawnghanaw koe cet nateh ka capa hanelah a yu paluen pouh telah lawk na kam sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ka bawipa koe napui ni kâbang ngai laipalah ao thai telah ka ti pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ahni ni kai koevah, a hmalah ouk ka onae BAWIPA ni a kalvantami nang koevah a patoun vaiteh, na ceinae koe a lamcawn sak han. Hottelah ka hmaunawnghanaw hoi apa imthungkhunaw koehoi ka capa hanlah a yu na paluen pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ka hmaunawnghanaw koe na pha nah napui na poe ngai hoeh boipawiteh, hete lawkkamnae dawk hoi na hlout han telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Sahnin vah tuikhu koe ka pha teh, Oe, ka bawipa Abraham e BAWIPA Cathut, ka ceinae koe a lam na cawn sak han pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuikhu koevah ka kangdue teh tui do hanlah ka tho e tanglakacuem apipatet koe haiyah, pahren lahoi tuium dawk e tui youn touh na pânei haw telah ka ti navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Napui ni kai koevah, net haw. Na kalauknaw hanlah tui ka do han telah a ka tet e tami teh, ka bawipa e a capa hanlah BAWIPA ni a hmoun e lah awm naseh telah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Khenhaw! hottelah, ka lungthin hoi koung ka dei hoehnahlan vah, Rebekah teh tuium hoi a tho. Tuikhu koe a cathuk teh tui a do. Hahoi, ahni koevah, pahren lahoi tui na net sak haw telah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ahni ni a loung dawk e tuium hah a patue teh tui net leih. Na kalauknaw hai tui pânei leih telah ati. Hatdawkvah, tui ka nei teh, kalauknaw tui a nei han haiyah a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Kai ni nang apie canu maw telah ka pacei Ahni ni, Milkah ni a khe e Nahor e capa Bethuel e canu doeh telah ati. Hatdawkvah, a hnawng dawk hnongpacap ka bang pouh teh a kut dawk hai laikaw ka buet sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ka lûsaling laihoi BAWIPA hah ka bawk teh, ka bawipa Abraham e BAWIPA Cathut, ka bawipa e a nawngha e canu, a capa hane a yu paluen pouh hane lamkatang dawk na kahrawikung hah ka pholen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Atuvah ka bawipa lathueng vah lungmanae hoi lawkkatang na kamnue sak hanelah awm pawiteh, na dei pouh haw. Hottelah hoeh nakunghai, kai koe vah na dei pouh awh haw. Hat to doeh, avoilah hai, aranglah hai ka kamlang thai tih telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Laban hoi Bethuel ni a pathung teh hete hno heh BAWIPA koehoi ka tâcawt e doeh. Ahawi thoseh, a thoe thoseh ka dei thai a hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Khenhaw! Rebekah teh na hmaitung doeh ao. Hrawi nateh cetkhaih. BAWIPA ni a dei tangcoung e patetlah na bawipa e a capa e a yu lah awm naseh, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Hahoi, Abraham e a sanpa ni ahnimae lawk a thai navah, talai a tabo teh BAWIPA hah a bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Abraham e a sanpa ni kamthoupnae suingun hoi hnicu a rasa teh Rebekah hah a poe. A thangroi hoi a manu hai aphu kaawm e hno hah a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Ahni hoi a huinaw teh a canei awh teh, hote tangmin teh a roe awh. Amom a thaw teh ka bawipa koe na cetsak awh, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Hateiteh, a thangroi hoi a manu ni, napuica teh hnin dongdeng, hnin hra touh thung teh kaimouh koe awm sak ei, hahoi ka ceisak han telah atipouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Ahni ni ahnimouh koevah, na haw awh hanh leih. BAWIPA ni ka ceinae dawk a lamcawn sak e patetlah ka bawipa koevah ka ban thai nahanlah na cetsak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni, napuica kaw awh vaiteh, amae pahni ring awh ei sei telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Rebekah hah a kaw awh teh, hete tongpa koe na cei han maw telah a pacei awh. Napui ni ka cei han telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, a tawncanu Rebekah hoi kaawmkhai e, Abraham e a san hoi a hnukkâbang teh a ceisak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Hahoi ahnimouh ni Rebekah, ka tawncanu, nang teh tami a thongsang e manu lah na awm naseh, Na ca catounnaw ni a tarannaw e longkhanaw hah uk awh naseh telah yawhawi a poe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Rebekah ni a tho teh a sannunaw hoi kalauk van a kâcui teh tongpa hnuk a kâbang. Hahoi, Abraham e a san ni Rebekah hah a hrawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Isak teh Beerlahairoi koe lahoi a tho. Bangkongtetpawiteh, akalah kaawm e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Tangminlasa vah Isak teh khopouk hanlah law lah a cei teh radoung teh a khet nah kalauk a tho e hah a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Rebekah ni a khet teh Isak a hmu toteh, kalauk van hoi a kum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, a san koevah, law dawkvah maimouh dawn hanlah ka tho e tami teh apimaw, telah yo a pacei toe. A san ni ka bawipa doeh telah atipouh. Hatdawkvah, minhmai ramuknae hni a la teh a minhmai hah a ramuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />A san ni a sak e naw pueng Isak koevah a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Isak ni Rebekah teh a manu Sarah e lukkareiim dawk a kâenkhai. A yu lah a coung teh a lungpataw. Hatdawkvah, a manu a due hnukkhu vah, Isak teh a lungmawng.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abraham ni Keturah a yu lah bout a la.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hote a yu ni Zimran, Jokshan, Medan, Midian, Ishbak hoi Shuah tinaw a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jokshan ni capa Sheba hoi Dedan a sak. Dedan capanaw teh Asshurim, Lethushim hoi Leummim tinaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Midian capanaw teh Ephah, Epher, Hanok, Abida hoi Eldaah tinaw doeh. Hetnaw pueng teh Keturah ca catounnaw lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Abraham ni a tawn e pueng hah Isak a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hateiteh, Abraham ni a yu do hoi a sak e canaw teh poehno a poe. Ama a hring nah roeroe vah Isak koehoi kanîtholae ram lah a cei sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abraham e a hringyung teh a kum 175 touh a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abraham ni a hnukteng poung a kâha teh se kuep laihoi nget matong hoi kum rek kakueplah a due teh a hmaunawnghanaw koe vah a pakawp awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A capa Isak hoi Ishmael ni Hit tami Zoar capa Ephron law dawk Mamre teng Makpelah talung kâko dawk a pakawp roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hote law teh Abraham ni Hetnaw koehoi a ran e doeh. Hote hmuen koe Abraham teh a yu Sarah koe a pakawp awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Abraham a due hnukkhu vah, Cathut ni Isak hah yawhawi a poe. Isak teh Beerlahairoi dawk kho a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Het heh Abraham capa Ishmael, Sarah e a sannu, Izip tami Hagar ni Abraham hoi a khe roi e canaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hetnaw heh min parui lahoi a catoun lahoi Ishmael capanaw e min lah ao. Ishmael capa camin teh Nebaioth doeh. A nawnghanaw teh Kedar, Adbeel, Mibsam tinaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mishma, Dumah, Massa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hadad, Tema, Jetur, Naphish hoi Kedemah tinaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hotnaw teh Ishmael capanaw lah ao teh amamouh hoi kho hoi a roenae patetlah a min a thut awh. A miphun parui lah bawi hlaikahni touh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ishmael a dam nathung a kum teh 137 touh a pha. A hnuktengpoung e a kâha a phout teh a due. A hmaunawnghanaw koevah a pakawp awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahnimouh teh Havilah ram koehoi Assyria ram pâtam hoi Izip ram teng Shur totouh kho a sak awh. A hmaunawnghanaw e hmaitung vah a due.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Abraham e capa Isak e catounnaw teh hettelah ao. Abraham ni a capa Isak a khe teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Isak ni Paddanaram ram e Syria tami Bethuel canu, Syria tami Laban e a tawncanu Rebekah a yu lah a la nah a kum 40 touh a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A yu teh carôe dawk BAWIPA koevah pou a hei teh BAWIPA ni a heinae teh a thai pouh dawkvah Rebekah teh camo a vawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Camo a vawn e teh a thung vah pou a kâthe dawkvah, ahni ni hettelah awm rah pawiteh, bangkongmaw kahring rah telah ati. Hatdawkvah, BAWIPA koe pacei hanlah a cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />BAWIPA ni camo im dawk miphun kahni touh ao. Na von thung hoi miphun kahni touh kâkapek han. Miphun buet touh e teh buet touh e hlak a thayoun han. Hahoi, a hmau ni a nawngha e thaw a tawk pouh han telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hottelah camo khenae tueng a pha toteh, camo im dawk ca samphei e ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hmaloe e teh ka palingphung lahoi a tâco. Hni muen patetlah a muen puk a tho teh a min lah Esaw telah a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hathnukkhu hoi, a nawngha teh Esaw e khokpaimai kuet lahoi a tâco. Hatdawkvah, a min lah Jakop telah a phung. Rebekah ni ahni a khe nah Isak teh a kum 60 touh a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Camo roi a roung teh, Esaw teh moi ka ka thai poung e samram pou ka cet tami lah ao. Hateiteh, Jakop teh kâkamuete lah ao dawk im vah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Isak teh Esaw ni a thokhai e moi ouk a ca dawkvah, Esaw hah a lungpataw. Hateiteh, Rebekah ni teh Jakop hah a lungpataw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jakop ni rawca a thawng teh, Esaw teh kahrawng hoi a tho nah a vonhlam ni a khaw teh ngawt a tawn dawkvah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Esaw ni Jakop koevah, pahren lahoi na thawng e rawca hah na cat sak haw. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ka vonhlam ni na khaw toe telah atipouh. Hat dawk nahoehmaw min teh Edom telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hateiteh, Jakop ni camin coungnae hah hmaloe lah na ran sak telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Esaw ni khenhaw! kai teh meimei ka due toe, camin coungnae teh kai hanlah bangmaw cungkei han telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jakop ni, kai koevah hmaloe thoekâbo ei, telah atipouh. Jakop koe thoe a kâbo teh a camin coungnae hah a yo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jakop ni Esaw teh vaiyei hoi rawca a thawng e hah a poe. Hottelah, a canei hnukkhu vah a tâco teh a cei. Hot patetlah Esaw ni camin coungnae hah banglahai noutna hoeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abraham a hring nathung vah ahmaloe e takangnae hloilah, Isak tueng nahai hote ram dawk takangnae a tho. Hatdawkvah, Isak teh Gerar kho Filistin siangpahrang Abimelek koevah a cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahni koevah, BAWIPA a kamnue teh Izip ram vah cet hanh. Kai ni na dei pouh hane ram dawk awmh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hete ram dawk awmh. Nang koe ka o vaiteh yawhawinae na poe han. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Hete ram pueng heh nang hoi na catounnaw koe poe hoi na pa Abraham koevah lawk ka kam e patetlah ka sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kalvan e âsi yit touh na ca catounnaw ka pung sak vaiteh hete ram pueng heh na ca catounnaw koevah ka poe han. Hahoi, na ca catounnaw lahoi talai miphunnaw pueng yawhawinae lah ao awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, Abraham ni kaie lawk, kai ni dei e, kaie kâpoelawknaw, kaie phunglawknaw hoi kaie kâlawknaw hah a tarawi telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hot patetlah Isak teh Gerar vah kho a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khocanaw ni a yu e kong a pacei teh ahni ni, ka tawncanu doeh telah atipouh. A meihawipoung dawkvah, ka yu doeh telah ka tetpawiteh hete khocanaw ni na thei han doeh telah ati dawk doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hahoi, hote kho dawk moikasaw ao hnukkhu, Filistin siangpahrang Abimelek ni hlalangaw koehoi kho hah a radoung nah Isak ni a yu Rebekah hoi a pai roi e hah a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Abimelek ni Isak hah a kaw teh na yu roeroe doeh. Bangkongmaw ka tawncanu telah na ti thai, telah atipouh. Isak ni ahni kecu dawk due hane ka taki dawk doeh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Abimelek ni kaimae lathueng vah bang hno maw na sak. Taminaw ni na yu heh a ikhai thai nahoehmaw. Hottelah kaimouh lathueng vah hnokahawi hoeh na pha sak thai nahoehmaw telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Abimelek ni apihai ama thoseh, a yu thoseh, ka tek e tami teh thei roeroe lah ao han telah a taminaw pueng koe kâ a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Isak ni hote ram dawk cang a patue teh BAWIPA ni hote kum dawk roeroe alet 100 touh yawhawinae a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahni teh hoehoe a bawi teh, lutlut bawi totouh a tawn, hnopai hoehoe a pungdaw pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, tuhunaw hoi maitonaw hoi a sannaw moi a tawn. Hatdawkvah, Filistinnaw ni a ut awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A na pa Abraham a hring nah a sannaw ni a tai e tuikhunaw pueng hah Filistinnaw ni hno han pasoung hoeh dawkvah, talai koung a paten sin awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abimelek ni Isak koevah, kaimouh koehoi tâcawt leih. Bangkongtetpawiteh, nang teh kaimouh hlak vah hno na sak thai telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Isak ni hote hmuen koehoi a tâco teh Gerar yawn dawk rim a sak teh haw vah kho a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A na pa Abraham ni a hring nah a tai e tuikhunaw hah Isak ni bout a tai. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Abraham a due hnukkhu vah Filistinnaw ni talai muen a paten awh. Hahoi, a na pa ni min a phung e patetlah min bout a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Isak e sannaw ni hai hote yawn dawk tuikhu a tai awh teh hote hmuen koe tui a tâco e hah a hmu awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hateiteh, Gerar e saring kakhoumnaw ni tui heh kaimae doeh telah Isak e saring kakhoumnaw hoi a kâounkhai awh. Ahnimouh hoi a kâoun awh dawkvah, tuikhu e min teh Esek telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuikhu alouke bout a tai teh hote haiyah lawp hanlah a kâounkhai awh dawkvah a min Sitnah telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hote hmuen koehoi a kampuen awh teh alouke tuikhu hah bout a tai awh. Hote teh lawp hanlah kâcai awh hoeh toe. Atu teh BAWIPA ni hmuen kakawpoung na sak pouh dawkvah hete ram dawk canaw moikapap ka khe awh han toe telah ati awh teh a min lah Rehoboth telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hote hmuen koehoi Beersheba lah a takhang awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hote tangmin dawkvah BAWIPA teh ahni koevah a kamnue teh kai teh na pa Abraham e Cathut doeh, taket hanh, bangkongtetpawiteh, nang koe ka o. Yawhawinae na poe vaiteh, ka san Abraham pawlawk hoi na ca catounnaw ka pungdaw sak han telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hote hmuen koe khoungroe hah a sak. BAWIPA min a kaw teh rim a sak. Hahoi, Isak e sannaw ni hote hmuen koe tuikhu hah a tai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Gerar hoi Abimelek teh a hui Ahuzzath hoi a ransabawi Fikol hoi ahni koevah a tho awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Isak ni na hmuhma awh teh namamouh koehoi na pâlei hnukkhu, bangkongmaw kai koevah bout na tho awh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni nang koevah BAWIPA ao tie kamcengcalah ka panue awh. Patawnae poe hanlah ka tho awh hoeh. Hawinae hoi roumnae lahoi na ceisak e patetlah kaimouh pataw nahanlah banghai na sak hoeh nahanlah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />kaimouh rahak vah, nangmouh hoi kaimouh rahak roeroe dawkvah lawkkamnae awm naseh. Nang teh BAWIPA ni yawhawi a poe e tami doeh telah atipouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Isak ni ahnimouh hanlah buvennae a sak pouh teh a canei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amom lah palang a tho awh teh buet touh hoi buet touh thoebo lawkkamnae a sak awh. Isak ni a ceisak teh ahni koehoi karoumcalah hoi a tâco awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hote hnin dawkvah, Isak e sannaw hah a tho awh teh tuikhu a tai awh e kongnaw a dei pouh teh, tui ka hmu awh toe telah atipouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hote tuikhu teh Sheba telah ati awh. Hatdawkvah, hote kho teh sahnin totouh Beersheba telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Esaw teh a kum 40 touh a pha nah Hit tami Beeri canu Judith hoi Hit tami Elon e canu Basemath hah a yu lah a paluen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hotnaw teh Isak hoi Rebekah a lung ka pataw sakkungnaw doeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hahoi, hettelah ao. Isak teh matawng toung dawkvah mithmu thai hoeh totouh a mitmawm hnukkhu, a capa kacue e Esaw hah a kaw teh ahni koevah, ka capa telah atipouh. Ahni ni hi vah ka o telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A na pa ni atu kai teh ka matawng toe. Na tueng maw ka due han ti hai ka panuek hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, pahren lahoi palabom hoi licung hah sin nateh kahrawng vah moi na ka pouh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka due hoehnahlan yawhawi na poe thai nahanlah ka ngai e patetlah katuipoung lah na thawng pouh nateh ka ca hanlah kai koevah thokhai telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isak ni a capa Esaw hoi lawk a kâpato roi e hah Rebekah ni a thai. Hatdawkvah, Esaw teh moi ka hanlah kahrawng vah a cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Rebekah ni a capa Jakop koevah, thai haw, na pa ni na hmau Esaw koevah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />moi ka nateh ka due hoehnahlan ka ca vaiteh BAWIPA hmalah yawhawinae na poe thai nahanlah rawca katuipoung lah na thawng pouh haw telah a dei pouh e ka thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, ka capa kai ni kâ na poe e patetlah na ngâi han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Atu saringnaw koe cet nateh haw e hmaeca kahawi e kahni touh kai koevah thokhai. Hottelah, na pa hanlah, ama ni a ngai e patetlah katuipoung lah na thawng pouh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A due hoehnahlan yawhawinae na poe thai nahanlah a ca hane na pa koevah na ceikhai han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jakop ni a manu Rebekah koevah, Khenhaw! ka hmau Esaw teh muen puk a tho, hatei, kai teh muen ka tawn hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Apa ni na payam pawiteh, ahni ka dum e lah kaawm vaiteh, yawhawinae laipalah thoebonae koe kâhmo payon han na vaimoe telah a manu koe atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hatei, a manu ni ahni koevah, na thoebonae teh kai dawk phat na seh. Ka dei e hah tarawi nateh na lat pouh haw telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahni ni a cei teh a la. A manu koe a poe teh a manu ni na pa ni ngai e patetlah a thawng pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rebekah ni a capa kacue Esaw e khohna kahawipoung e, im ahni koe kaawm hah a la teh, a capa kanaw Jakop hah a khohna sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hmae pho hah a kut hoi muen o hoeh nae lahuen dawk a bet pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hahoi, ka tuipoung lah thawng e hmae moi hoi vaiyei hah a capa Jakop koevah a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, na pa koe vah a cei teh, apa telah ati teh, a na pa ni hi vah ka o, ka capa, api nang maw telah a pacei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jakop ni a na pa koevah, na capa kacue Esaw doeh, na patoun e patetlah koung ka sak toe, pahren lahoi thaw nateh yawhawinae na poe thai nahanlah rawca heh cat leih telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hatei, Isak ni a capa koevah, ka capa bangtelamaw telah karanglah na hmu thai telah atipouh. Ahni ni na BAWIPA Cathut ni na poe dawk doeh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Isak ni ka capa, na payam thai nahanlah pahren lahoi na hnai haw. Ka capa Esaw katang maw telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jakop ni a na pa Isak teh a hnai. A na pa ni a payam teh na lawk teh Jakop e lawk doeh, a kut teh Esaw e a kut doeh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A kut hah a hmau Esaw e kut patetlah muen a tho dawkvah, panuek thai laipalah yawhawinae a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A na pa ni, ka capa Esaw nang ka tang maw telah atipouh. Ahni ni, Oe kai doeh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahni ni, kai koe rek thokhai haw yawhawinae na poe thai nahanlah ka capa ni thokhai e moi teh ka ca hanlah telah ati. Hahoi, a hnai teh a ca. Misur hai a poe teh a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A na pa Isak ni ahni koevah, ka capa na hnai nateh na paco haw telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, a hnai teh a paco Ahni ni khohna hmui hah a thai teh yawhawi a poe. Thaihaw! ka capa e hmui heh BAWIPA ni yawhawinae ram hmuitui patetlah ao roeroe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Cathut ni kalvan e tadamtui thoseh, talai hawinae thoseh, cakang moikapap hoi misur moikapap na poe naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Miphunnaw ni na thaw tawk awh naseh, miphun hah na hmalah tabawk awh naseh. Na hmaunawnghanaw e bawi lah awm nateh, na manu e canaw na hmalah tabawk awh naseh. Thoe na ka bo naw pueng thoebo lah ao vaiteh yawhawinae na ka poe e pueng hah yawhawi awh naseh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hahoi, hettelah ao. Isak ni Jakop yawhawinae phouk a poe nah Jakop teh a na pa koehoi nueng a tâco tahma vah Esaw teh samram a ceinae koehoi a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahni ni hai katuipoung lah a thawng van teh, a na pa koevah a thokhai. A na pa koevah, na hringnae ni yawhawi na poe nahanlah apa teh a thaw vaiteh, a capa ni thokhai e moi hah cat naseh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A na pa Isak ni ahni koevah, nang apimaw telah a pacei. Ahni ni na capa, na ca kacue Esaw doeh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Isak teh pueng hoi a pâyaw teh, moi ka hoi kai koe ka thokhai e teh apimaw. Nang na tho hoehnahlan ca vah koung ka ca teh yawhawi ka poe e hah teh api namaw. Ahni teh yawhawi lah ao roeroe han, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Esaw ni a na pa e lawk dei e a thai navah, pueng hoi a ka teh a na pa koevah, Oe apa, kai hai, yawhawinae na poe telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hateiteh, a na pa ni na nawngha ni na dum teh na yawhawinae na la pouh toe telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Esaw ni a min lah Jakop tie heh ahman katang nahoehmaw. Kai heh vai hni touh na dum teh na tâ toe. Camin coungnae na lah pouh. Atu ka yawhawinae bout na la pouh telah ati. Ahni roeroe ni yawhawinae na tat pouh hoeh maw, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Isak ni Esaw koe vah, khenhaw! ahni teh na bawi lah ka coung sak teh a hmaunawnghanaw pueng hai a san lah koung ka poe toe. Cakang hoi misur hoi ka kawk toe. Ka capa nang hanlah bangmaw na sak pouh han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Esaw ni a na pa koevah, apa yawhawinae buet touh dueng maw na tawn Oe apa kai hai yawhawi na poe lah telah ati. Hatdawkvah, Esaw teh ngawngngawng a ka.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A na pa Isak ni Esaw koevah, thai haw, na o nahane teh talai kahawi hoi kahlun lahoi tadamtui hoi a kâhla han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Na tahloi hoi na kâkawk vaiteh na nawngha e thaw na tawk pouh han. Hahoi, hettelah ao han, kâhat laipalah na kâroe hnukkhu, a kahnam rui hah na lahuen dawk hoi a ling han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A na pa ni yawhawi a poe dawkvah Esaw ni Jakop hah a hmuhma teh a lung hoi apa ka khuinae hnin teh a hnai toe. Hat hnukkhu ka nawngha Jakop teh ka thei han telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A capa kacue Esaw ni a dei e lawk hah Rebekah koe a dei pouh awh. Rebekah ni a capa kanaw Jakop a kaw teh, thai haw, na hmau Esaw teh nang na thei to doeh a lungroum ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, atu ka dei e hah ngai. Thaw nateh Haran vah ka thangroi Laban koe vah yawng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Na hmau a lungkhueknae a roum hoehroukrak thung teh haw vah awm ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Nange lathueng vah na hmau lungkhueknae a roum teh a lathueng vah na sak e heh a pahnim torei, tami ka patoun vaiteh na la sak han. Bangkongmaw hnin touh dawkvah nangmouh roi ka sung han telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Rebekah ni Isak koevah, Heth canunaw kecu dawk kai hring hane ka ngai hoeh toe. Jakop ni hete ram dawk e canunaw patet e tami, a yu lah lat pawiteh, kai ka hringnae aphu bangmaw kaawm han toung telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Isak ni Jakop hah a kaw teh yawhawinae a poe, tawngtang lawk a thui e teh, Kanaan canunaw thung e yu na lat mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thaw nateh Paddanaram ram dawk na manu e a na pa Bethuel im vah cet. Haw e na manu e a thangroi Laban canunaw thung dawk hoi na yu hah lat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangpueng ka sak thai e Cathut ni yawhawi na poe naseh, miphun moi kapap lah na pung thai nahanlah ca catoun moi na tawn sak teh na pungdaw sak naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Imyin lah onae ram, Cathut ni Abraham koe a poe e heh na coe nahanlah Abraham yawhawinae teh na coe sak awh naseh, nang hoi na canaw hoi telah lawk a thui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Isak ni Jakop teh yout a ceisak teh, Paddanaram ram e Jakop hoi Esaw e manu Rebekah e a thangroi Syria tami Bethuel capa Laban koevah a cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Isak ni Jakop hah yawhawi a poe teh a yu la hanlah Paddanaram ram lah a patoun. Yawhawi a poe nah Kanaan ram e tanglanaw yu lah na lat mahoeh telah lawk a thui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jakop ni a manu hoi a na pa e lawk hah a ngai teh, Paddanaram ram dawk a cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kanaan ram e tangla naw ni a na pa Isak lungyouk sak hoeh toe tie a hmu navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Esaw ni Ishmael koevah a cei teh a tawn tangcoung a yunaw hloilah, Abraham capa Ishmael e canu Mahalath Nebaioth tawncanu hah a yu lah a la.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jakop teh Beersheba hoi a kamthaw teh Haran lah a cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hmuen buet touh koe a pha teh kanîloum toung dawkvah a roe. Talung buet touh hah a la teh lahoung lah a lahoung teh i hanlah a yan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hahoi, mang a mang teh talai van khalai a kâdo teh a donghmo ni kalvan a pha. Hote khalai dawk Cathut e kalvantaminaw a kumluen awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A lathueng vah, BAWIPA a kangdue teh, Kai teh BAWIPA, na min Abraham e Cathut hoi Isak e Cathut lah ka o, na inae ram hah nang hoi na ca catounnaw ka poe han;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na ca catounnaw teh talai e vaiphu yit touh a pha awh han. Kanîtho, kanîloum, atunglah, akalah na pungdaw awh han. Nang pawlawk dawk hoi miphunnaw pueng ni yawhawinae a hmu awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khenhaw! nang koevah ka o. Na ceinae pueng koe na kountouk vaiteh, hete ram dawk bout na bankhai awh han. Nang koe ka dei e ka sak hoehnahlan pueng teh na cettakhai mahoeh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jakop ni a kâhlaw teh, hete hmuen koe BAWIPA teh ao roeroe ka panuek laipalah ka o, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, a taki teh, het hmuen heh takikatho e lah ao! hete heh hmuen alouke nahoeh, Cathut e im, kalvan longkha lah ao, telah ati. Jakop ni amom a thaw teh a lahoung e talung hah a lah teh talung lah a ung teh a van vah satui hah a awi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jakop ni amom a thaw teh a lahoung e talung hah a lah teh lungkhoung a ung teh, avan vah satui hah a awi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hote hmuen hah Bethel telah a phung. Hote kho teh hmaloe vah Luz lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jakop ni, apa im dawk lungmawngcalah ka ban thai nahan, kai koe Cathut hah ao teh ka ceinae lam hah a ring teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ca han e vaiyei hoi kâkhu hane hni na poe boipawiteh, BAWIPA teh ka Cathut lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hete talung ka ung e haiyah Cathut e im lah ao han, hahoi na poe hane naw pueng thung dawk hoi hra touh dawk buet touh teh na poe roeroe han, telah lawkkamnae hah a sak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakop ni pou a cei teh Kanîtholae taminaw e ram dawk a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A khet navah tuikhu kaawm e lawpam vah tuhu kathum touh a kamkawn e hah a hmu. Bangkongtetpawiteh, tuikhu thung e tui hah tunaw ouk a pânei awh. Tuikhu koe lungsong ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hote hmuen koe tunaw pueng pâkhueng lah ao han. Tuikhu khannae lungsong hah takhoe vaiteh, tu tui pânei hoi talung teh ama onae hmuen dawk bout teng lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jakop ni ahnimouh koevah, ka hmaunawnghanaw api kho maw, telah a pacei. Ahnimouh ni, Haran taminaw doeh telah atipouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahni ni ahnimouh koevah, Nahor capa Laban na panue awh maw telah a pacei. Ahnimouh ni, Oe ka panue awh, telah atipouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahni ni ahnimouh koevah, a hring rah maw, telah a pacei. Ahnimouh ni, Oe a dam rah doeh, khenhaw! a canu Rachel hai tu hoi a tho lahun, telah atipouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahni ni, Khenhaw! Kanî asaw rah, saring pâkhueng hanelah khout hoeh rah. Tunaw hah tui pânei awh nateh bout tha awh ei, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hateiteh, ahnimouh ni, tuhunaw pueng pâkhueng teh tuikhu tengnae talung takhoe hoehnahlan pueng teh tui pânei thai lah awm awh hoeh. Takhoe hnukkhu to doeh tu heh tui ouk ka pânei awh, telah atipouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hottelah, lawk a kâpan navah, Rachel teh a na pa e tunaw hoi a tho, bangkongtetpawiteh ahni teh tu ka khoum e napui lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hahoi, hettelah ao. Jakop ni a manu e a thangroi Laban e canu Rachel hoi tunaw a hmu toteh, a cei sin teh tuikhu tengnae talung hah a takhoe pouh teh a manu e a thangroi e tu hah tui a pânei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hahoi, Jakop ni Rachel hah a paco teh ngawngngawng a ka.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jakop ni Rachel koe a na pa e a na minca lah a onae hoi Rebekah e capa lah a onae kong hah a dei pouh. Hatdawkvah, Rachel ni a na pa koe ayawng teh a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hahoi, Laban ni a tawncanu e capa Jakop kong a thai tahma, ahni dawn hanelah ayawng. A tapam teh a paco hnukkhu, a im vah a hrawi. Jakop ni Laban koe hno kâhmo e akongnaw pueng a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Laban ni ahni koe, nang teh ka misa katang doeh, telah atipouh teh ahni koevah thapa yung touh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Laban ni Jakop koevah, Ka minca lah na o dawkvah, aphu laipalah ka thaw na tawk han na maw. Bangmaw na poe han dei haw, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Laban ni canu kahni touh a tawn teh a camin teh Leah a phung, a cahnoung teh Rachel a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leah teh a mit roumkawt e lah ao. Hatei, Rachel teh a tungtang hoi a mei kahawi e tami lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jakop ni Rachel a ngai dawkvah, na canu kanaw e Rachel hanlah kum sari touh na thaw ka tawk han, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Laban ni, ayâ alouke ka poe hlak teh nang na poe e heh ahawihnawn han doeh, kai koe awmh, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Jakop ni Rachel hanlah kum sari touh a thaw a tawk pouh, a lungpataw poung dawkvah hnin dawngdengca e patetlah a pouk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jakop ni Laban koe, ka ikhai thai nahanlah ka yu teh na poe leih, bangkongtetpawiteh, ahnintha teh akuep toe, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Laban ni khoca pueng a pâkhueng teh bu canae pawi a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hahoi, kho a hmo nah a canu Leah a hrawi teh Jakop koevah a thak pouh teh a ikhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Laban ni a sannu Zilpah hah a canu Leah koevah san hanlah a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khodai toteh, khenhaw! Leah lah a o, Jakop ni Laban koevah, ka lathueng vah na sak e heh bangmaw. Rachel ka yu nahanlah na thaw ka tawk hoeh na maw. Bangkongmaw na dum, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Laban ni, Ka ram dawk a hmau hoehnahlan a nawngha ceisak phung roeroe nahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hete napui hanlah hnin sari kuep sak ei, hahoi, kum sari touh ka thaw bout na tawk han e dawk alouknaw hai na poe han, telah atipouh e patetlah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jakop ni hottelah a sak teh hnin sari touh a kuep sak teh Laban ni a canu Rachel haiyah a yu hanlah a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hahoi, Laban ni a sannu Bilhah hah a canu Rachel koevah a san hanlah a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Rachel bout a ikhai. Leah hlakvah Rachel heh a lung hoe a pataw dawkvah, Laban e thaw kum sari touh bout a tawk pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />BAWIPA ni Leah teh lungpataw hoeh tie a panue dawkvah a thun a kamawng sak. Hatei, Rachel teh a carôe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Leah teh camo a vawn teh ca tongpa a khe, a min lah Reuben a phung. Bangkongtetpawiteh, BAWIPA ni runae ka kâhmo e a panue. Hatdawkvah, atu teh ka vâ ni na lungpataw han toe, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Camo bout a vawn teh ca tongpa bout a khe. Kai na hnoun e BAWIPA ni a thai dawkvah, hete ca tongpa hai na poe telah ati teh Simeon telah min a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Camo bout a vawn teh ca tongpa bout a khe. Atu teh ca tongpa kathum touh ka khe pouh toe dawkvah, ka vâ ni na tha mahoeh toe, telah ati. Hatdawkvah, a min lah Levih a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hahoi, camo bout a vawn teh ca tongpa bout a khe. Atu teh, BAWIPA ka pholen han, telah ati. Hatdawkvah, a min Judah a phung. Hahoi teh, camo khe hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rachel ni Jakop hanlah camo a khe pouh hoeh e a hmu toteh, a hmau hah a ut teh Jakop koe, Camo na poe, nahoeh pawiteh ka due han, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jakop teh Rachel koe a lungkhuek teh, ca khe han ka pasoung hoeh e Cathut yueng lah maw ka o, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Napui ni, khenhaw! ka sannu Bilhah heh ipkhai nateh kai ni hai ahni koehoi camo ka tawn thai nahanlah, ka phai dawk camo a khe han, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, a sannu Bilhah teh a yu hanlah a poe teh Jakop ni a ikhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bilhah ni camo a vawn teh Jakop hanlah ca tongpa a khe pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Rachel ni, Cathut ni na pouk teh ka lawk hai a thai dawkvah, ca tongpa na poe, telah ati. Hatdawkvah, a min lah Dan a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rachel e a sannu teh camo bout a vawn teh Jakop hanlah ca tongpa apâhni bout a khe pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Rachel ni, ka hmau hoi kâthe teh ka tâ toe telah ati. Hatdawkvah, a min lah Naptali a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leah ni camo ka khe thai hoeh toe tie a kâpanue dawkvah, a sannu Zilpah hah a ceikhai teh a yu hanlah Jakop hah a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Leah e a sannu, Zilpah ni camo tongpa Jakop hanlah a khe pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leah ni, a yawhawi, telah ati teh, a min lah Gad a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Leah e a sannu Zilpah ni ca tongpa Jakop hanlah bout a khe pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Leah ni, Ka yaw ahawi, napuinaw ni a yaw kahawi poung katang e na ti pouh han, telah ati teh a min lah Asher a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Canga tue nah Reuben teh law vah a cei teh, hloisi hah a hmu teh a manu Leah koevah a thokhai. Hatdawkvah, Rachel ni Leah koevah, pahren lahoi na capa hloisi youn touh na poe haw, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahni ni, ka vâ na lawp e heh hno tica e lah maw na pouk, ka capa hloisi totouh lawp han e na kâcai telah atipouh. Rachel ni, hat boi pawiteh, na capa e hloisi yueng lah atu tangmin na ikhai han, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tangmin lah Jakop teh law hoi a tho teh, Leah ni a dawn hanlah a thaw teh, Na ikhai roeroe han, bangkongtetpawiteh, ka capa koe e hloisi heh ka hlai toe, telah ati dawkvah, hote tangmin teh a ikhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cathut ni Leah e ratoumnae hah a tarawi, camo a vawn teh Jakop hanlah ca tongpa panganae a khe pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Leah ni, Ka sannu hah ka vâ koe ka poe dawkvah, Cathut ni ka tawknae aphu hah na poe van, telah a titeh a min lah Issakhar a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leah ni, Camo bout a vawn teh Jakop hanlah ca tongpa ataruknae bout a khe pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Leah ni, Cathut ni kahawi poung e kamthoupnae hoi na pathoup, ka vâ hanelah ca tongpa taruk touh ka khe pouh toung dawkvah, kai koe ao han toe, telah a titeh a min lah Zebulun a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, napuica bout a khe teh a min lah Dinah a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cathut ni Rachel hah pahnim hoeh. Hatdawkvah, Cathut ni a ratoumnae a tarawi pouh teh, camo im a kamawng sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hahoi, camo a vawn teh ca tongpa a khe. Cathut ni ka min mathoenae na ramuk pouh, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hahoi, BAWIPA ni capa alouke bout na poe ei naseh, a titeh a min lah Joseph a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rachel ni Joseph a khe hnukkhu hettelah ao. Jakop ni Laban koevah, ka onae ram lah ka ban thai nahanlah na cetsak leih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na thaw na tawk pouh toe. Hatdawkvah, ka yunaw hoi ka canaw na poe nateh na cetsak leih, bangkongtetpawiteh na thaw ka tawk e naw hah na panue, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Laban ni, Na pahren thai pawiteh, awm ei. Bangkongtetpawiteh, BAWIPA ni nang pawlawk dawk hoi yawhawinae na poe e hah ka mithmu vah ka panue, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama roeroe ni na hmu hane to nateh na poe han, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jakop ni ahni koevah, bangtelamaw na thaw ka tawk tie hoi na saring hah bangtelamaw kai koe ao ti hah na panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka tho hoehnahlan teh yitca doeh na tawnh, atuteh moikapap a kampung. Pek ka tho hoi BAWIPA ni yawhawinae hah na poe. Nâtuek maw ka imthungkhu hanelah thaw ka tawk van han telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hatdawkvah ahni koe, bangmaw na poe han telah atipouh. Jakop ni, banghai na poe hanh. Hetheh na sak pouh boipawiteh, na saringnaw teh bout na khoum pouh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Sahnin vah tuhu, hmaehu, thung ka cei teh, tarakcak e hmaenaw, humtamang e tunaw pueng hah koung a kapek toe. Hathnukkhu ka tarakcak e hmae, humtamang e tunaw teh kai ni ka coe hane aphu lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, atotovah kaie tawkphu ka hmu hane teh na hmalah a pha to vah, ka lannae ni na pathung han doeh. Hmae thung dawk tarakcak lah a em ka pangaw hoeh e, a em kasawlah ka pangaw hoeh e, tu thung dawk ka tamang hoeh e kai koe na hmawt pawiteh, ka paru e lah na pouk han, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Laban ni, Oe, na dei e patetlah tho lawiseh, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hot hnin totouh hoi, hmaetan tarakcak ni teh kasawlah a em kaawmnaw pueng hoi, Hmae manu tarakcak ni teh kasawlah a em kaawm e naw pueng, ka pangaw pueng hoi tu thung dawk ka tamangnaw pueng hah a kapek pouh teh a capanaw e a kut dawk a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ahni hoi Jakop rahak vah hnin thum lamcei koe ao sak teh, Jakop ni Laban e saringnaw pueng hah bout a thak pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jakop ni poplar hoi hazel hoi almond thing e akangnaw hah a la teh tarakcak lah a tarik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Saringnaw ni tui ouk a neinae dokko hoi palang dawkvah, saringnaw e hmalah sonron hah a ta. Bangkongtetpawiteh, tui nei hanlah ouk a tho awh nah saring hah âvâ ouk a cu awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, saring hah sonron teng âvâ ouk a cu nah, a em tarakcak lah ouk a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hahoi, Jakop ni tucanaw a kapek teh, Laban e saringhu thung dawk e a em kaawm hoi katamangnaw pueng koe lah a kangvawi sak. Amae saring hah a kapek teh Laban e saring hoi rei hrueng hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Atha bet kaawm hnawn e saring âvâcu toteh, sonron hmalah âvâcu thai nahanlah, Jakop ni tui a lawngnae koe saringnaw e a hmaitung vah, sonron hah ouk a ta pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hatei, saring hah kamsoe pawiteh tat pouh hoeh. Hottelah, ka kamsoe e a canaw teh Laban e lah ao teh, a tha bet kaawm e naw hah Jakop e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Jakop koe moi kapap lah a kampung teh saringhu moi kapap, sannu hoi sanpa naw hoi, kalauknaw hoi lanaw hah a tawn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Laban e canaw ni, Jakop ni kaimae apa e hno pueng koung a la pouh dawkvah, hete tawnta e naw pueng heh a hmu e doeh, telah a dei awh e lawk hah Jakop ni a thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jakop ni, Laban e minhmai a khet nah a hmoun e patetlah minhmai kahawi ka hmawt hoeh toe tie hah a panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, BAWIPA ni Jakop koevah, na mintoenaw e ram hoi na imthungkhu lah ban nateh, nang koe vah ka o han, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jakop ni tami a patoun teh Rachel hoi Leah hah saring onae law vah tho hanelah a kaw sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahnimouh roi koe, na pa e minhmai ka hmu navah, ahmoun e patetlah minhmai kahawi ka hmawt hoeh toe tie hah ka panue, hateiteh Apa Cathut teh kai koe ao toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka thayung abuemlahoi na pa e thaw ka tawk e hah na panue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hot nahlangva na pa ni na dum teh, ka hmu hane aphu hah vai hra touh na dum toe. Hatei patawnae na poe hane teh Cathut ni na pasoung hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tarakcak e pueng hah aphu lah ao han telah a dei teh saring pueng ni tarakcak lah koung a khe. Taracak hoi kâkalawt lah a khe e pueng aphu lah ao han ati ei nakunghai, saring pueng ni tarakcak lah koung a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hottelah, Cathut ni na pa e saringhu hah a la pouh teh kai na poe e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hahoi hettelah ao. Saring âvâ yawng hane a kamtawng nah ka mang lah ka khet teh, khenhaw! âvâ ka cawt e a tan hah a em lah kaawm e hoi a em tarakcak e hoi, a em dakdak kaawm e naw hah ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka mang lah Cathut e kalvantami ni, Jakop ati teh kai ni, hi vah ka i doeh, ka ti pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahni ni, moung na teh, khenhaw! a tan ni âvâ a yawng e pueng hah a em kaawm hoi a em tarakcak e hoi a em dakdak kaawm naw seng doeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Laban ni nang dawk a sak e naw pueng hah be ka panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kai teh talung na ungnae dawk satui na awinae, kai koe lawkkam na saknae Bethel, hote Bethel Cathut lah ka o. Atu thaw nateh hete ram heh tâcawt takhai, na khenae ram koe lah ban leih, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Rachel hoi Leah ni a pathung roi teh, apa im e maimouh hanelah ham hane hoi râw ao rah maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahni ni imyin patetlah na pouk awh toung nahoehmaw. Bangkongtetpawiteh, na yo awh teh maimae tangka hai be a ca awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, Cathut ni maimae na pa koehoi a la e naw pueng teh, maimae canaw hane doeh. Hottelah Cathut ni nang koe a dei e pueng teh sak yawkaw, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jakop hah a thaw teh, a capanaw hoi a yu roi hah kalauk dawk a kâcui sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kanaan ram a na pa Isak koe cei hanelah a saringnaw hoi hnopai a pâtung e a hmu e saringnaw pueng, Paddanaram ram e a tawn e naw pueng be a sin awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Laban teh amae tu muen ngaw hanelah a cei teh Rachel ni a cei teh a na pa e Terah meikaphawk hah yout a la pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jakop teh Siria tami Laban panuek laipalah, arulahoi a cei. A cei hane hah dei pouh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hottelah a tawn e naw pueng hoi a yawng. A thaw teh palang a raka teh Gilead mon lah pâtam lahoi a cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jakop a yawng tie hah apâthum hnin vah Laban koe a dei pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A hmaunawnghanaw a hrawi teh, hnin sari touh thung a pâlei teh Gilead mon dawk rek a pha awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hateiteh, Siria tami Laban koe karum a mang lahoi Cathut a tho teh, Jakop koe a thoe hoi hawi banghai na dei hoeh nahanelah kâhruetcuet, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hottelah Laban ni Jakop hah rek a pha. Jakop ni rim hah mon dawk a yap teh, Laban hoi a hmaunawnghanaw ni Gilead mon dawk ahnimae rim hah a yap awh van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Laban ni Jakop koe, na sak e hno heh bangmaw. Ka thai laipalah dung na cei awh teh, tarantuknae koe man e patetlah ka canunaw na yawngkhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bang kecu dawk maw, arulahoi tapueng hoi ratoung hoi na thak thai nahanlah dei laipalah na o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka capanaw hoi ka canunaw ka paco han na pasoung hoeh. Hottelae pathunae hno hah na sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kai ni koung na raphoe thai han ei teh, na pa Cathut ni karum ka mang lah, Jakop koe a thoe hoi hawi banghai na dei hoeh nahanelah kâhruetcuet, telah na dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na pa im na rabui poung kecu dawkvah, na ka cet e katang lah na o. Hatei bang kecu dawk maw ka cathutnaw na paru pouh awh, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jakop ni a pathung teh Laban koe, na canunaw heh thama lah na lawm vai tie hah ka puen dawk doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Namae cathut ka lat e teh hring sak hanh. Ka hmaunawnghanaw mithmu vah na cathut kai koe kaawm e teh kahawicalah khen nateh, lat yawkaw, telah ati. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Rachel ni a paru e hah Jakop ni la panuek hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Laban teh Jakop e rim hoi Leah e rim hoi a sannu kahni touh roi e rim koe a tawng teh, hmawt hoeh. Hahoi, Leah e rim hoi a tâco teh Rachel e rim dawk a kâen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Rachel ni meikaphawk hah a la teh kalauk ni phunae hno thung vah a hro. Laban ni rim thung naw pueng hah pheng a pâphue eiteh hmawt hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Rachel ni a na pa koe, na hmalah ka thaw ngai tho hoeh. Ka bawipa, na lungkhuek sak hanh, ka kampheng lahun lah ao dawk doeh, telah ati. Pheng a pâphue eiteh meikaphawk hah hmawt thai awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jakop teh a lungkhuek teh, Laban hah a yue. Jakop ni Laban koe, bang e phung maw ka ek, bangmaw ka yonnae ao teh, na lungkhuek laihoi na pâlei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka hnopainaw pueng be na pâphue teh, namae hnopai bangmaw na hmu. Maimouh roi teh lawkkâceng thai nahan ka hmaunawnghanaw hoi nange hmaunawnghanaw e hmalah tat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kum 20 totouh nang koe ka o teh, na tu hoi na hmaenaw ni ca khe laipalah awm boihoeh. Na tuhu thung e a tan hai ka cat boihoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Moimatheng ni a kei e hai nang koe ka phatkhai boihoeh. Kai ni paleipalang kahmat e yueng lah ouk ka rawng. Kanîthun lah a paru e naw karum lah a paru e naw hai na patho sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hettelah ouk ka o. Kanîthun khumbei um hai, karum a pâding nahai, rucat um hai, ka tawk. Ihmu boum lah ka ip boihoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hottelah kum 20 touh thung na im vah ka o teh, na canu roi ka hni touh kutphu e dawk kum 14, na thaw ka tawk. Na saring kutphu dawk kum 6 ka tawk teh, kutphu hah vai hra totouh bout na dum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Apa Cathut, Abraham Cathut, Isak Cathut ni a taki e hah kai koe awm hoehpawiteh, atu patenghai tak caici lah ban sak han na noe. Cathut ni karucatnae hoi ka patangnae hah a panue, paduem vah na yue toe, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Laban ni a pathung teh, Jakop koe, napuinaw heh kaie canunaw doeh. Tongpanaw hai kaie capanaw doeh. Saringnaw hai kaie saringnaw doeh. Na tawn e naw pueng heh kaie seng doeh. Hateiteh, sahnin vah hete ka canunaw hoi a canaw e a lathueng vah bangmaw ka sak thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, nang hoi kai lawkkamnae sak roi sei. Hothateh, nang hoi kai rahak dawk kapanuekkhaikung lah awm seh, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hottelah, Jakop ni talung a la teh talung hah a ung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Telah Jakop ni a hmaunawnghanaw koevah, talung pung awh haw, telah ati. Talung hah a la awh teh, a pung awh. Hot van vah bu a ca awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Laban ni talung pung e hah Jegarsahdutha telah a phung. Hateiteh Jakop ni Galeed telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Laban ni hete pung e talung heh sahnin vah, kai hoi nang rahak vah, lawk kapanuekkhaikung lah ao telah ati. Hatdawkvah a min lah Galeed telah ati e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Mizpah telah hai ati awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Laban ni kamphei awh hnukkhu hoi BAWIPA ni maimanaw na ring lawiseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ka canunaw heh roedeng na poe teh, yu alouke na tawn pawiteh, apihai maimouh koe awm hoeh eiteh, khenhaw! Cathut teh nang hoi kai rahak vah, kapanuekkhaikung lah ao, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Laban ni Jakop koe hete talung ung e hoi hete talung pung e heh kai hoi nang rahak vah ka ta e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Patawnae poe hanelah kai ni hete talung pung e hoi talung ung e hloilah ka tho mahoeh, tie hoi nang ni hai hete talung pung e hoi talung ung e hloilah tapuet hoi na tho mahoeh, telah hete talung pung e hah kapanuekkhaikung lah awm nateh, hete talung ung e hai kapanuekkhaikung lah awm naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Abraham Cathut, Nahor Cathut, a na pa Cathut ni maimae rahak lawkceng naseh, telah ati. Hahoi Jakop ni a na pa Isak ni taki e noe lahoi thoe a bo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Jakop ni mon dawkvah, thuengnae a sak teh a hmaunawnghanaw hah vaiyei ca hanelah a kaw teh, vaiyei hah a ca awh. Mon dawkvah a roe awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakop teh a cei teh, Cathut e kalvantaminaw ni a dawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jakop ni hmu toteh hete Cathut roenae hmuen doeh telah a titeh, hote hmuen teh Mahanaim telah min a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jakop ni Edom ram e Seir ram dawk a hmau Esaw koevah a hmalah patounenaw a patoun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahnimouh koe lawk a thui. Ka bawipa Esaw koe hettelah na dei awh han. Na san Jakop ni hettelah ati, Laban koe imyin lah ka o teh atu totouh ka o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maitotan hoi, la hoi tunaw hoi, hmaenaw hoi sanpa sannunaw hah ka tawn. Hatdawkvah, na minhmai kahawi ka hmu thai nahanlah ka bawipa koe dei pouh hanelah, taminaw ka patoun ati, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Patounenaw hah Jakop koe a ban awh teh, na hmau Esaw koe ka pha awh. Tami 400 touh hoi nang na dawn hanelah ahni hai a kamthaw, telah a dei pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Jakop ni a takipoung teh kângairu hoi ao. Ama koe kaawm e taminaw hoi tuhu hoi maitohu hoi kalauknaw hah hu kahni touh lah koung a kapek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jakop ni Esaw a kâhmo toteh, ahu buet touh e thet pawiteh a hu alouknaw teh ka yawngkhai thai han doeh, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hottelah Jakop ni, oe apa Abraham Cathut, apa Isak Cathut, oe BAWIPA na ram hoi na imthungnaw koe ban nateh, kaimouh ka thet hane katetnaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />na san e lathueng vah lungmanae hoi yuemkamcunae pueng na kamcu sak e thung dawk hoi, kathoengpounge patenghai hmu hanelah ka kamcu hoeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Jordan palang hah ka sonron hoi dueng ka raka teh atuteh a hu kahni touh ka pha toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pahren lahoi ka hmau Esaw e kut thung roeroe hoi na rungngang haw. Bangkongtetpawiteh, napui camonaw hoi kaimouh rekrek na saueng han doeh tie hah puenghoi ka tâsue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, nama ni, na pungdaw sak vaiteh, na ca catounnaw hah touk thai hoeh e talî dawk e sadi yit touh na pap sak han na tie hah, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hate karum teh hawvah a roe awh. Hahoi a tawn e thung dawk hoi hmae manu 200, hmaetan 20,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kalauk sanu kasu lahun e 30, a canaw khuehoi maito manu 40, maitotan 10,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />La manu 20, la a kum kanaw e 10, hetnaw hah a hmau Esaw koe poehno lah poe hanelah a pasoum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hotnaw teh a huhu lahoi aloukcalah a sannaw kut dawk a poe. Hahoi, ahnimouh koe, ka hmalah cet awh nateh, a louklouk lah rahak kaawm lahoi cet awh, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hahoi lam kahrawikung koevah, ka hmau Esaw hoi na kâhmo toteh, apie taminaw maw, na maw na cei awh han, nangmae na hmalah kaawmnaw hah apinaw maw, telah na pacei awh pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na san Jakop e naw seng doeh. Ka bawipa poe hanelah poehno na patawn e naw doeh. Khenhaw! ama hai kaimae hnuklah ao, na ti pouh awh han, telah lawk a thui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Apâhni e hoi apâthum e hoi saring kakhoumnaw pueng koe hai, Esaw na kâhmo torei teh, hot patetlah na dei awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hahoi khenhaw! na san Jakop teh kaimae hnukkhu lah ao na ti pouh awh han, telah lawk a thui. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ka hmalah ka cet e poehno ni a lungthin ahawi sak han. Hathnukkhu hoi a mei ka hmu han, telah pawiteh, a lungroum yawkaw han telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, poehno hah a hmalah a ceisak. Hatei, ama teh hote karum teh tamihunaw koe a roe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Karum vah a thaw teh a yu roi hoi a canaw hlaibun touh hah a ceikhai teh Jabbok palang hah a raka awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahnimouh hah a ceikhai teh palang hah a raka awh. A tawn e naw pueng hai a ceikhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jakop amadueng ao nah tami buet touh hoi khodai totouh a kâthe roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahni ni ka tâ mahoeh tie a panue toteh, Jakop e a sumbunghru kâcunae koe a khoe pouh. Hatdawkvah Jakop teh a khokkhem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahni ni, na cetsak leih, bangkongtetpawiteh kho hai a dai toe telah ati. Hateiteh, ahni ni yawhawi na poe hoehpawiteh, na cetsak mahoeh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahni ni na min a pimaw telah a pacei navah, Jakop telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahni ni na min Jakop teh Jakop tet mahoeh toe, Isarel ati awh han toe. Bangkongtetpawiteh Cathut hoi tami hai na the teh na tâ toe, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jakop ni pahren lahoi na min apimaw telah a pacei. Ahni ni bang kecu dawk maw ka min na pacei telah ati. Hawvah yawhawinae a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Haw e hmuen teh Jakop ni Peniel, telah ati. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Cathut teh minhmai kâhmo lahoi ka hmu teh ka hringnae hah a pâhlung telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hahoi Penuel hoi a tâco nah, kanî a tâco, Ahni teh a kamlang teh a phaihru kecu dawk a dongkhawt.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Jakop e phai hru kâcunae koe a khoe pouh dawkvah, sahnin totouh Isarel catounnaw ni phai hru kâcunae koe e tharui hah cat boi awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hahoi Jakop ni a radoung teh, khenhaw! Esaw teh tami 400 touh hoi a tho. Hahoi a canaw hah Leah hoi a sannu koe vah a ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hahoi a sannu hoi a canaw hah hma ahman, hat hnukkhu vah Leah hoi a canaw, Rachel hoi Joseph teh a hnukteng poung lah a ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama teh hma ahman teh, a hmau teng a pha toteh talai vaisari touh a tabo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hatei ama kâhmo hanelah Esaw koe a yawng teh, a kâtapam roi teh, a kâpaco roi teh, a ka roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Esaw ni a khet teh, napui hoi camonaw hah a hmu. Hahoi teh na thokhai e naw hah tami bangpatetnaw na maw, telah atipouh. Ahni ni Cathut ni na lungma teh na san a poe e camonaw nan ma aw atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A sannu hah a canaw hoi a tho teh a tabut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Leah hai a canaw hoi a tho teh a tabut. Hahoi Rachel hoi Joseph hai a tho teh a tabut rawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Esaw ni saringhu a kâhmo e naw pueng hah bangtelane, telah ati. Ahnimouh ni ka bawipa na minhmai kahawi ka hmu thai nahanelah ka sak e doeh, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hatei Esaw ni ka nawngha, moikapap ka tawn, na tawn e teh nama hane ma tat leih, atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jakop ni nahoeh bo, na minhmai kahawi ka hmawt pawiteh, pahren lahoi na poe e poehno hah na dâw pouh loe. Cathut mei hmu lah na mei ka hmu teh, kai lathueng na lung bout ahawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cathut ni na pahren teh, moi ka tawn doeh. Pahren lahoi kai ni na poe e naw hah na dâw pouh yaw kaw, telah ati. Hottelah pou a pasawt teh a dâw pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hahoi Esaw ni kamthaw awh sei. Cet awh sei, na hmalah ka cei han atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hatei Jakop ni ahni koe na camonaw heh ek a naw rah. Tuhu hoi maitohu hoi kaimouh koe kaawm e naw teh ca ka cun e naw lah ao dawkvah, ka bawipa nang ni na panue doeh. Hnin touh mah karanglah ka hrui pawiteh be a due awh han doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka bawipa, pahren lahoi na sannaw hmalah cet nateh, Seir mon dawk ka bawipa nang koe pha awh hoehroukrak, ka hmalah saring ka cet e naw, a cei thai awh e patetlah camonaw hai a cei thai awh e patetlah payai lahoi ka ceikhai han, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Esaw ni kai koe kaawm e a tangawn kangna teh, tat awh lawisei, telah ati. Hatei, ahni ni bangmaw a panki. Ka bawipa minhmai kahawi na hmawt sak leih telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hottelah, Esaw teh hat hnin vah Seir mon pâtam laihoi a ban.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jakop teh Sukoth vah a cei teh, ama hanelah im a sak teh, a saringnaw hane haiyah impui a sak pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jakop teh lungmawngcalah paddanaram ram hoi Kanaan ram e kaawm sekem khopui koe a pha teh, khopui pui hmalah rim pui hah a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hote rim a saknae hmuen teh sekem na pa Hamor capanaw koe tangka 100 touh hoi a ran e doeh, .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hawvah, khoungroe a sak teh, El Elohim Isarel telah min a phung awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leah canu Dinah Jakop e a yu ni a khe pouh e hah haw e ram dawk e tanglanaw hmu han a ngai dawkvah a pai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hiv tami, haw e siangpahrang Hamor capa Shekhem ni a hmu, a man teh a ikhai teh a min a mathoe sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hringnae teh Jakop canu Dinah koe dueng a lungthin ao, hote tangla teh a lungpatawpoung dawk lawk kahawi hoi dueng a pato.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Shekhem ni a na pa Hamor koe, hote tangla hah kai hane yu lah na paluen pouh, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jakop ni a canu Dinah hah Shekhem ni a khin sak tie hah a panue, a capanaw hah law vah saringhu hoi a i awh teh, a tho hoehroukrak teh Jakop duem ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Shekhem e a na pa Hamor teh Jakop pato hanelah a cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jakop capanaw ni a thai awh tahma vah law hoi a ban awh. Jakop canu a ikhai e hoi, Isarelnaw thungvah kayayeirai sak hane hoi, sak hoeh hane kawi yonnae a sak dawkvah, a lungmathoe awh teh a lung pueng hoi a khuek awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hateiteh, Hamor ni a pato teh ka capa Shekhem a hringnae teh na canu e lathueng dueng doeh ao, pahren lahoi a yu hanelah paluen sak leih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kâpaluen awh sei, na canunaw na paluen sak awh haw, kaimae canu hai paluen van awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kaimouh koe na o awh vaiteh ram hai moi kalen lah ao doeh. Hivah awm awh nateh hno yawt awh nateh, moikapap tawnta awh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Shekhem ni tangla e na pa hoi a thangroinaw koevah na pahren awh loe. Kai koe na dei awh e pueng na poe awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aphu hoi poehno teh na hei awh e yit touh na poe awh han. Bangtelah nakunghai tangla teh yu lah na paluen sak awh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hateiteh, Jakop capanaw ni a canu Dinah a khinsak awh dawkvah, Shekhem hoi a na pa Hamor teh dumnae lahoi bout a dei pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni ahnimanaw koe vuensom ka a hoeh e naw koe ka canu na poe thai awh mahoeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, hot hateh kaimouh hanelah min mathoenae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hateiteh, hettelah lawk na kâkam awh torei dueng doeh, nangmae lawk hah ka hnâbawt awh ti, nangmouh koe e tongpa pueng hah vuensoma awh nateh kaimanaw patetlah awm awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hat toteh, kaimae canu na paluen sak vaiteh, kaimouh ni hai nangmae canunaw hai ka paluen van awh han. Hahoi nangmouh koe ka o awh vaiteh, miphun buet touh lah o awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hateiteh, kaimae lawk na ngai awh hoeh lah, vuensom na a awh hoehpawiteh, ka canu ka la vaiteh ka cei awh han toe telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hahoi ahnimae lawk ni Hamor hoi Hamor capa Shekhem hah a lunghawi sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hottelah thoundoun ni Jakop canu hah a ngai lawi vah, hothateh moikasaw e lah pouk laipalah tang a sak, ahni teh a na pa imthungnaw thung dawkvah bari poung e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hamor hoi a capa Shekhem ni a kho kalupnae longkha koe a pha awh teh, kho thung e taminaw hoi a kâpato awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hote taminaw hoi maimouh hoi karoumcalah hoi kho a sak awh. Hatdawkvah hete ram dawk kho a sak awh vaiteh, hivah hno yawt awh naseh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahnimouh han ram akawpoung doeh. A canunaw hah yu lah paluen awh vaiteh, maimae canunaw hai yu lah paluen van awh naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hateiteh, miphun buet touh lah o awh thai nahan, hettelah lawkkam awh torei dueng doeh ahnimouh ni hnâ na bo khai hanelah ao, vuensom ka a awh e patetlah mamouh thung e tongpa pueng hai vuensoma awh sei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahnimae saringnaw, hnopainaw hoi a tawnta e naw pueng teh, maimae lah be kaawm han nahoehmaw. Ahnimae lawk teh hnâbawtkhai awh sei. Hottelah hoi maimouh koe kho a sak awh han telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hamor hoi a capa Shekhem ni a dei e hah kalupnae rapan koe kâen ka tâcawt e pueng ni a hnâbokhai awh teh, longkha koe kâen ka tâcawt e tongpa pueng teh vuensom koung a a sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hahoi hettelah doeh. A apâthum hnin a pataw poungnae dawk Jakop capanaw thung hoi kahni touh e, Dinah e a thangroi Simeon hoi Levih ni amamouh roi e tahloi a sin roi teh arulahoi khopui a tuk roi teh tongpa pueng he a thei roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hamor hoi a capa Shekhem hai tahloi hoi a thei awh. Shekhem im dawk e Dinah hah a tâcokhai awh teh a cei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jakop capanaw ni a thei awh e naw koe a pha awh van teh, a tawncanu a kamhnawng sin dawkvah khopui teh a raphoe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A tuhunaw, maitohunaw, lahunaw hoi amamouh kho e kaawm e hnopainaw hah a la pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A hnopainaw, a canaw hoi a yunaw imthungkhu kaawm e pueng hah he a lawp awh teh be a raphoe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jakop ni Simeon hoi Levih koevah nangmanaw ni hete ram dawk e taminaw hoi Kanaannaw hoi Periznaw kecu dawkvah, kai heh min mathoenae na phu sak teh, lung na mathoe sak. Kai ka younca navah kai taranlahoi kamkhueng awh vaiteh, kai hoi ka imthungnaw hah na thet awh vaiteh, he na pahma awh han doeh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hateiteh, ahnimouh ni kaimae tawncanu heh, kâyawt e napui patetlah a sak han na maw telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cathut ni Jakop koevah, thaw nateh Bethel kho vah cet nateh hawvah awm, na hmau Esaw koehoi na yawng nah nang koe ka kamnuek e Cathut hanelah thuengnae khoungroe hah sak telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jakop ni a imthung hoi ama koe kaawm e tami pueng koe, nangmouh koe Jentelnaw e cathut kaawm e hah tâkhawng awh, kamthoung awh, na khohna hah kâthung awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bethel vah luen awh sei. Rucatnae kâhmo awh lahun navah, na pathung teh ka cei nah tangkuem koevah, na ka awmkhaikung Cathut hanelah khoungroe ka sak han ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hottelah hoi miphun alouke cathutnaw e a kut dawk e kaawm e pueng hoi a hnânaw dawk a pacap awh e naw hah Jakop a poe awh. Jakop ni Shekhem teng e kathen kung rahim vah a hro awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A cei awh teh, Cathut takinae hah a tengpam e khonaw pueng dawk ao teh Jakop capa hah pâlei awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jakop teh ama koe kaawm e naw pueng hoi Kanaan ram Luz vah a pha awh (Luz teh Bethel doeh).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hawvah khoungroe a sak teh, haw e hmuen teh El Bethel telah ati. Bangkongtetpawiteh a hmau koehoi a yawng lahun navah hawvah ahni koe Cathut a kamnue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Rebekah ka awmkhaikung Deborah hah a due teh, khoungroe rahim e bengkengkung rahim vah a pakawp awh. Hottelah hoi hote bengkeng e a min teh Allon Bakuth telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jakop teh Padam Aram ram lahoi a ban toteh, ahni koe Cathut bout a kamnue teh yawhawi a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cathut ni ahni koe na min teh Jakop eiteh, na min teh Jakop telah tet awh mahoeh toe, na min teh Isarel ti han toe telah ati. Hottelah hoi a min hah Isarel telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hahoi Cathut ni ahni koevah, kai teh Athakasaipounge Cathut lah ka o. Canaw pungdaw nateh, nange miphun dawk hoi siangpahrangnaw a tâco han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Abraham hoi Isak koevah, ka poe e ram heh nang na poe, na catounnaw totouh ka poe telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hattoteh Cathut ni ahni a patonae hmuen koehoi Jakop teh a luen takhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A patonae hmuen koe Jakop ni talung a ung. A ung e teh talung doeh. A lathueng vah nei thuengnae hah a awi teh, satui hai a van vah a awi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cathut ni a patonae hmuen hah Bethel telah min a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bethel hoi a cei awh teh, Ephrath a pha awh nahanelah ahlapoung. Rachel camo o hane a pataw teh pueng hoi patawnae a khang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hahoi, hettelah doeh. A patawnae a khang lahun nah camo kaawm sak e ni taket hanh ca tongpa alouke na khe han dawk doeh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hahoi, a muitha a tâco tawmlei vah, a min hah Benoni ati teh, a na pa ni Benjamin telah a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Rachel a due teh Epharath ceinae lamthung dawk a pakawp awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A tangkom van vah Jakop ni talung a ung teh, hothateh nout nahanelah Rachel pakawpnae tangkom lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Isarel teh pou bout a cei teh, Mikdaleder imrasang hloilah rim a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hahoi, Isarel teh haw e ram dawk ao lahun navah, Reuben ni a na pa e ado Bilhah a ikhai e hah Isarel ni a thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jakop capanaw teh 12 touh a pha awh. Leah capanaw thung dawk Reuben teh Jakop e camin la ao teh Simeon, Levih, Judah, Issakhar hoi Zebulun tinaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rachel capanaw teh Joseph hoi Benjamin doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rachel e a san Bilhah capanaw teh Dan hoi Naphtali doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Leah e sannu Zilpah canaw teh Gad hoi Asher doeh. Hetnaw teh Paddanaram Jakop ni khe e ca tongpanaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jakop ni Mamre Kiriatharba (Hebron) e a na pa Isak hoi Abraham onae koe a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Isak a hringyung teh kum 180 touh a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Isak ni hnukteng a kâha a phout teh a hnin pakhit lahoi a due. A due toteh a huikonaw koe pakawp e lah ao van teh a capa Esaw hoi Jakop ni a pakawp roi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hetnaw heh Esaw (Edom doeh) e catounnaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Esaw ni Kanaan napui thung dawk e, Hit tami Elon canu Adah hoi Hit tami Zibeon e canu Anah canu Oholibamah hoi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ishmael canu Basemath, Nebaioth tawncanu hah a yu lah a la.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Adah ni Esaw teh, Eliphaz a khe pouh teh, Basemath ni Reuel hah a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Oholibamah ni hai Jeush, Jalam, hoi Korah hah a khe. Hotnaw teh Esaw capanaw, Kanaan kho vah a khe e naw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Esaw ni a yu, a ca tongpanaw napuinaw, a im dawk kaawm e pueng, Kanaan kho vah a hmu e hnopai pueng hah a ceikhai teh, a nawngha Jakop koehoi a tâco teh ram buet touh koe a cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, a tawn e hno moi apap dawkvah, cungtalah awm thai awh hoeh toe. A saringnaw kecu dawk imyin lah onae ni cawng awh hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hottelah Esaw teh Seir mon dawk kho a sak. Esaw teh Edom doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hetnaw heh Seir mon e Edomnaw kakhekung Esaw catounnaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hetnaw heh Esaw catounnaw doeh, a yu Adah capa Eliphaz, a yu Basemath capa Reuel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Eliphaz capanaw teh Teman, Omar, Zepho, Gatam hoi Kenaz tinaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Timna teh Esaw capa Eliphaz e a yudo lah ao teh, Eliphaz hanlah Amalek a sak pouh. Hotnaw teh Esaw e yu Adah capanaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hahoi, Reuel capanaw teh Nahath, Zerah, Shammah, Mizzah lah ao awh teh, Esaw yu Basemath capanaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Esaw yu, Zibeon canu Anah canu Oholibamah capanaw lah ao awh teh, Esaw hanelah Jeush, Jalam, Korah a sak pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Esaw catounnaw thung dawk khobawinaw teh, Esaw e camin Eliphaz capa, khobawi Teman, khobawi Omar, khobawi Zepho, khobawi Kenaz,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />khobawi Korah, khobawi Gatam, khobawi Amalek tinaw lah ao awh teh, ahnimanaw teh Edom kho e Eliphaz koehoi khe e khobawinaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hetnaw teh Esaw capa Reuel capanaw doeh. Khobawi Nahath, khobawi Zerah, khobawi Shammah, khobawi Mizzah tinaw lah ao awh teh, ahnimanaw teh Edom kho e Esaw yu Basemath capa Reuel e khobawinaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Esaw yu Oholibamah e capanaw hai khobawi Jeush, khobawi Jalam, khobawi Korah tinaw ao awh teh, ahnimanaw teh Esaw yu, Anah canu, Oholibamah capanaw khobawinaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hetnaw heh Edom tie Esaw capa khobawinaw doeh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hetnaw teh Hor tami Seir capa, hote ram dawk kaawmnaw doeh. Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Dishon, Ezer, Dishan tinaw teh Edom ram e Seir capa Hor koehoi ka khe e khobawinaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lotan capa teh Hor hoi Heman lah ao teh, Timna teh Lotan e a tawncanu doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Shobal capanaw teh Alvan, Manahath, Ebal, Shepho, Onam doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zibeon capanaw teh Aiah hoi Anah doeh, Anah teh a na pa Zibeon e la a khoum navah kahrawng e tuikhu kahmawtkung doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Anah capanaw teh Dishon hoi Anah canu Oholibamah tinaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hahoi Dishon capanaw teh Hemdan, Eshban, Ithran hoi Keran doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ezer capanaw teh Bilhan, Zaavan hoi Akan doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Dishan capanaw teh Uz hoi Aran doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khobawinaw lah khobawi Lotan, khobawi Shobal, khobawi Zibeon, khobawi Anah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />khobawi Dishon, khobawi Ezer, khobawi Dishan lah ao awh teh, ahnimanaw teh Seir kho vah khobawi lah kaawm khobawinaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hetnaw teh siangpahrang ni Isarel miphun a uk hoehnahlan e Edom siangpahrangnaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Beor capa Bela ni Edom vah siangpahrang a tawk navah, khopui min teh Dinnabah doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bela a due hnukkhu, Bozrah tami Zerah capa Jobab ni a yueng lah a uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jobab a due hnukkhu, Teman kho e Husham ni a uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Husham a due hnukkhu, Bedad capa Hadad, Moab law vah Midiannaw kathetkung ni a yueng lah a uk, a khopui min te Avith doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hadad a due hnukkhu, ahni yueng lah Masrekah tami Samlah ni a uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Samlah a due hnukkhu, ahni yueng lah, tui teng Rehoboth tami Saul ni a uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Saul a due hnukkhu, ahni yueng lah Akbor capa Baalhanan ni a yueng lah a uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Akbor capa Baalhanan a due hnukkhu, ahni yueng lah Hadad ni a uk. Hatnavah khopui min teh Pau doeh. Hahoi, a yu min teh Mehetabel, Mezahab canu Matred canu doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hahoi hetnaw heh a imthung hoi amamouh hoi, min paruinae patetlah Esaw capa khobawinaw e minnaw teh: khobawi Timna, khobawi Alvah, khobawi Jetheth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />khobawi Oholibamah, khobawi Elah, khobawi Pinon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />khobawi Kenaz, khobawi Teman, khobawi Mibzar,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />khobawi Magdiel, khobawi Iram doeh. Hetnaw teh a tawn awh e ram dawkvah, a khosaknae lahoi Edom catoun khobawinaw doeh. Esaw teh Edom miphun kakhekung doeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakop teh a na pa imyin lah a onae Kanaan ram dawk kho a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hethateh Jakop catoun e lairui doeh. Joseph teh a kum 17 touh a pha nah a hmaunaw hoi saringnaw a khoum awh. Ahni teh a camo rah dawkvah, a na pa e yu Bilhah hoi Zilpah capanaw koevah ao, hahoi Joseph ni hnokahawi hoeh a sak awh e kamthang kathout hah a na pa koe ouk a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Isarel ni Joseph teh a matawng nah a khe e lah ao dawkvah, a canaw pueng hlak a lungpataw hnawn, angkidung a phun aloukcalah a khui pouh teh a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A na pa ni a hmaunaw hlak a lungpataw hnawn tie hah a panue awh. Hottelah hoi ahni teh, hmawt ngai awh hoeh. Lawk kahawi hoi hai pato ngai awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Joseph ni mang a sak teh a hmaunaw koe a dei pouh dawkvah, hoe hmawt ngai awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahni ni ahnimanaw koe pahren lahoi mang ka sak e hah thai awh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Law vah cabong hah a thaw awh teh kaie cabong hai a thaw teh a kangdue. Hahoi thai awh haw, nangmae cabongnaw ni a kalup awh teh, kaie cabong hah a bawk awh, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A hmaunaw ni ahni koevah, nang ni kaimouh na uk katang han na maw. Nang heh kaimae lathueng vah kâ na tawn han na maw, telah atipouh awh. Hottelah hoi a mang hoi a dei e lawk kecu dawkvah, hoe a hmuhma awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hahoi mang alouke e bout a sak teh, a hmaunaw koevah bout a dei pouh. Thai awh haw, mang bout ka tawn. Kanî hoi thapa hoi âsinaw 12 touh ka hmalah be a tabut awh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A na pa hoi a hmaunaw koe a dei pouh navah, a na pa ni a yue teh, mang na sak e teh bangpatete mang han na maw. Kai hoi na manu hoi na hmaunaw ni na hmalah ka tabut han na maw telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A hmaunaw ni ahni teh a ut awh. Hateiteh, a na pa ni hno kaawm e hah a lung dawk a pâkuem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hmaunaw teh Shekhem vah a na pa e saring khoum hanelah a cei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Isarel ni Joseph koevah na hmaunaw ni Shekhem doeh saring a khoum awh khe, tho haw, ahnimouh koe na patoun han telah ati. Ahni ni na patoun yawkaw telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A na pa ni ahnimouh koe cet nateh na hmaunaw hah a dam awh maw, saringnaw a dam maw, panue hanelah kamthaw haw, haw e kamthang kai koe bout na dei pouh han telah ati. Hottelah hoi Hebron tanghling koehoi a patoun teh Shekhem vah a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Law dawk voutsout a kâhlai e hah tami buet touh ni a hmu teh ahni ni, bangmaw na tawng telah a pacei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahni ni, ka hmaunaw doeh ka tawng pahren lahoi saringhu a khoumnae na dei pouh haw telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahni ni hote hmuen koehoi yo a cei awh toe. Dothan vah cet sei ati awh e hah ka thai, telah ati. Hottelah hoi Joseph ni a hmaunaw teh a pâlei teh Dothan vah a hmaunaw a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni ahlapoungnae koehoi a hmu awh teh, ahni koe a pha hoehnahlan vah, ahni thei nahane lah a kâdei awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thai awh haw, mang ka sak e tami a tho toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tho awh thei awh vaiteh, moimatheng ni a kei telah tet pouh awh sei. Hahoi a mangnaw teh bangne tie hah panue awh han telah buet touh hoi buet touh lengkaleng a kâti awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hateiteh, Reuben ni a thai teh ahnimae kut dawk hoi a rungngang teh, thet lah thet awh hanh sei, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hateiteh, Reuben ni a kut thung hoi a rungngang teh a na pa koe a bankhai thai nahan, thet awh hanh, kahrawng e tangkom thung pabawt awh nateh na kut teh tha awh hanh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Joseph ni a hmaunaw koe a pha toteh, angkidung em kaawm e hah a rading pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A ceikhai awh teh tangkom dawk a pabo awh. Tangkom dawk tui awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hottelah rawca ca hanelah, a tahung awh. Hahoi a radoung awh teh, Ishmael kahlawng ka cet e Gilead ram lahoi amamae kalauk hoi hmuitui hoi, thing tapi, murah phu e hoi Izip ram lah cei hanelah kamthawnaw hah a tho awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Judah ni a hmaunawnghanaw koe maimae nawngha thei awh teh, a thipalawng e paphat awh pawiteh, bangmaw cungkeinae kaawm han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tho awh, a lathueng kut tha laipalah Ishmaelnaw koe yawt awh sei. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahni teh nawngha maimae misa hoi kâkuen e doeh, telah ati teh, a hmaunawnghanaw ni a hnâ rip a bo khai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hottelah hoi Midian hno kayawtnaw teh a tho awh teh, Joseph teh tangkom dawk hoi a rasa awh teh, Ishmaelnaw koe tangka 20 touh lah a yo awh. Hahoi Joseph teh Izip ram lah a ceikhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hottelah hoi Reuben teh tangkom koe a tho teh, khenhaw! Joseph teh tangkom thung la awm hoeh toe, hat toteh a khohna hah a ravei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hahoi a hmaunawnghanaw koe a cei teh, camo awm hoeh toe. Kai teh na lane ka cei han toung telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Joseph e angkidung hah a la awh teh hmaetan a thei awh teh a thi dawk a ranup awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Em la e angkidung hah a patawn awh teh, a na pa koe a poe awh. Hethateh ka hmu awh e doeh. Na capa e angkidung na ou, khenhaw! hottelah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A na pa ni a nout teh, ka capa e angkidung doeh. Moimatheng buetbuet touh ni a kei toung hah tayaw. Joseph hah vekrasen lah a hruek toe telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hottelah hoi Jakop teh a khohna a ravei teh, buri a kâkhu laihoi a hnin moikasaw lah a capa hah a khui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A capanaw pueng hoi a canunaw pueng hah ahni a lungpahawi hanelah a thaw awh, hateiteh, a na pa ni a lungpahawinae ngai pouh hoeh. Khui nalaihoi phuen koe ka capa koevah ka cei han toe telah ati. Hottelah hoi a na pa teh ahni a pouk lawi a khui a ka.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Midiannaw ni Joseph teh Izip ram dawk a kâenkhai awh teh, Faro kut rahim e imkaringkung Potiphar koevah a yo awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hatnae tueng dawkvah, Judah teh a hmaunawngha koehoi a cei teh, Adullam tami Hirah koevah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judah ni haw vah, Kanaan tami Shua canu hah a hmu. Ahni hah a paluen teh a ikhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Camo a vawn teh ca tongpa a khe. Judah ni a min lah Er a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Camo bout a vawn teh ca tongpa bout a khe. A manu ni a min lah Onan telah a phung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ca tongpa alouke bout a khe teh, a min lah Shelah telah a phung. Hote ca tongpa a khe lahun navah, Judah teh Kezib vah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Judah ni a camin Er hah a yu a paluen pouh teh, a min teh Tamar doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hateiteh, Judah e camin teh BAWIPA e mithmu vah tamikathout lah ao dawkvah, BAWIPA ni ahni teh a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah ni Onan koevah, na hmau e yu hah ipkhai nateh, na hmau e cati hah pout hoeh nahanlah sak pouh, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Onan ni a canaw hah mae ca lah awm mahoeh tie a panue dawkvah, a hmau e a yu a ikhai navah, a ca khe hoeh nahanlah alawilah atui yout a tâco sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A sak e hno ni BAWIPA a lunghawi sak hoeh dawkvah, Onan hai a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Judah ni a langa Tamar koevah, ka capa Shelah heh a cue hoehroukrak na pa im dawk lahmai lah awm ei, telah hoehpawiteh, ahni hai a hmaunaw patetlah a due payon han doeh telah ati. Tamar ni a cei teh a na pa im vah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Atueng moi a ro hnukkhu, Judah e yu Shua canu teh a due. Judah teh a lungpahawi hnukkhu, Timnah kho dawk e tumuen kangawnaw koe vah, amae a hui Adullam tami Hirah hoi reirei a ceitakhang roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A langa Tarmar koevah, na pa teh tu muen ngaw hanelah Timnah vah cei hane a kâcai telah a dei pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahni ni a lahmainae hni hah a rading teh, a minhmai a ramuknae hoi a kâramuk, a tak a kâyo teh Timnah kho longkha koelah a tahung. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Shelah teh a cue eiteh, a na pa ni a yu lah paluen pouh ngai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Judah ni a hmu toteh, a minhmai a kâramuk dawkvah, kâyawt e lah a pouk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hottelah hoi lam teng e napui a onae hah a pâtam teh, tho haw pahren lahoi rei ip roi sei telah ati. Bangkongtetpawiteh, a langa tie panuek hoeh. Napui ni na ipkhai pawiteh bangmaw na poe han telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahni ni saringhu thung e hmaeca na patawn han telah ati, Hottelah hoi napui ni hot hah na patawn hoehnahlan vah na pâhung hane kawi na poe han na ou, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahni ni bangmaw ka hung han telah telah ati. Napui ni na min na thutnae, arui hoi na sin e na sonron telah ati. Hottelah hoi a poe teh a ikhai, ahni teh camo a vawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A thaw teh a minhmai ramuknae a hawng teh a lahmainae khohna hah bout a kho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Judah teh napui koe hung e hno hah a ratang hanelah a hui Adullam koe vah hmaeca hah a patawn. Hateiteh, ahni ni napui hah hmawt hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hottelah hoi haw e hmuen koe kaawm e taminaw koe lam teng e Enaim tak ka kâyawt e napui hah nâmaw ao telah a pacei, ahnimouh ni hie hmuen koe tak ka kâyawt e awm hoeh telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Judah koe a ban teh, ahni teh ka hmawt thai hoeh. Haw e Taminaw ni hie hmuen dawk tak ka kâyawt e awm boihoeh telah ati awh, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Judah ni lat awh yawkaw naseh, hottelah hoehpawiteh, yeiraipo payon vaih, khenhaw! hmaeca heh na patawn ei, ama na hmawt ka lawn hoeh, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thapa yung pâthum hnukkhu vah ahnimouh ni Judah koe na langa Tamar teh kâyo hloilah cata a phu telah a dei pouh awh. Judah ni alawilah tâcawtkhai awh nateh hmaisawi e lah awm naseh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A tâcokhai awh lahun navah, Tamar ni hete hno katawnkung koe hoi nahoehmaw camo ka vawn telah a na pa koe Tami a patoun. Napui ni vah pahren lahoi hete min thutnae hoi arui hoi sonronnaw heh, apie ne, kahawicalah khenhaw! telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Judah ni vah, hnopainaw teh amae lah ao tie a panue teh, ahni teh kai hlak atanghnawn toe. Bangkongtetpawiteh ka capa Shelah hane a yu lah ka lat pouh kalawn hoeh toe telah ati. Hahoi Judah ni ahni teh bout ipkhai hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hahoi a vawn a pataw lahun navah, camo im dawk camo samphei roi e ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Camo a khe navah, capa buet touh ni a kut a tâco sak. Camo ka khesakkung ni hetheh a hmaloe ka khe e telah a kut dawk a kuet teh hlangpawi a yeng pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A kut hah bout a kâhno torei teh, pouk laipalah a nawngha hah a khe. Camo ka khe sak e naw ni, bangkongmaw khe na hanelah namahoima na sak, telah ati awh. Hatdawkvah, a min lah Perez telah a phung awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hathnukkhu a hmau e a kut dawk hlangpawi yeng e a khe teh a min lah Zerah telah a phung.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joseph teh Ishmael taminaw koe Izip ram a thokhai awh teh, Izip siangpahrang Faro kut rahim imkaringkung lah kaawm e Potiphar ni a ran.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />BAWIPA teh Joseph koe ao teh, ahni teh a lam ka cawn e tami lah ao teh Izip tami a bawipa im vah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A bawipa ni BAWIPA teh ahni koe a o, a hnosak tangkuem dawk a lamcawn tie hah a panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Joseph teh a bawipa e a lungyouk lah thaw ouk a tawk. A bawipa ni a imkaringkung kacue lah a ta teh, a tawn e hnonaw pueng ahnie kâtawnnae rahim koung a ta pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hahoi, imkaringkung lah a ta hnukkhu, BAWIPA ni Joseph pawlawk hoi Izip imthungkhu hah yawhawi a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A tawn e pueng hah Joseph kut dawk be a ta pouh teh, a ca e vaiyei hloilah teh ahni koe kaawm e hnonaw pueng hah be a poe. Joseph teh a tungtang kahawi e lah ao teh a mei hai a hawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, a bawipa e yu ni Joseph hah a noe teh, na ipkhai leih ti hoi pou a pasawt.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hatei ngai pouh hoeh. A bawipa e yu koevah, khenhaw! ka bawipa ni hete im dawkvah, bang hno maw kaawm tie panuek hoeh, a tawn e naw pueng ka kut dawk koung a ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hete im dawk kai hlak ka len e apihai awm hoeh. A yu na tho patetlah nang hloilah kai hane a pasoung hoeh e banghai awm hoeh. Hatdawkvah, hethloilah kalen e thoenae hoi yonnae heh Cathut taranlahoi bangtelamaw khuet ka sak han vaw, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hahoi, hnin touh hnukkhu hnin touh, Joseph hah a pasawt nakunghai a ikhai hane teh ngai pouh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hatei, a hnin hnin touh teh, Joseph imthungkhu thaw tawk hanelah a kâen teh, hatnae tueng dawk imthungkhu tami buet touh hai la awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hahoi teh, napui ni na ipkhai leih telah a angki dawk a kuet pouh teh, a kut dawk angki pak rading teh alawilah a yawng takhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hahoi teh, a angki a kut dawk pak a rading teh a yawng takhai tie a panue toteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a im kaawmnaw hah a kaw teh, khenhaw! kai na kaya sak hanelah hete Hebru tami ni kai na yonkhai hanelah imthungkhu na kâen sin teh thayung hoi ka hram pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hahoi, ka lawk hoi thayung hoi ka hram toteh, kama koe a angki pak a rading teh a yawng takhai telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A bawipa a tho hoehroukrak a hnicu teh ama koevah pou a hruek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hahoi teh a vâ koe telah a dei pouh. Hete Hebru tami san kai koe na thokhai e heh, yeiraipo sak hanelah hoi kai koe na kâen sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hahoi, lawk hoi tha hoi ka hram tahma vah, a khohna a yawng takhai telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hahoi, a bawipa koe na san ni hettelah na sak tie a yu ni a dei e lawk hah a thai toteh a lungkhuek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hottelah a bawipa ni Joseph a ceikhai teh thongim siangpahrang ni tami khik katek hoi ouk tanae thongim thung a paung awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hateiteh, BAWIPA teh Joseph koe ao teh, a lathueng vah lungmanae a tawn teh thongim ka ring e hmalah minhmai kahawi a hmu sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hahoi teh, thongim karingkung ni thongkabawtnaw pueng hah Joseph kut dawk koung a ta teh, haw e sak e naw teh Joseph e tawk sak e lah koung a coung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />BAWIPA teh ahni koe ao teh, a lamcawn sak dawkvah, thongim karingkung ni Joseph e kâtawnnae rahim kaawmnaw pueng hah banghai khen awh hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hathnukkhu hoi teh, Izip siangpahrang misur kapoekung hoi vaiyei kasakkung roi teh Izip siangpahrang koe lungyouk hoeh e lah ao roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Faro teh a sannaw kahrawikung kacue kahni touh, misur kapoekung kacue hoi vaiyei kasakkungnaw dawk kacuepoung koe a lungphuen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hottelah ama karingkung Joseph a bonae thongim koe a pabo awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Im karingkung kacue ni ahnimouh teh Joseph kut dawk hnin moikasaw lah a poe teh thaw a tawk roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thongim thung katek laihoi kaawm roi e Izip siangpahrang misur kapoekung hoi vaiyei kasakkung roi teh tangmin buet touh dawk mang alouklouke reirei a sak roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A tangtho vah Joseph teh ahnimouh koe a kâen van teh, a kâhmo, hahoi a khet navah a minhmai a mathoe roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hottelah Faro e im karingkung bawipa im e thongim ka bawt e tami koevah, bangkongmaw sahnin na minhmai a mathoe roi telah a pacei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahnimouh roi ni mang ka sak roi, ka deicaikung apihai awm hoeh telah ati roi. Joseph ni ahni koe mang dei thainae teh Cathut e nahoehmaw. Pahren lahoi na dei pouh haw atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hottelah misur kapoenaw kahrawikung ni a mang teh Joseph koe a dei pouh. Ahni koe ka mang lavah khenhaw! ka hmalah misurkung a la o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Misurkung dawkvah a cakang kathum touh ao. Ka dawn e patetlah ao teh, a peinaw hah a pei. Hote a peinaw ni ka hmin e misur paw a tâco sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hahoi Faro manang hah ka kut dawk ao teh, misur paw hah ka khi. Faro e manang dawk kasu teh manang hah Faro kut dawk ka poe telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Joseph ni ahni koe hettelah han doeh. A cakang kathum touh e teh, hnin thum touh doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hnin thum touh thung Faro ni na tawm takhang vaiteh, na tawk e thaw hah bout na tawk sak han. Hottelah misur kapoekung lah na o navah, ouk na poe e patetlah Faro manang hah a kut dawk bout na poe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hatei, onae hmuen kahawi dawk na pha navah, kai na pahnim hanh lah a. Pahren lahoi na pahrennae hah kai koehai kamnuek sak. Faro koe kaie konglam na dei pouh van lah a, hete im dawk hoi na tâcawt sak van loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangtelah tetpawiteh, Hebru taminaw e ram thung hoi tami ni arulahoi na paru awh e doeh. Hete ram thung dawk hoi thongim thung a thung patuen lah bo nahan hai banghai ka sak hoeh ei nan heh ma telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vaiyei ka sak e ni hete deicainae hah ahawi tie a panue toteh, Joseph koevah, kai hai mang ka sak van. Khenhaw! ka lû dawk ka pangaw e takho yung thum touh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Avanlah kabang e takho dawk, Faro hanlah kahawi e vaiyei phunkuep ao. Hahoi ka lû dawk ka thueng e takho dawk e vaiyei hah tava ni a la ca telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Joseph ni, takho yung thum touh teh hnin thum touh doeh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hnin thum touh thung Faro ni na lû tâtueng vaiteh, thing dawk bang e lah na o han. Hahoi tavanaw ni na moi hah a ca han telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hahoi, apâthum hnin Faro khenae hnin a pha toteh, ahni ni a sannaw pueng hanelah buvennae pawi a sak pouh. Hahoi misur kapoekung hoi vaiyei kasakkung naw e lû teh, a tawmrasang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Joseph ni ahnimouh koe a deicai pouh e patetlah misur kapoekung teh amae tawk tangcoung e misur hah bout a poe teh, Faro kut dawk manang hai bout a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Vaiyei kasakkung teh thing dawk a vo awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hatei, misurtui kapoenaw kahrawikung ni Joseph hah panuek laipalah yout a pahnim.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum hni touh a loum hnukkhu, Faro ni mang a sak teh, thaihaw, palang rai vah a kangdue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A meikahawi ni teh kathâw e maitomanu hah tui thung hoi a tâco teh pho um vah apa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hahoi khenhaw! maitomanu sari touh, a meikahawi hoeh ni teh kamsoe e hah tui thung hoi a tâco van teh palang rai vah kangdout e maitomanu teng vah a kangdue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maitomanunaw a meikahawihoeh ni teh kamsoe e naw ni a meikahawi ni teh kathâw e naw hah koung a ca awh. Hahoi teh Faro teh vak a kâhlaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hahoi bout a i teh mang bout a sak. Khenhaw! cakung buet touh dawk kahawi ni teh kalen e cavui sari touh a tâco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hahoi khenhaw! kathoengca ni teh Kanîtholae kahlî ni remke lah a hmang e cavui sari touh bout a tâco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cavui kathoengcae sari touh ni, cavui kalen ni teh kahawi e sari touh hah koung a payawp awh. Faro vak a kâhlaw teh khenhaw! mang lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tangtho torei, a muitha a lungpuen teh tami a patoun. Izip ram e mitpaleikathoumnaw hoi tami lungang pueng a kaw teh Faro ni a mang hah a dei pouh. Hahoi Faro hanelah ka deicai thai e buet touh boehai awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hatnavah misurtui kapoenaw kaukkung ni Faro koevah, sahnin ka yonnae ka kâpanue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A sannaw koevah, Faro a lungkhuek teh karingkungnaw kaukkung im vah kai hoi vaiyei kasakkungnaw kaukkung thongim ka bo roi navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />mang reirei ka sak roi. Kaimouh roi e mang hah deingainae kâvan hoeh e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hawvah kaimouh karingkung e san Hebru tami buet touh ao teh mang hah ka dei pouh roi. Ahni ni mang heh a deicai teh ka mang roi e patetlah a deicai van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A deicai e patetlah mang teh reirei a tâco van. Kai teh thaw bout tawk sak lah ka o teh, ahni teh kai thi sak e lah ao telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hat toteh, Faro ni Joseph hah tang a kaw sak. Ka rang poung lah thongim thung a thung patuen dawk e a rasa awh teh, a pâkhamuen a ngaw hnukkhu a khohna a kâthung teh Faro koe a kâen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Faro ni Joseph koe mang ka sak teh ka deicaikung apihai awm hoeh. Hatei nang ni mang heh na thaipanuek teh, na deicai thai telah ayânaw ni dei e hah ka thai telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Joseph ni Faro koe hot teh kai koe awm hoeh. Cathut ni Faro koe roumnae lahoi a deicai han doeh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Faro ni Joseph koe ka mang lavah khenhaw! palang rai ka kangdue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hahoi khenhaw! maitomanu a meikahawi ni teh kathâw e sari touh tuithung hoi a tâco teh pho um vah a pâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hahoi alouke maitomanu a meikamathout niteh, ka kamsoe e hot patet e meimathout teh Izip ram pueng dawk patenghai ka hmu boihoeh e hah a tâco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hahoi a mei kathout ni teh ka kamsoe e maitomanunaw ni kathâw e maitomanunaw hah koung a ca awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Koung a ca awh hnukkhu patenghai yah apinihai a ca awh tie panuek kalawn hoeh. A ca awh hoehnahlan e patetlah a mei a mathoe awh mingming, hahoi vak ka kâhlaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hahoi ka mang lavah khenhaw! Cakung buet touh dawkvah, cavui kahawipoung e sari touh a tâco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hahoi khenhaw! cavui sari touh kamyai ni teh kathoengcae, Kanîtholae kahlî ni remke lah a hmang e a tâco e hah bout ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cavui kathoutnaw ni cavui kahawinaw sari touh hah koung a ca awh. Hote mang hah mitpaleikathoumnaw ka dei pouh ei, apinihai deicai thai awh hoeh, telah a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Joseph ni Faro koe Faro nange mang heh buet touh doeh. Cathut ni a sak hane hah Faro koe na panue sak e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Meikahawi e maitomanu sari touh teh kum sari touh doeh. Kahawi e cavui sari touh hai kum sari touh doeh. Mang teh buet touh doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hahoi a hnukkhu vah ka tâcawt e a mei kathout ni teh ka kamsoe e maitomanu sari touh hai kum sari touh doeh. Cavui sari touh Kanîtholae kahlî ni remke lah a hmang e hai kum sari touh doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hetheh, Faro koe ka dei e Cathut ni a sak hane Faro a panue sak e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Izip ram vah khobunae kum sari touh ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hatei, hat hnukkhu takangnae kum sari touh bout ao han. Hottelah takang ni ram teh voutthoup lah ao sak han dawkvah, khobunae kum pueng hah Izip ram teh pahnim e lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Rek ka tho e takang teh puenghoi a pataw han dawkvah, khobunae kum hah pahnim lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hahoi mang vai hni totouh Faro a mangsaknae teh hete hno kecu dawk doeh. Sak hane teh Cathut ni a caksak teh Cathut roeroe ni karanglah a pha sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Faro ni tami buet touh a lungkaang e hoi kho ka pouk thai e tawng nateh Izip ram vah kahrawikung lah awm sak naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Faro ni hotheh sak naseh, ram thung vah Izip ram cakang hah pung panga pung touh pâtung naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni khobu kum cakang pung hah pâkhueng vaiteh Faro kâtawnnae rahim vah o hanelah kho tangkuem hmalah ca hane pâtung naseh, khenyawn awh naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hottelah takang kecu dawk ram a rawk hoeh nahanlah, takangnae kum kum sari touh Izip ram ka phat hane dawkvah, kâhruetcuet lah ao han, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hottelah pouknae a poe e hah, Faro hoi a sannaw pueng ni ahawi rip ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hottelah Faro ni a sannaw koe het patet e Cathut Muitha onae tami heh hmu thai awh han na ou telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Faro ni Joseph koe Cathut ni hote hnonaw pueng hah na panue sak dawkvah, nang patetlae tami lungkaang hoi hno kaawm hane oang ka panuek e awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nang teh kaie imthung karingkung lah na o han, ka taminaw pueng hah nange kâ lahoi ao awh han, bawitungkhung dueng hah nang hlak kai bet ka lenhnawn han telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Faro ni Joseph koe khenhaw! Izip ram pueng dawk kahrawikung lah na ta toe telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Faro ni kutnoutthutnae kuthrawt hah a rading teh, Joseph kut dawk a buet pouh, hni loukloukkaang e hoi sak e hah a kâkhu sak teh a lahuen dawk sui dingyin hah a awi sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A tawn e leng kahni touh dawk a kâcui sak teh, a hmalah tabut awh, telah a hram awh. Hottelah Izip ram thung kahrawikung lah a coung sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Faro ni Joseph koevah, kai teh Faro doeh, nange kâpoe laipalah Izip ram thung pueng a kut hai thoseh, a khok hai thoseh, dâw thai mahoeh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Faro ni Joseph hah Zaphnath-Paaneah telah min a poe. On kho e vaihma Potiphar canu Asenath hah a yu lah a paluen pouh awh. Hahoi Joseph teh Izip ram kaukkung lah ahni koehoi a cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Joseph teh Izip siangpahrang Faro hmalah a kangdue navah, kum 30 touh doeh Joseph teh Faro koehoi a tâco teh Izip ram pueng dawk a cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Khobu kum kum sari touh thung talai ni puenghoi a pawhik a tâco sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Izip ram e khobu kum kum sari touh thung e cakang pueng hah a pâkhueng teh kho tangkuem tengpam e cakang hah a hmouk sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Joseph ni cakang hah talî teng e sadi patetlah kapappoung lah a pâtung, touk patenghai touk ngai hoeh toe, bangkongtetpawiteh, touklek hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Hahoi takang a tho hoehnahlan vah Joseph ni capa kahni toun a tawn. Hotnaw teh On kho vaihma Potiphar canu Asenath ni a khe pouh e naw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Joseph ni a camin hah Manasseh telah a phung. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Cathut ni ka tawntamnae hoi apa imthung pueng na pahnim sak telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Hahoi a capa apâhni e min teh Ephraim telah a phung. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Cathut ni kaie runae ram dawk ca catounnaw na tawn sak telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Hottelah Izip ram ka phat e khobu kum teh a loum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Hahoi takang kum kum sari touh Joseph ni a dei tangcoung patetlah a kamtawng teh ram pueng dawk a pha. Hatei, Izip ram pueng dawk rawca ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Hottelah Izip ram pueng teh takang ni koung a pha toteh, Faro koe rawca hei hoi a hram awh. Faro ni Izipnaw pueng koe Joseph koe cet awh nateh, a dei e pueng sak awh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Hahoi takang teh talai van pueng a pha teh, Joseph ni cakang pâtungnae tâsong pueng hah a paawng teh Izipnaw koevah a yo pouh. Izip ram vah takang teh puenghoi a pataw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Talai van pueng dawk takang teh a pataw poung dawkvah, kho tangkuem e tami pueng teh cakang ran hanelah Izip ram e Joseph koe a cei awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakop ni Izip ram vah cakang ao tie a panue teh, a capanaw koevah bangkongmaw sut na kâkhet awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Izip ram vah cakang ao tie ka panue dout laipalah hring awh nahanlah hawvah cet awh nateh mamouh hanlah ran awh haw, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hottelah Joseph hmaunaw hra touh teh cakang ran hanlah Izip ram a cei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hatei, Joseph e a nawngha Benjamin teh a hmaunaw koe Jakop ni cetsak van hoeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, runae kâhmo langvaih ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isarel canaw teh cakang ran hanelah a cei awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh Kanaan ram hai takang teh a tho van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Joseph teh ram thung bawi a tawk teh, hote ram pueng koe cakang kayawtkung lah ao. Hottelah Joseph e hmaunaw a tho awh teh, a hmalah talai khet laihoi a tabo awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Joseph ni a hmaunaw hah a hmu teh a panue. Hatei, ka panuek hoeh e patetlah a kâsak teh, ahnimouh koe lawkkahram lahoi nâhoi maw na tho awh atipouh. Ahnimouh ni cakang ran hanelah Kanaan ram hoi ka tho awh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Joseph ni a hmaunaw hah a panue, hatei ahnimouh ni ahni teh panuek awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Joseph ni ahnimouh kong dawk mang a sak e hah a panue teh ahnimouh koe katuetnaw doeh, khoram caicinae khet hanelah kathonaw doeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni nahoeh bo ka bawipa, na sannaw hah cakang ran hanelah ka tho awh e doeh, ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tami buet touh e capanaw doeh, tami kahawi doeh. Na sannaw heh katuetnaw nahoeh, atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hatei ahni ni ahnimouh koe na yuem awh hoeh, khoram caicinae khet hanelah na kathonaw doeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni, na sannaw hah hmaunawngha hlaikahni touh ka pha awh. Kanaan ram kaawm tami buet touh e capanaw doeh. Kanawpoung e teh apa koe ao. Buet touh e teh awm hoeh toe, ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hatei Joseph ni ahnimouh koe katuetnaw doeh ka tie hah a tang doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hettelah tanouk e lah na o awh han. Kanawpoung e hah hi tho hoehpawiteh Faro hringnae noe lahoi hete hmuen koehoi na tâcawt awh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangmouh dawk lawkkatang ao maw awm hoeh maw, nangmae lawk tanouknae lah nangmouh thung dawk e buet touh patoun awh nateh, na nawngha teh thokhai naseh. Nangmouh teh thongim thung na o awh han rah, hoehpawiteh Faro hringnae noe lahoi katuetnaw katang doeh ka ti han, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hottelah hnin thum touh abuemlah thongim a paung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Apâthum hnin vah Joseph ni ahnimouh koe hettelah sak awh na hring awh han. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Cathut hah ka taki,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tamikalan lah na awm awh pawiteh nangmouh thung dawk buet touh thongim bawt seh. Alouknaw teh ban awh nateh, takang ka tho e ni imthungnaw hanelah cakang hah phawt awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hahoi kanawpoung e hah kai koe thokhai awh. Hat pawiteh, na lawk kamceng vaiteh na dout awh mahoeh, atipouh teh hottelah a sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni hmaunawngha koe sak awh e hah payon poung awh toe, na pahren awh telah kâhei awh lahun nah a lungpuen e ka hmu awh eiteh, ka tarawi ngai awh hoeh. Hatdawkvah hete temdengnae ni na thosin e doeh, telah buet touh hoi buet touh a kâdei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Reuben ni ahnimouh koe camo taranlahoi yonnae sak hanh awh, telah nangmouh koe ka dei nahoehmaw. Na thai ngai awh yawmaw. Hatdawkvah khenhaw! a thipaling phu teh atu maimouh koe hei e lah ao toe, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hatei Joseph ni lawk tâhlat hno lahoi lawk a dei dawkvah, kho a khan awh e hah Joseph ni a thai panuek doeh tie hah ahnimouh ni panuek awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hahoi ahnimouh koehoi alouklah a cei teh a ka. Ahnimouh koe bout a tho teh bout a pato, ahnimouh koehoi Simeon hah a hmu awhnae koe a katek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Joseph ni ahnimouh cawngko dawk cakang cui hane hoi ahnimae tangka hai cawngko dawk pâseng hanelah kâ a poe. Hateh hottelah a sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni cakang la dawk aphu sak awh teh a tâco awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahnimouh thung dawk tami buet touh ni a roe awhnae koe lanaw rawca poe hanelah cawngko a paawng teh tangka hah a hmu, cawngko som dawkvah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hottelah a hmaunawnghanaw koevah, kaie tangka bout a ta awh, khenhaw! hei, kaie cawngko dawk ao hei, telah ati. A lungphuen awh teh Cathut ni hettelah na sak aw hei. Bang ngainae han na vaimoe telah ati awh teh, pâyaw laihoi buet touh hoi buet touh a kâkhet awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kanaan ram a na pa Jakop koevah a pha awh, a kâhmo awh e pueng hah a dei pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hot ram dawk e bawi lah kaawm e ni ka matheng poung lah na pato awh teh, ram katuetnaw lah na o awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hatei, kaimouh ni ahni koe, tamikalannaw doeh. Katuetkung lah khoeroe kaawm awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hmaunawngha hlaikahni touh ka o awh teh, apa e capa lah ka o awh. Buet touh teh awm hoeh toe. Kanawpoung e teh atu Kanaan ram vah apa koevah ao, telah ka ti pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hahoi hote ram dawk e bawi ni hettelahoi tamikalan lah na onae ka panue han. Na hmaunawngha buet touh cettakhai awh nateh, na imthungnaw hanelah cakang hah phawt nateh cet awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kanawpoung e hateh, kai koe thokhai awh, hat pawiteh katuetkung lah awm laipalah tamikalan doeh tie ka panue han. Hate ram dawk hno na yo awh han na ti pou, telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hahoi, cawngkonaw hah a rabu awh lahun navah, pouk laipalah tangka tangoung hah cawngko dawk ao teh, ahnimouh hoi a na pa ni tangka tangoung hah a hmu awh toteh a lungpuen awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A na pa Jakop ni nangmouh ni ka canaw koung na kahma sak awh toe. Joseph awm hoeh toe, Simeon hai awm hoeh toe. Benjamin totouh ceikhai han na kâcai awh. Hete hnonaw pueng ni na ratet toe, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Reuben ni a na pa koevah, nang koe ka thokhai hoehpawiteh, ka capa roi heh thet yawkaw. Ahni heh ka kut dawk na poe nateh, nang koe bout ka thokhai han, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hatei ahni ni, ka capa heh nangmouh koe cet van mahoeh, a hmau a due toe, ahni dueng doeh toe. Na ceinae lam dawk runae na kâhmo pawiteh, ka sampo heh lungmathoenae phuen dawk na loum sak awh han toe, telah ati.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ram thung takang hoe a pataw poung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Izip hoi cakang a thokhai awh e a baw toteh, a na pa ni, bout cet awh nateh mamouh hanelah cakang youn touh bang bout ran awh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hatei, Judah ni ahni koe hote tami ni, na nawngha, nangmouh koe tho van hoehpawiteh, kai minhmai na hmawt awh mahoeh toe telah kamcengcalah kâhruetcuet na poe awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nawnghaca hah kaimouh koe na cetsak pawiteh, cakang teh na ran pouh awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hatei na tha hoehpawiteh, ka cet awh mahoeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahni ni kaimouh koe nangmouh koe na nawnghaca tho van hoehpawiteh, ka minhmai na hmawt mahoeh na ti pouh awh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Isarel ni, bangkongmaw nawngha alouk tawnnae kong patetnaw hah kuekluek na dei awh teh, kai hanelah hnokahawi hoeh poung na sak awh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hatei, ahni ni hote tami ni na pa a hring rah maw, hmaunawngha alouke na tawn awh maw telah kaimae kong hoi imthungkhu kong na pacei awh dawk doeh. Hottelah lawk na pacei e patetlah ka pathung awh e doeh. Na nawnghaca thokhai awh ati hane hah apinimaw sut a panue thai han vaw telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah ni a na pa Isarel koevah, kaimouh hoi nang, nawnghaca hoi dout laipalah hring thai awh nahanlah, nawnghaca teh kaimouh koe kâbang sak nateh, ka cei awh han toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahni kong dawk kai ni kamngai vaiteh kai koe aphu teh na la han, ahni hah nang koe thokhai laipalah na hmalah kangdout sak hoehpawiteh, yonpennae pou ka phu han toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, kânawngkâai awh hanh lei sei, apâhni e patenghai yo tho hane boum hei telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A na pa Isarel ni ahni koe, hattelah pawiteh, hettelah sak awh. Hete ram dawk e hnokahawinaw thingtapi, khoitui, hmuitui, murah, câbuk paw a rakawk katha e, hoi almond pawnaw youn touh phawt awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangmae cawngko dawk tangka a pâban e hah bout sin awh, a payon awh e paka han doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hahoi na nawnghaca hai hrawi awh nateh ahni koe thaw awh nateh bout cet awh leih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hote tami ni Benjamin na tha pouh nahanelah, Athakasaipounge Cathut ni na pahren awh naseh. Ka canaw teh ka sung pawiteh sung yawkaw toung vai khe, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hottelah ahnimouh ni poehno hoi Benjamin hah a ceikhai awh teh, tangka hai let hni hoi a kâken awh. Hahoi a thaw awh teh Izip ram lah a cei awh teh Joseph hmalah bout a kangdue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Joseph ni ahnimouh koe kaawm e Benjamin a hmu tahma vah, imkaringkung hah a kaw teh ahnimanaw hah imthung kâenkhai nateh saring thet nateh coungkacoe rakueng haw. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahnimouh teh kanîthun bu kai koe a ca awh han telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Joseph ni kâ a poe e patetlah ahnimouh ni a tawk awh teh, ahni ni ahnimanaw hah imthung a kâenkhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Joseph ni imthung kâenkhaie lah ao dawkvah, ahnimouh teh a lungpuen awh teh, ahnimouh ni, ahmaloe e kaimae cawngko dawk tangka a pâban dawkvah na kâenkhai e han doeh, maimouh hoi lanaw hoi san lah na man thai nahanelah toe hanlah a kâcai e han doeh, ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Joseph e imkaringkung koe vah a hnai awh teh takhang koe a pato awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Oe, Bawipa, ahmaloe ka tho awh navah, cakang ran hanelah dueng doeh ka tho awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hahoi hettelah ao, roenae rim koe ka pha awh navah, cawngko ka paawng awh boteh kamamae tangka lengkaleng ka kuepcalah ao. Hatdawkvah bout ka thokhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cakang ran nahane tangka alouke hai ka sin awh. Kaimae tangka heh apinimaw cawngko dawk a hruek tie ka panuek awh hoeh, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hatei ahni ni nangmouh koe roumnae awm seh, taket hanh awh. Nangmae cawngko dawk nangmae Cathut hoi na pa e Cathut ni râw na poe awh e doeh, nangmae tangka hah ka hmu doeh, telah ati. Hahoi Simeon hah ahnimouh koe a thokhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hottelah ahni ni ahnimouh hah Joseph imthung a kâenkhai teh tui a poe teh, a khok a kâpasu awh teh, lanaw hah rawca a poe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hahoi aphu awh e poehno hah Joseph bu a ca hanelah a tho hoehnahlan coungkacoe ao awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, hawvah, bu ca han tie hah a panue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Joseph takhang koe a pha toteh a kut dawk kaawm e poehnonaw hah ahni koe a kâenkhai awh teh a hmalah talai khet laihoi a tabut awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahni ni kamthang a pacei, na dei awh e na pa matawng teh a hring rah maw. A tak a dam maw telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni apa na san teh a hring doeh rah, a tak hai a dam rah, atipouh awh. Hahoi a mahmawk a lû a saling awh teh a tabut awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahni ni a khet teh, a nawngha Benjamin a manu e capa hah a hmu, ahni heh na nawnghaca akong na dei awh e hah maw, telah ati. Hahoi ahni ni ka capa, Cathut ni na pahren naseh, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Joseph ni a nawngha a hmu toteh, a lungmathoe teh karangpounglah ka nahane hmuen a tawng. Imrakhan thung a kâen teh hawvah a ka.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A minhmai a pâhla teh bout a tâco teh puenghoi a kâsum. Rawca rakueng awh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hottelah ahni hanlah aloukcalah, ahnimouh hanlah aloukcalah, a coun e Izipnaw hanlah aloukcalah, bangkongtetpawiteh, Izipnaw ni Hebrunaw hoi bu rei cat khai boihoeh, hothateh Izipnaw hanlah panuettho e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hottelah capa kacue teh camin lah ao e hoi kanaw teh cahnoung lah ao e patetlah Joseph hmalah a tahung awh teh, kângai lah a ru awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Joseph ni ahnimouh ham hah amamouh koe a poe sak teh, Benjamin e ham teh ahnimae ham hlak let panga touh hoi apap. Hottelah a nei awh teh, ahni koe hroung a nawm awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni imkaringkung koevah, ahnimouh ni aphu thai yit touh, cawngko pakawi pouh nateh, amamae tangka rip hah amamae cawngko som koe lengkaleng tat pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hahoi kaie manang, ngun manang hah a cahnoung e cawngko som dawkvah cakang phu tangka hoi na ta pouh han, telah kâ a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khodai tahma vah ahnimouh teh amamae lanaw hoi a kamthaw awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kho thung hoi a kamthaw awh teh ahlapoungnae koe a pha awh hoehnahlan, Joseph ni imkaringkung koe thaw nateh ahnimanaw hah pâlei haw. Hahoi na pha toteh ahnimouh koe, bangkongmaw hawinae hah hawihoehnae hoi na patho awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hot hah, kaie bawipa e misur neinae hoi hma lae ka tho hane kong a panuenae nahoehmaw. Het patet lae na o awh e heh puenghoi na payon awh, na ti pouh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hahoi, rek a pha toteh hottelah a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni ahni koe, bawipa, bangkongmaw het patet lae lawk na dei, na sannaw ni hot patet e hno ka sak awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khenhaw! kaimae cawngko som dawk ka hmu awh e tangka hoi Kanaan kho hoi nang koe bout ka thokhai awh nahoehmaw. Bangtelamaw na bawipa im e tangka hoi sui teh ka paru thai awh han namaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na sannaw thung dawk hote hno na hmunae pueng dout seh. Kaimouh hai bawipa e san lah ka o awh yawkaw han, ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahni ni bokheiyah, atu hai nangmae lawk patetlah lawiseh, hno ka hmunae tami hah ka san lah ao vaiteh, nangmouh teh toun kaawm hoeh lah na o awh han telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hat nah tahma vah amamae cawngko lengkaleng a patue awh teh lengkaleng a paawng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahni ni kacuepoung koehoi kanawpoung totouh a tawng pouh. Hattoteh Benjamin e cawngko dawk manang teh a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hat nah tahma vah a khohna a phi awh, lanaw a phu sak awh teh kho dawk a ban awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Judah hoi a hmaunawnghanaw teh Joseph im a pha awh, ama teh haw vah a la o rah. Hahoi a hmalah a tabo awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hahoi Joseph ni bangmaw na sak awh. Kai patetlae tami ni hmalah ka tho hane hno a panue han tie na panuek awh hoeh maw, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Judah ni ka bawipa nang koe bangvai ka dei awh toung. Bangmaw ka pâpha thai awh han. Cathut ni na sannaw yonnae teh a hmu toe. Khenhaw! ka bawipa kaimouh hoi ahnie kut dawk manang a hmu e hoi na san lah doeh ka o awh toe telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hatei ahni ni, hottelah khoeroe ka sak mahoeh, a kut dawk manang a hmunae dueng doeh ka san lah ao vaiteh nangmouh teh na pa koe karoumcalah cet awh, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hat nah tahma vah, Judah ni Joseph hah a hnai teh, Oe ka bawipa, pahren lahoi na san heh, ka bawipa na san heh na hnâthainae koe lawk kam touh na dei sak haw. Na lungkhueknae hah na san koe kaman sak hanh. Bangtelah tetpawiteh, nang teh Faro patetlah doeh na o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka bawipa nang ni, na pa nakunghai, hmaunawngha nakunghai na tawn maw telah na sannaw hah na pacei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kaimouh ni nang koe ka matawngpoung e na pa ka tawn awh. Matawng sawi a sak e camoca ka tawn awh teh buet touh teh a due toe, a manu ni a khe e dawk ahni dueng ao teh a na pa ni a pahren poung, ka ti awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nang ni, ahni ka hmu thai nahanlah kai koe thokhai awh ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka bawipa kaimouh ni tongpaca ni a na pa cettakhai thai mahoeh, bangkongtetpawiteh, a na pa cettakhai pawiteh a na pa a due han doeh ka ti awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hatei, nang ni na nawngha cahnoung nangmouh koe tho van hoehpawiteh, ka mei na hmawt awh mahoeh toe, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hahoi, na sannaw apa koe ka pha awh toteh, ka bawipa, bawipa nange lawk hah ka dei pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Apa ni bout cet awh nateh, mamouh hanelah cakang youn touh bout ran awh, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hatei kaimouh ni ka cet thai awh mahoeh, nawngha cahnoung kaimouh koe tho van pawiteh dueng doeh ka cei awh han. Bangkongtetpawiteh, nawngha cahnoung kaimouh koe tho van hoehpawiteh ahnie mei ka hmawt thai awh mahoeh toe, telah ka ti pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na san kaimae na pa ni, ka yu ni capa kahni touh na khe pouh tie na panue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Buet touh teh kai koehoi a tâco teh koung paset e lah ao mue toe, hahoi teh ahni ka hmawt boihoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hahoi hete camo heh kai koe hoi na ceikhai teh, runae kâhmo pawiteh, ka sampo hah lungmathoenae lahoi phuen dawk na loum sak awh toe, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, tongpaca heh kaimouh koe tho van laipalah na san apa koe ka tho pawiteh, a hringnae hoi tongpaca e hringnae mekkawme lah ao dawkvah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />tongpaca tho van hoeh tie hah a panue tahma kadout han doeh. Hattoteh na sannaw ni na san apa e sampo hah lungmathoenae hoi phuen koe ka loum sak yawkaw han doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bangtelah tetpawiteh, na san ni nang koe ka thokhai hoehpawiteh, a yungyoe na hmalah yonpen e lah ka o han telah apa koe tongpaca kong dawk thoe yo ka bo toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pahren lahoi na san hah tongpaca yueng lah ka bawipa, na san lah na awm sak nateh, tongpaca heh a hmaunaw hoi ban sak leih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, kai koe tongpaca tho van hoehpawiteh bangtelamaw apa koe ka cei thai awh han vaw. Telah hoehpawiteh, apa koe ka phat hane thoenae teh ka hmu payon awh han doeh, telah ati.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joseph teh a teng kaawm e pueng hmalah kâsum thai hoeh toung dawkvah, tami pueng kai koehoi koung tâcawt awh, telah a hram. Hottelah Joseph ni a hmaunawnghanaw koe a kâpanuesak nah yunglam apihai ahni teng kangdout awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kacaipounglah a ka teh, Izipnaw ni a thai awh, Faro imthungkhu ni hai a thai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Joseph ni a hmaunawnghanaw koe kai teh Joseph doeh, apa atu sittouh a hring rah maw, telah ati. Hatei pato thai laipalah a hmaunaw roumkalue awh teh a hmalah sut a kangdue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Joseph ni a hmaunawnghanaw koe, pahren lahoi na hnai awh haw, telah ati. Hateh a hnai awh. Ahni ni na hmaunawngha Joseph, Izip ram vah na yo awh e hah ma.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hatei, hivah cei hanelah na yo awh dawkvah, na lungmathout hanh awh, namamouh hoi namamouh hai kâhmuhma hanh awh, bangkongtetpawiteh, hringnae rungngang hanelah Cathut ni nangmouh hmalah na patoun e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, kum hni touh thung hete ram dawk takang a tho. Kum panga touh a ngai rah. Hat nah thung pueng teh laikawk kanawk awm mahoeh. Canga e hai awm mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hottelah talai van catoun ka tawn hanelah karingkung hoi rungngangnae kalen hoi na hringsakthai awh nahanlah, Cathut ni ahmaloe hoi nangmouh hmalah na patoun toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hottelah hie hmuen koe na kacetsakkung hah nangmouh laipalah Cathut doeh. Ahni ni Faro hanelah na pa lah, imthungkhu kahrawikung, hoi Izip ram pueng kaukkung lah na coung sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Karanglah apa koe cet awh nateh, ahni koe na capa Joseph ni hettelah a dei, Cathut ni Izip ram pueng dawk bawi lah na sak, kai koe tho awh, uet awh hanh leih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Goshen ram vah na o han. Nang nama hoi, na capanaw hoi na mincanaw hoi, na tuhunaw, na maitohu hoi na tawn e puenghoi kai koe roeroe vah na o han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hawvah kai ni na kawk han. Bangkongtetpawiteh hawvah takang kum panga touh ao han rah. Hatdawkvah, na roedeng payon vaih nang hoi na imthung hoi na tawn e pueng hoi telah na ti pouh awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hahoi khenhaw! nangmae mit roeroe hoi ka nawngha Benjamin e mit roeroe ni kaie ka pahni ni a dei lahun e hah na hmu awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Izip ram e ka bawilennae pueng hoi na hmu awh e hno pueng hah apa koe na dei awh vaiteh, apa teh karang poung lah na thokhai awh han, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hahoi a lungtabue hoi Benjamin lungtabue rekkâbet lah a tapam teh a ka. Benjamin ni hai a tapam teh a ka.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A hmaunawngha pueng a paco hnukkhu, a hmaunawnghanaw ni lawk a dei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Joseph e hmaunawnghanaw a tho awh tie kamthang teh Faro im vah a thai awh teh, hote kamthang ni Faro hoi a sannaw a lunghawi sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Faro ni Joseph koe, na hmaunawnghanaw koe, hettelah dei pouh, na saringnaw teh cakang phu sak hoi tâcawt awh nateh, Kanaan ram vah cet awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hahoi na pa hoi a imthung hah kaimouh koe thokhai awh. Izip ram e hnokahawi na poe awh vaiteh, hete ram dawk kaawm e hnokahawipoung hah na ca awh han telah dei pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kâ na poe, hettelah dei pouh. Na canaw hoi na canunaw hane hoi na yunaw hanelah Izip ram hoi lengnaw sin awh nateh, na pa hah thokhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na hnopai kong dawk lungpuen hanh awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Izip ram e hnokahawi pueng teh nangmae doeh, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hahoi teh, Isarel canaw ni hottelah a sak awh. Joseph ni Faro kâpoe e patetlah leng hah ahnimouh koe a poe. Lam vah a ca awh hane hai a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahnimouh abuemlah koe khohna kâthung hanelah a poe. Benjamin koe teh tangka cumthum touh hoi khohna kâthung hane panga touh a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hahoi a na pa koevah, la hra touh, Izip ram hnokahawi kapawtkung hoi lamanu hra touh, lam vah a na pa hane cakang hoi vaiyei hoi canei han kaphawtkung lah a patoun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hottelah a hmaunawnghanaw hah a patoun teh a ceisak. Ahni ni lam vah na kâyue awh hoeh nahanlah kâhruetcuet awh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Izip hoi a tâco awh teh a na pa Jakop koe a pha awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hatei, Joseph a hring rah Izip ram pueng ukkung lah ao telah a dei pouh awh. Jakop a lungmit teh, ahnimouh ni dei e tang thai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hatei, ahni koe Joseph ni lawk dei e pueng hah a dei pouh awh. Hahoi a kâcui hane leng Joseph ni a patawn e hah a hmu toteh, a na pa Jakop e lungthin bout a kâhlaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Isarel ni a khout toe, ka capa Joseph teh a hring doeh rah, ka cei vaiteh, ka due hoehnahlan ka hmu han telah ati.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isarel teh a tawn e pueng hoi a tâco. Beersheba vah a pha teh a na pa Isak Cathut koe thuengnae a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cathut ni karum a mang lah Isarel koe lawk a dei teh, Jakop Jakop telah ati. Ahni ni, hivah ka o, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahni ni, kai teh Cathut nange Cathut lah ka o. Izip ram lah na cei hane hah taket hanh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, miphun kalen lah na coung sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang koe Izip lah ka cei van vaiteh, bout na hrawi han, hahoi Joseph ni na mit dawk na kut a hruek han telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hottelah hoi Jakop teh, Beersheba hoi a tâco teh, Isarel e capanaw ni, a na pa Jakop hoi a canaw hoi a yunaw a kâcui nahanelah Faro ni na patawn e leng dawk na kâcui sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jakop hoi a catoun pueng Kanaan ram e a hmu awh e a saringnaw hoi a hnopainaw hoi a tâcokhai teh Izip vah a cei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A capa hoi a pahringcanaw hoi a miphun a catoun pueng hah Izip vah a kâenkhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hetnaw heh Isarel catoun Izip ram ka kâen e Jakop hoi a canaw e minnaw doeh. Jakop e camin Reuben,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Reuben capanaw teh Hanok, Pallu, Hezron hoi, Karmi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Simeon capanaw teh Jemuel, Jamin, Ohad, Jakhin, Zohar hoi Kanaan napui koehoi e a capa Saul,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Levih capanaw teh Gershon, Kohath hoi, Merari
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Judah capanaw teh Er, Onan, Shelah, Perez hoi Zerah naw doeh. Hateiteh, Er hoi Onan teh Kanaan kho vah a due awh toe. Perez ca roi lah Hezron hoi Hamul ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Issakhar capanaw teh Tola, Puvah, Jashub hoi Shimron,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zebulun capanaw teh Sered, Elon hoi Jaheel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hotnaw teh Leah capanaw a canu Dinah hoi Paddanaram vah Jakop hanlah a khe pouh e naw lah ao. A capanaw hoi a canunaw teh abuemlahoi 33 touh a pha awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gad capanaw teh Ziphion, Haggi, Shuni, Ezbon, Eri, Arodi hoi Areli,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Asher capanaw teh Imnah, Ishua, Ishvi, Beriah hoi a tawncanu Serah hoi Beriah capa teh Heber hoi Malkhiel tinaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hotnaw teh Zilpah Laban ni a canu Leah koevah a poe e capanaw doeh. Ahnimanaw teh tami 16 touh, Jakop ni a khe e naw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jakop yu Rachel capa roi teh Joseph hoi Benjamin doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Joseph ni Izip kho vah ao navah Manasseh hoi Ephraim a sak, hotnaw teh On kho e vaihma Potiphar canu Asenath ni a khe pouh e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Benjamin capanaw teh Bela, Bekher, Ashbel Gera, Naaman Ehi, Rosh, Muppin, Huppim hoi Ard tinaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hotnaw teh Rachel ni Jakop hanlah a khe pouh e capanaw doeh, 14 touh a pha awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Dan capa teh Hushim doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Naphtali capanaw teh Jahzeel, Guni, Jezer hoi Shillem doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hotnaw teh Laban ni a canu Rachel koe a poe e Bilhah ni Jakop hanlah a khe pouh e naw doeh, abuemlahoi 7 touh a pha awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jakop e a capanaw e yu hmai touksin laipalah Jakop koe Izip ram rei ka cet e tami abuemlah 66 touh a pha awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Joseph ni Izip ram e a capa a khe e naw teh kahni touh a pha Jakop imthung Izip ram dawk kâen e pueng teh 70 touh a pha awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jakop ni Goshen lam pâtue hanelah Judah teh Joseph koe hmaloe a ceisak teh, hottelah hoi Goshen ram lah a pha awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Joseph ni a leng hah coungkacoe a rakueng teh Goshen vah a na pa a dawn hanelah a cei. Ahni koe a kâpanuesak teh a lahuen dawk a tapam teh a tapam laihoi ngailawi a ka.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Isarel ni Joseph koevah, na hring rah dawkvah, na mei bout ka hmu toe, atuteh kadout lawi nakunghai yah, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Joseph ni a hmaunawngha a na pa imthung koevah, ka cei vaiteh, Faro koe ka dei pouh vaiteh, ahni koevah, ka hmaunawngha hoi apa imthung Kanaan ram kaawm e hah kai koe a pha awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahnimanaw teh saring kapacanaw lah ao teh tukhoumkung lah ao awh. Tuhu hoi maitohu hoi a tawn awh e pueng a thokhai awh toe telah ka dei han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Faro ni na kaw awh teh, bang thaw maw ouk na tawk awh na tet pouh pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />nangmouh ni na sannaw teh ka mintoenaw koehoi kamtawng teh camoca hoi atu totouh, saring ka paca awh e doeh, telah na ti awh han. Hottelah hoi Goshen ram dawk na o thai awh han, telah atipouh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, tu ka khoum e pueng teh Izip taminaw ni a panuet awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joseph ni Faro koevah, apa hoi ka hmaunawnghanaw tuhu, maitohu a tawn awh e naw pueng hoi Kanaan ram hoi a tho awh, atu Goshen ram vah ao awh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hmaunawnghanaw thung hoi tami panga touh a hrawi teh Faro koe a ceikhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Faro ni a hmaunawnghanaw koevah, bang thaw maw ouk na tawk awh telah a pacei. Ahnimanaw ni Faro koevah, na sannaw teh ka mintoenaw se nah hoi atu totouh tu doeh ka khoum awh, telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni Faro koevah, hete ram dawk o hanelah ka tho awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, takang Kanaan ram dawk a pataw teh saringnaw hanlah hram awm hoeh toe. Hatdawkvah pahren lahoi na sannaw heh Goshen ram dawk na awm sak awh loe, telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Faro ni Joseph a pato teh, na pa hoi na hmaunawnghanaw heh nang koe a tho awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Izip ram teh na hmalah doeh ao, na pa hoi na hmaunawnghanaw teh kahawi e ram dawk awm sak, Goshen ram dawk kho sak awh naseh. Ahnimouh thung dawk hno ka sak thai e tami na panue e awm pawiteh ka saringnaw lathueng kahrawikung lah na ta han, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Joseph ni a na pa Jakop hah a kâenkhai teh Faro hmalah a kangdue sak teh, Jakop ni Faro hah yawhawi a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Faro ni Jakop koevah, kum nâyittouh maw na pha toung telah a pacei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jakop ni Faro koevah kahlawng ka ceinae hnin hoi ka kumnaw teh 130 touh a pha toe. Ka hringnae kumnaw a duem teh a ru, na kakhekungnaw kahlawng ceinae hoi kumnaw hai khout hoeh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jakop ni Faro yawhawi a poe teh Faro koehoi a tâco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hottelah Joseph ni a na pa hoi a hmaunawnghanaw kho a sak sak. Faro ni kâpoe e patetlah Izip ram thung e kahawipoung e ram Raameses ram dawk e ram hah râw lah a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hahoi Joseph ni a na pa hoi a hmaunawnghanaw hoi a na pa imthungnaw pueng, a imthungnaw lahoi canei hanlah a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hote ramnaw pueng dawk canei hane awm hoeh toe. Bangkongtetpawiteh, takang puenghoi a tho. Hote takang dawk Izip ram hoi Kanaan ram teh a patang poung awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Joseph ni cakang a ranae phu, Izip hoi Kanaan ramnaw pueng dawk hoi a hmu e tangkanaw hah Faro im lah a ceikhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Izip ram hoi Kanaan ram e tangkanaw abaw toteh, Izip taminaw pueng teh Joseph koe a tho awh teh, canei hanelah na poe awh haw, bangkongtetpawiteh, bangkongmaw na hmalah ka due awh han vaw, tangka awm hoeh toe, telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Joseph ni saringnaw hah na poe awh. Tangka awm hoeh toung pawiteh, na saringnaw e phu lah canei hanlah na poe awh han, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hat toteh, a saringnaw Joseph koe a ceikhai awh teh, Joseph ni marang, tu, hoi maito hoi lanaw e phu lah canei hanlah a poe. Hatnae kum dawk teh saringnaw e phu lah canei poe e lahoi a kawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kum a baw teh, kum katha dawk ahni koe bout a tho awh teh, kaimouh e tangkanaw pueng abaw toe. Saringnaw a bawnae kong dawk banghai ka paphat awh hoeh. Bawipa na mithmu vah kaimouh miphun hoi lawhmuen laipalah banghai awm hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bangkongmaw na hmalah ka due awh han, kamamouh hai, lawhmuen hai na ran awh ngala lawih, telah pawiteh doeh kamamouh hoi lawhmuennaw pueng Faro e san lah ka o awh han, dout laipalah ka hring awh nahan hoi lawhmuennaw kingdi hoeh nahan, cati na poe leih telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hat toteh, Joseph ni Izip ram naw pueng Faro hanlah a ran pouh. Takang puenghoi a tho dawkvah Izip taminaw pueng ni lawhmuennaw he a yo awh teh, lawhmuennaw teh Faro e lah he ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Taminaw teh Izip ramri avanglah hoi avanglah totouh kho tangkuem dawk a kampuen awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Vaihmanaw e ram teh ran pouh hoeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh vaihmanaw ni Faro koehoi ham hane ao teh Faro ni ham a poe e naw hah a canei awh dawkvah, lawhmuen hah yawt awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hat hnukkhu, Joseph ni taminaw pueng koe, khenhaw! sahnin dawk namamouh hoi na lawhmuennaw hah Faro hanlah ka ran toe. Khenhaw! haw vah cati ao. Talai dawk na tu awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hahoi cakang na hmu awh toteh, hettelah Faro hanlah pung panga pung touh na poe awh vaiteh, pung pali touh e teh namamouh hanelah ao han. Hottelah law dawk bout na tu hane hoi namamouh imthungnaw ca hane hoi na canaw ca hanelah na ta awh han telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni, nang ni kaimouh hringnae na hlout sak toe. Ka bawipa ni na pahren naseh, Faro e san lah ka o awh han telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hottelah Faro ni pung panga pung touh poe e hmunae dawk vah, Izip ram dawk atu totouh Joseph ni phung a sak. Vaihmanaw e lawhmuen dueng teh Faro e lah awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hahoi Isarelnaw teh Izip ram e Goshen ram dawk kho a sak awh teh, hnopainaw a hmu awh teh ca catounnaw moikapap a pungdaw awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jakop teh Izip ram vah kum 17 touh ao. Hottelah Jakop hringnae kum 147 touh a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hattoteh Isarel due nahane a hnai toung dawkvah, a capa Joseph hah a kaw teh a im vah, na lung ka youk pawiteh, pahren lahoi na kut hah ka phai rahak vah tat haw, na pahren nateh kaie lathueng vah atangcalah na sak han, pahren lahoi Izip ram dawk na pakawm hanh lah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mintoenaw koe ka kâhat toteh nang ni Izip ram thung hoi na hrawm na teh, ahnimouh pakawpnae koe na pakawp van loe, telah ati. Ahni ni na dei e patetlah ka sak han, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahni ni kai koe thoekâbo loe, telah atipouh teh, ahni koe thoe a kâbo. Hahoi Isarel teh amae ikhun dawk a tabo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, Joseph koe, Thai haw, na pa a pataw, telah atipouh awh. A capa Manasseh hoi Ephraim hah a hrawi teh a ceikhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jakop koevah, khenhaw! na capa Joseph nang koe a tho, telah atipouh awh. Hatdawkvah, Jakop teh tha a kâsangue teh ikhun dawk a tahung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jakop ni Joseph koevah, Cathut Athakasaipounge teh Kanaan ram, Luz kho dawk kai koevah a kamnue teh yawhawinae na poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kai koevah, ca catounnaw moikapap na poe han, na pungdaw sak han, tamihupui lah na sak han, hahoi hete ram heh ka tho hane na ca catounnaw koe râw lah na poe awh han, telah na ti pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na ca roi Izip ram, nang koe ka tho hoehnahlan na khe e haiyah kaie doeh. Manasseh hoi Ephraim heh, Reuben hoi Simeon patetlah kaie lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Atu hoi bout na khe e teh namae lah ao han. A coe awh han e râw dawk a hmau roi e min hah a hmawng awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hatei, kaie kong dawk, Paddanaram ram hoi ka tho navah, Rachel teh Kanaan ram e lampui dawk, Ephrath kho hoi lam bet ahlanae koe kai teng vah a due teh hawvah Ephrath lam dawk ka pakawp. (Hot teh Bethlehem doeh).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hahoi, Isarel ni Joseph e capa roi a khet teh, hetnaw heh apinaw maw telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Joseph ni a na pa koevah, ahnimouh roi teh ka capa roi doeh, Cathut ni hi vah na poe e roi doeh, telah atipouh. Ahni ni pahren lahoi kai koe thokhai haw, yawhawinae ka poe han, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Isarel teh a matawng toung dawkvah a mit hah kacailah hmawt thai hoeh toe. Hahoi teh, hnai sak haw, ahni ni a tapam teh a paco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Isarel ni Joseph koevah, Na mei hmu hane boehai ka ngaihawi hoeh ei, Cathut ni na ca catounnaw e mei totouh na hmu sak, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Joseph ni ahnimouh teh a na pa e phai rahak hoi a la teh a hmalah a tabo sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hahoi, Joseph ni kahni touh hoi a ceikhai teh Ephraim aranglae kut hoi Isarel e avoilae kut koe lah a ceikhai. Manasseh hah avoilae kut hoi Isarel e aranglae kut koe lah a ceikhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hahoi, Isarel ni a kut a khingkhai teh aranglae kut hah kanaw e Ephraim e a lû dawk a toung teh avoilae kut hah Manasseh e lû van vah a toung. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahni teh camin lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hottelah yawhawinae a poe teh kakhekung Abraham hoi Isak hmalah ouk kaawm pouh e Cathut, sahnin totouh ka hringyung thung pueng na kakawkkung Cathut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hawihoehnae pueng thung hoi na karatangkung kalvantaminaw ni hete camo roi yawhawinae poe naseh, Abraham hoi Isak min teh ahnimouh roi ni sin naseh. Hahoi, talai lungui vah tami moikapap lah pungdaw awh naseh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A na pa ni aranglae kut Ephraim e lû dawk a toung e Joseph ni a hmu navah, a lungkuep hoeh dawkvah a na pa e kut Ephraim lû dawk a toung e hah Manasseh e a lû dawk puen hanelah a tawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Joseph ni a na pa koevah, Apa hettelah mahoeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, het nahoehmaw a camin. Aranglae na kut a lû dawk na toung hane vaw, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hatei, a na pa ni a ngai hoeh dawk, ka panue ka ca, ka panue. Ahni haiyah miphun telah kaw han e kamcu lah ao vaiteh a lentoe van han. Hatei, a nawngha heh ahni hlakvah hoe a lentoe vaiteh a ca catounnaw haiyah miphun moikapap lah ao awh han, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, hote hnin dawk yawhawinae a poe teh, nang pawlawk dawk Cathut ni Isarel teh yawhawinae poe naseh, nang teh Ephraim hoi Manasseh patetlah na tat naseh telah atipouh teh, Manasseh hmalah Ephraim ao sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hottelah, Isarel ni Joseph koevah, khenhaw! meimei ka due toe, hat eiteh Cathut teh nang koevah ao vaiteh mintoenaw e ram dawk na hrawi awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hothloilah, na hmaunawnghanaw hane thung hoi ham buet touh, tahloi hoi licung, Amor taminaw e kut dawk ka la e hah na thap pouh, telah ati.
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakop ni a capanaw a kaw teh ahnimouh koevah, hmalah nangmouh koe ka tho hane hnonaw ka dei thai nahanlah kamkhueng awh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangmouh Jakop canaw kamkhueng awh nateh, na pa Isarel e lawk thai awh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Reuben, nang teh ka ca camin, ka hnosakthainae, ka thaonae, aluepaw, karasangpoung hoi a tha kaawm poung e lah na o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hatei, tui patetlah kâhuen e lungthin na tawn. Taluenae koe na phat mahoeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, nang ni kaie ikhun dawk na luen teh na kamhnawng sak. Ka ikhun hah na tapam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Simeon hoi Levih teh hmaunawngha roi doeh. Lungthin ponae senehmaica ao roinae hmuen koe ao roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka muitha ni ahnimouh roi ni hro e hno dawk kâen mahoeh. Kaie bawilennae ni ahnimouh kamkhuengnae dawk bawk van mahoeh. Ahnimouh ni a lungkhuek teh tami a thei awh, ma ngainae pâlei teh khonaw a raphoe awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahnimouh lungkhueknae hah thoebonae lah awm naseh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, puenghoi a thasai. Ahnimouh lungkhueknae teh thoebo lah awm seh, bangkongtetpawiteh a kâoup awh. Jakop miphun Isarel catoun thung vah ahnimouh kâkayei sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Oe Judah nang teh, hmaunawnghanaw ni pholen e lah na o han. Na kut teh na tarannaw e lahuen dawk na toung han. Na pa e capanaw ni na hmalah a tabut awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Judah teh sendektanca doeh. Ka capa ni moi kei nah koehoi na luen takhai hnukkhu, sendek hoi sendekmanu patetlah ka kâva ni teh ka kamkawn e hah apinimaw a pâhlaw ngam han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siangpahrang sonron ni Judah tâcawt takhai mahoeh. Kâlawk kapoekung hai a khok rahak hoi kahmat mahoeh. Shiloh a tho hoehroukrak teh miphun pueng ni a lawk a ngai pouh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahnie lanaw hah misurkung dawk a pen teh, lacanaw hah misurkung kahawi e dawk a pen. A hni hah misurtui dawk a pâsu teh a khohna hah misur thi dawk a pâsu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A mit teh misurtui hlak a paling teh, a hâ teh sanutui hlak a pangaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zebulun teh long kâhatnae talî teng kho a sak han. Long kâhatnae hmuen lah ao han. A khori teh Zidon totouh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Issakhar teh mon rahak ka tabawk e a tha kaawm poung e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kâhatnae hah ahawi telah a pouk teh, a ram hah a nawm telah a pouk. Hno phu hanlah a loung a rahnoum sak teh, sannaw lah a coung awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dan ni a taminaw hah Isarel miphun rahak vah miphun buet touh patetlah lawkceng han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dan teh lam dawk kaawm e tahrun doeh. Marang kâcui e tami hnuklah rawp sak hanlah lam rahak ao teh, marang khok ka khuek e hrunthoe doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Oe BAWIPA, na rungngangnae teh ouk ka ngaihawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gad teh tarannaw ni tuk vaiteh, ahni ni hai bout a tuk van han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Asher teh canei koelah tawnta vaiteh, siangpahrang canei hanlah a tâco sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Naphtali teh sayuk patetlah dawkcawk vaiteh, lawk kahawi a dei han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Joseph teh a paw kara e a kang lah ao teh, a kangnaw teh rapan naw dawk a yam han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Licung kathoumnaw ni puenghoi a lungmathoe sak awh han. A ka awh teh a maithoe awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hatei ahnie licung teh a thayoun hoeh. Jakop Cathut e thaonae kut hoi thao sak e lah ao, Isarel ka khoum lungsong pawlawk lahoi yah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />na Cathut teh nang kabawm hane hoi Athakasaipounge ni teh talai hoi kalvan yawhawi hoi sanu hoi camo im yawhawi, nang yawhawi poe hanelah tha ao sak e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na pa e yawhawi na poe e ni mintoenaw e yawhawi poe e hlak a yungyoe mon pout totouh, hotnaw teh Joseph e lû dawk ao vaiteh, a hmaunawnghanaw thung hoi kapek e tami koe ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Benjamin teh Asui patetlah doeh ao. Amom vah a kei e moi a ca vaiteh, tangmin vah lawphno hah a thokhai han, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hetnaw teh Isarel miphun hlaikahni touh lah ao awh teh, hethateh a na pa ni ahnimouh koe a dei pouh e lawknaw doeh. Yawhawi a poe teh yawhawi a poe e patetlah buet touh hnukkhu buet touh yawhawi a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hahoi kai teh, ka mintoenaw koe ceikhai e lah ka o han toe. Hit tami Ephron lawhmuen dawk e talungkhu, Kanaan ram e Mamre hma lae Makpelah law e talungkhu, Abraham pakawpnae phuen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hit tami Ephron koevah lawhmuen khuehoi ran e dawk ka mintoenaw koe na pakawp awh loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hawvah Abraham hoi a yu Sarah a pakawp awh teh, hawvah Isak hoi a yu Rebekah a pakawp awh teh, hawvah Leah a pakawp awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lawhmuen hoi a thung e talungkhunaw teh Heth naw koehoi ran e doeh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hottelah Jakop ni a canaw lawk he a thui hnukkhu, a khok hah ikhun dawk a taphawng teh a due teh, mintoenaw koe a pakawp awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hat navah Joseph ni a na pa e mithmai a tabo sin teh ka laihoi a pahnuep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Joseph ni tâsibawinaw hah a na pa e ro pawk hoeh nahanlah tâsi hluk hane kâ a poe. Hatdawkvah, tâsibawinaw ni Isarel e ro teh a pawk hoeh nahanlah tâsi a hluk awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ro a rakuengnae dawk hnin 40 touh a ro. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ro a pawk thai hoeh nahanlah rakuengnae dawk hottelah ouk a ro. Hahoi, hnin 70 touh thung Izipnaw a khuika awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahni khuinae hnin a baw totouh, Joseph ni Faro imthungkhu koe a dei pouh teh, na lung ka youk pawiteh, pahren lahoi Faro hnâthai vah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Apa ni lawk na kam sak, khenhaw! ka due han toe, Kanaan ram phuen ka ran tangcoung e dawk, haw vah na pakawm loe, telah ati. Hatdawkvah, pahren lahoi apa heh na pakawm sak ei, bout ka ban han ati, telah na dei pouh awh, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Faro ni, thoe na bo sak e patetlah na pa teh pakawm, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Joseph teh a na pa pakawp hanelah a cei. Faro e a sannaw pueng, imthungkhu dawk e kacue naw hoi Izip ram e kacuenaw pueng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Joseph imthungkhunaw pueng, a hmaunaw hoi a na pa imthungkhunaw pueng hai a cei awh. A ca kanawnaw hoi tuhunaw hoi maitonaw teh Goshen ram dawk a ta awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahnimouh koevah, rangleng hoi marangransanaw hai a cei awh dawkvah, tamihupui lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jordan namran e Atad cangkatinnae koevah a pha awh. Hote hmuen koe hnin sari touh thung a ka khai awh teh a tahungkhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hote ram Kanaan taminaw ni Atad cangkatinnae koe vah a yu ro a tahungkhai awh e a hmu awh teh, hetheh Izipnaw e tami kadout tahungkhai e kalenpoung doeh, telah ati awh. Hatdawkvah, hote hmuen teh 'Abel-mizraim' telah ati awh. Hot teh, Jordan namran lah kaawm e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A canaw ni kâ a poe e patetlah ahnimouh hanlah a sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A canaw ni Kanaan ram a kâenkhai awh teh Abraham ni kâpakawp nahane hmuen râw lah, Hit tami Ephron koehoi law a ran e Mamre kho hmalah kaawm e Makpelah law e lungngoum thung vah a pakawp awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A na pa a pakawp awh hnukkhu, Joseph hoi a hmaunaw hoi a na pa pakawpnae koe kacetnaw pueng hoi cungtalah Izip ram lah a ban awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Joseph e hmaunaw ni a na pa a due e hah a hmu navah, Joseph ni na hmawt ngai awh hoeh vaiteh, ahni koe sak awh e hnokahawi hoeh e naw pueng hah moi koung na pathung han vaimoe, telah a kâti awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Joseph koe dei hanelah tami a patoun awh teh, na pa ni a due hoehnahlan vah, hettelah Joseph koe na dei pouh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang lathueng yonnae a sak awh eiteh, pahren lahoi na hmaunaw e kâtapoenae hoi a yonnae teh ngaithoum loe, telah kâ na poe. Hatdawkvah, na pa Cathut e sannaw e kâtapoenae hah ngaithoum pouh, telah ati. Ahni koe a dei pouh navah, Joseph teh a ka.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hmaunaw ni hai a cei awh teh a hmalah tabo laihoi khenhaw! na sannaw lah ka o awh, telah atipouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Joseph ni ahnimouh koevah, taket awh hanh awh, Bangkongtetpawiteh, Cathut e yueng lah maw ka o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangmouh ni ka lathueng vah, hawihoehnae hah sak han na kâcai awh, hateiteh, Cathut ni sahnin vah tami moikapap hringnae rungngang hanelah hawinae hah sak han noenae lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, taket awh hanh. Nangmouh hoi na canaw teh pou na kawk awh han, telah atipouh. Hottelah lungmawng sak teh lawk kahawi hoi a pato.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Joseph teh ama hoi a na pa imthungkhunaw hoi Izip ram vah kho a sak awh. Joseph teh kum 110 touh a hring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Joseph ni Ephraim e a canaw, a na mincanaw hoi se thum totouh e a hmu. Manasseh capa, Makhir canaw hai Joseph e khokpakhu dawk a khe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Joseph ni a hmaunawnghanaw koe, ka due han toe, hateiteh, Cathut ni na khet han. Hete ram dawk hoi na tâcokhai awh vaiteh, Abraham, Isak hoi Jakop koe thoebo hoi lawkkam e ram dawk na ceikhai awh han, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Joseph ni Isarel catounnaw hah lawkkamnae a sak teh, Cathut ni na khet awh roeroe han. Ka hru hah hete hmuen koehoi na ceikhai awh han, telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Joseph teh kum 110 touh a pha nah a due. A ro teh kapawk thai hoeh lah a sak awh teh Izip e thingkong buet touh thungvah a ta awh.
  </para>
</usx>
